(1172491, 147473, 509, '<td valign="top">The subject is a little complex here for my taste.  Emphasis on either the bridge in the foreground or that in the background might work better.  Having both in full focus causes my eye to wander.  I think the focal point of the image is the curved portion in the mid-right of the frame, but am not naturally drawn to that point.  Different angles of that subject might yield some interesting results imho.</td>', 'The subject is a little complex here for my taste.  Emphasis on either the bridge in the foreground or that in the background might work better.  Having both in full focus causes my eye to wander.  I think the focal point of the image is the curved portion in the mid-right of the frame, but am not naturally drawn to that point.  Different angles of that subject might yield some interesting results imho.', '2005-02-16 00:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
