(1172980, 146217, 31637, '<td valign="top">beautiful...postcard quality</td>', 'beautiful...postcard quality', '2005-02-16 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172981, 145993, 8284, '<td valign="top">Clean lines on the printed page contribute to the clean feel of the shot.  The blur of the foreground is distracting, once noticed; tighter crop?</td>', 'Clean lines on the printed page contribute to the clean feel of the shot.  The blur of the foreground is distracting, once noticed; tighter crop?', '2005-02-16 02:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172982, 147427, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Like the colors.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Like the colors.', '2005-02-16 02:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172984, 147595, 8284, '<td valign="top">Has the feel of the aftermath of nuclear war.</td>', 'Has the feel of the aftermath of nuclear war.', '2005-02-16 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172985, 147125, 21816, '<td valign="top">Looks a little soft</td>', 'Looks a little soft', '2005-02-16 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172989, 147567, 21816, '<td valign="top">needs to be a little straighter....would of been great</td>', 'needs to be a little straighter....would of been great', '2005-02-16 02:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172991, 147259, 17507, '<td valign="top">Lovely sweeping motion. Weird lighting is very appealing.</td>', 'Lovely sweeping motion. Weird lighting is very appealing.', '2005-02-16 02:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172992, 147444, 31637, '<td valign="top">this could of been so much better if it wasnt for the fuzz. I think the focus could of been better.</td>', 'this could of been so much better if it wasnt for the fuzz. I think the focus could of been better.', '2005-02-16 02:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172993, 147015, 17507, '<td valign="top">What an odd bridge. Great picture and wonderful reflections.</td>', 'What an odd bridge. Great picture and wonderful reflections.', '2005-02-16 02:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172994, 146538, 31637, '<td valign="top">this is one of the nice ones...good composition..nice focus</td>', 'this is one of the nice ones...good composition..nice focus', '2005-02-16 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172995, 147626, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge theme. I like it.<br/>blue border is rather distracting- might have been better with a one-pixel black, five-to-ten-pixel white double border.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge theme. I like it.blue border is rather distracting- might have been better with a one-pixel black, five-to-ten-pixel white double border.', '2005-02-16 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172997, 147454, 8284, '<td valign="top">A little noisy.  Neat Image would help give a nice warm blur to the lights &amp; the reflection on the road.  Nicely cropped &amp; I think the cars ADD to the shot.</td>', 'A little noisy.  Neat Image would help give a nice warm blur to the lights & the reflection on the road.  Nicely cropped & I think the cars ADD to the shot.', '2005-02-16 02:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172998, 147250, 17507, '<td valign="top">Weird angle is making me dizzy. Nice abstraction... but it seriously messes with my sense of balance :(</td>', 'Weird angle is making me dizzy. Nice abstraction... but it seriously messes with my sense of balance :(', '2005-02-16 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1172999, 147314, 31637, '<td valign="top">why the leaves? nice view but the leaves ruined this</td>', 'why the leaves? nice view but the leaves ruined this', '2005-02-16 02:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173000, 147304, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice shot...but the tower should of been shown.</td>', 'nice shot...but the tower should of been shown.', '2005-02-16 02:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173001, 147591, 17507, '<td valign="top">now *that''s* a bridge.<br/>great take on the challenge theme. you have some amazingly cooperative ladybugs!<br/>(7)</td>', 'now *that''s* a bridge.great take on the challenge theme. you have some amazingly cooperative ladybugs!(7)', '2005-02-16 02:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173003, 147296, 31637, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-02-16 02:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173004, 146455, 8284, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a painting.  Nicely done.  Interesting subject.  Deserves to do well.</td>', 'This almost looks like a painting.  Nicely done.  Interesting subject.  Deserves to do well.', '2005-02-16 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173008, 147443, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice crop.  Subtle color.  Nice light/dark contrasts.</td>', 'Nice crop.  Subtle color.  Nice light/dark contrasts.', '2005-02-16 02:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173010, 145822, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice muted tones.</td>', 'Nice muted tones.', '2005-02-16 02:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173011, 147515, 8284, '<td valign="top">Compression artifacts around bridge towers?  Cement curb seems more in focus than the bridge.</td>', 'Compression artifacts around bridge towers?  Cement curb seems more in focus than the bridge.', '2005-02-16 02:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173012, 147136, 17507, '<td valign="top">How nice that the arrow is telling you the proper way to go!</td>', 'How nice that the arrow is telling you the proper way to go!', '2005-02-16 02:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173013, 146460, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like the work of bear_music, which is not to say that I''d be confident naming it as his work in a line-up, but still reminds me of his stuff.</td>', 'looks like the work of bear_music, which is not to say that I''d be confident naming it as his work in a line-up, but still reminds me of his stuff.', '2005-02-16 02:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173014, 146518, 8284, '<td valign="top">Unique.  Not my favorite, but I like the idea.  I''d prefer a really close crop to the sides of your crystal.</td>', 'Unique.  Not my favorite, but I like the idea.  I''d prefer a really close crop to the sides of your crystal.', '2005-02-16 02:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173017, 147458, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the exposure needs work.  Sky is to blown out.  Beautiful structure.  I''d like to see it with different lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the exposure needs work.  Sky is to blown out.  Beautiful structure.  I''d like to see it with different lighting.', '2005-02-16 02:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173018, 147465, 31637, '<td valign="top">more sky than bridge</td>', 'more sky than bridge', '2005-02-16 02:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173021, 146259, 8284, '<td valign="top">Great crop.  Feels like a really wide picture.</td>', 'Great crop.  Feels like a really wide picture.', '2005-02-16 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173022, 147516, 31637, '<td valign="top">good color, nice landscape...your bridge isnt the primary subject so I have to deduct one point...but you should score high with this one</td>', 'good color, nice landscape...your bridge isnt the primary subject so I have to deduct one point...but you should score high with this one', '2005-02-16 02:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173023, 147268, 31637, '<td valign="top">creative...nice job</td>', 'creative...nice job', '2005-02-16 02:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173024, 147403, 8284, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective.  Great color.  Good lighting.  Very nice.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective.  Great color.  Good lighting.  Very nice.', '2005-02-16 02:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173025, 147338, 31637, '<td valign="top">cute kid...nice composition...but the bridge isnt the primary subject</td>', 'cute kid...nice composition...but the bridge isnt the primary subject', '2005-02-16 02:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173027, 146817, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice job with the shutter...too much darkness here for me.</td>', 'nice job with the shutter...too much darkness here for me.', '2005-02-16 02:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173028, 146171, 31637, '<td valign="top">hidden wheres waldo bridge photo.</td>', 'hidden wheres waldo bridge photo.', '2005-02-16 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173029, 146921, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fascinating to compare this to the night shot from the same angle. Nicely composed, a little flat in tonalities.</td>', 'Fascinating to compare this to the night shot from the same angle. Nicely composed, a little flat in tonalities.', '2005-02-16 02:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173030, 145594, 31637, '<td valign="top">could of used better focus</td>', 'could of used better focus', '2005-02-16 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173031, 147604, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice work, perhaps a little TOO foggy, but what can ya do?</td>', 'Nice work, perhaps a little TOO foggy, but what can ya do?', '2005-02-16 02:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173033, 146989, 31637, '<td valign="top">fuzzy..could of been a great shot</td>', 'fuzzy..could of been a great shot', '2005-02-16 02:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173035, 147618, 31637, '<td valign="top">this wont fair well in this challenge</td>', 'this wont fair well in this challenge', '2005-02-16 02:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173036, 147302, 8284, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Makes the shot fit the challenge.  I wish SOMEthing was clearly in focus here - maybe the olive.  I think that would do wonders for this shot.  Not sure how I feel about the flower, but having something else in the shot is a good idea.  A quick run thru Neat Image helps a lot.</td>', 'Love the title.  Makes the shot fit the challenge.  I wish SOMEthing was clearly in focus here - maybe the olive.  I think that would do wonders for this shot.  Not sure how I feel about the flower, but having something else in the shot is a good idea.  A quick run thru Neat Image helps a lot.', '2005-02-16 02:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173038, 147580, 31637, '<td valign="top">sharp and a good focus....this should score high</td>', 'sharp and a good focus....this should score high', '2005-02-16 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173040, 146423, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice...but not much of a bridge</td>', 'nice...but not much of a bridge', '2005-02-16 02:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173041, 147617, 8284, '<td valign="top">Your subject kind of disappears into the background.  You need a different perspective, or different lighting - something...</td>', 'Your subject kind of disappears into the background.  You need a different perspective, or different lighting - something...', '2005-02-16 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173042, 145885, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice photo...good title too</td>', 'nice photo...good title too', '2005-02-16 02:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173043, 146912, 31637, '<td valign="top">good color here....you could of gotten closer to make this a ten</td>', 'good color here....you could of gotten closer to make this a ten', '2005-02-16 02:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173044, 147140, 8284, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but I can''t help feeling another crop would work better.  Strong shadow/light play - what about B&amp;W?  The spotlight on the right distracts.</td>', 'This is nice, but I can''t help feeling another crop would work better.  Strong shadow/light play - what about B&W?  The spotlight on the right distracts.', '2005-02-16 02:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173045, 147586, 8284, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Too small.  Highlighted area seems over-exposed.</td>', 'Too dark.  Too small.  Highlighted area seems over-exposed.', '2005-02-16 02:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173046, 147631, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice cast to the colors.  Needs better focus, I think.</td>', 'Nice cast to the colors.  Needs better focus, I think.', '2005-02-16 02:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173054, 147610, 27735, '<td valign="top">Hey, is this Deception Pass...cool place and I like the grain in this case.</td>', 'Hey, is this Deception Pass...cool place and I like the grain in this case.', '2005-02-16 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173055, 146486, 8284, '<td valign="top">Neat Image would have done SO much for this image.  Love the light.  Love the color.  Love the crop.  So close...</td>', 'Neat Image would have done SO much for this image.  Love the light.  Love the color.  Love the crop.  So close...', '2005-02-16 02:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173060, 147163, 16790, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is nice, but I think the composition leaves a little to be desired.  While the tower is the main focus (as suggested by the title), the bridge feels less than secondary and really is almost more of an eyesore than an important part of the photo.  The sky looks great, but the light seems a tad harsh.</td>', 'The focus on this is nice, but I think the composition leaves a little to be desired.  While the tower is the main focus (as suggested by the title), the bridge feels less than secondary and really is almost more of an eyesore than an important part of the photo.  The sky looks great, but the light seems a tad harsh.', '2005-02-16 02:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173062, 146996, 31637, '<td valign="top">fuzzy..nice composition though</td>', 'fuzzy..nice composition though', '2005-02-16 02:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173063, 146989, 8284, '<td valign="top">The backdrop looks like a painting.  I like this one a lot.  The grainy feel works well, as does the B&amp;W, though I''d like to see the color version.</td>', 'The backdrop looks like a painting.  I like this one a lot.  The grainy feel works well, as does the B&W, though I''d like to see the color version.', '2005-02-16 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173064, 147606, 16790, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a bit oversharpened, as there is a lot of haloing, but the effect works.  Very lovely scenery, with nice colours.</td>', 'This appears to be a bit oversharpened, as there is a lot of haloing, but the effect works.  Very lovely scenery, with nice colours.', '2005-02-16 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173067, 147562, 8284, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp feel to this shot.  Glad you didn''t try to lighten up the shadows under the bridge.</td>', 'Clean and crisp feel to this shot.  Glad you didn''t try to lighten up the shadows under the bridge.', '2005-02-16 02:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173068, 146485, 16790, '<td valign="top">This has the opportunity to be a very moving shot, but the light seems to be a bit too harsh to set the mood.  The narrow crop is also distracting.  The focus, however, is great, and the idea fits the challenge.</td>', 'This has the opportunity to be a very moving shot, but the light seems to be a bit too harsh to set the mood.  The narrow crop is also distracting.  The focus, however, is great, and the idea fits the challenge.', '2005-02-16 02:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173069, 147296, 20786, '<td valign="top">Very cool. This had  a 30''s/40''s film noir feel to it to me.</td>', 'Very cool. This had  a 30''s/40''s film noir feel to it to me.', '2005-02-16 02:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173070, 147128, 8284, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of "True Lies".  Interesting image.  The guy on the short piece is distracting for me.</td>', 'Reminds me of "True Lies".  Interesting image.  The guy on the short piece is distracting for me.', '2005-02-16 02:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173072, 147504, 16790, '<td valign="top">The subject is great and the composition is pretty pleasing to the eye; the photo definitely meets the challenge.  However, the white balance appears to be off, and the undersaturation doesn''t really work - it would be nicer either fully coloured or converted to b&amp;w.  For some reason, my eye doesn''t like the space to the left of the bridge - it wants to see the bridge go to the edge of the photo.  The setting is great, though, and the focus and DOF are excellent.</td>', 'The subject is great and the composition is pretty pleasing to the eye; the photo definitely meets the challenge.  However, the white balance appears to be off, and the undersaturation doesn''t really work - it would be nicer either fully coloured or converted to b&w.  For some reason, my eye doesn''t like the space to the left of the bridge - it wants to see the bridge go to the edge of the photo.  The setting is great, though, and the focus and DOF are excellent.', '2005-02-16 02:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173074, 146572, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I like the structure.  Dirty snow adds to the shot.  Is it my bloodshot eyes, or is there just the slightest bit of pink in the sky?</td>', 'Nice work.  I like the structure.  Dirty snow adds to the shot.  Is it my bloodshot eyes, or is there just the slightest bit of pink in the sky?', '2005-02-16 02:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173075, 145807, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  This somehow manages to convey warmth of light while still feeling rather cold and gloomy - the water and boats perhaps?  Excellent composition, and the deep depth of field works beautifully.  I can see people complaining about the slight grain, but I like it.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  This somehow manages to convey warmth of light while still feeling rather cold and gloomy - the water and boats perhaps?  Excellent composition, and the deep depth of field works beautifully.  I can see people complaining about the slight grain, but I like it.', '2005-02-16 02:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173078, 147447, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear - love the diagonal line that dominates the photo.  Exposure is great, colours are right on, and the focus is sharp throughout.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very crisp and clear - love the diagonal line that dominates the photo.  Exposure is great, colours are right on, and the focus is sharp throughout.  Nice job!', '2005-02-16 03:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173082, 147309, 31637, '<td valign="top">good lighting, and great color...small bridge though</td>', 'good lighting, and great color...small bridge though', '2005-02-16 03:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173085, 147362, 16790, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see a bit more highlighting on the bridge and in the water, but this is nonetheless a beautiful scene.  I think slightly less saturation might be nice, as the overwhelming brown/sepia makes it feel quite muddy.  That said, the details in this really make it - the trees, the slight glow in the sky, the crisp focus on the bridge.  Overall very nicely done.</td>', 'I would have loved to see a bit more highlighting on the bridge and in the water, but this is nonetheless a beautiful scene.  I think slightly less saturation might be nice, as the overwhelming brown/sepia makes it feel quite muddy.  That said, the details in this really make it - the trees, the slight glow in the sky, the crisp focus on the bridge.  Overall very nicely done.', '2005-02-16 03:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173087, 147491, 16790, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear.. excellent colours.  This photo feels like it''s tilted a bit, but other than that this is some excellent work.  Very pretty scene well captured.</td>', 'Crisp and clear.. excellent colours.  This photo feels like it''s tilted a bit, but other than that this is some excellent work.  Very pretty scene well captured.', '2005-02-16 03:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173093, 147592, 28476, '<td valign="top">A good night exposure, but there could be more in this picture.<br/>After all it is only a brigge, and not so interesting one.</td>', 'A good night exposure, but there could be more in this picture.After all it is only a brigge, and not so interesting one.', '2005-02-16 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173094, 147026, 30457, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset. nice use of the bridge.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset. nice use of the bridge.', '2005-02-16 03:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173095, 147157, 28476, '<td valign="top">This bridge is allways photographed right from here.<br/>I have seen this pisture att least 10000 times.<br/> <br/>A good picture. There is absolutely nothing wrong with it...</td>', 'This bridge is allways photographed right from here.I have seen this pisture att least 10000 times. A good picture. There is absolutely nothing wrong with it...', '2005-02-16 03:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173097, 147125, 28875, '<td valign="top">Like the monochrome, but looks out of focus.</td>', 'Like the monochrome, but looks out of focus.', '2005-02-16 03:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173098, 146620, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, tranquil setting, and you''ve done well on the focus.  The colour seems just a tad cool, though, and the bleached sky is a little distracting.  Was it foggy or gloomy?  You might try warming the photo a bit in post processing or re-shooting on a more pleasant day.  Nice shot, though - the composition is very good, and the photo meets the challenge well.</td>', 'This is a nice, tranquil setting, and you''ve done well on the focus.  The colour seems just a tad cool, though, and the bleached sky is a little distracting.  Was it foggy or gloomy?  You might try warming the photo a bit in post processing or re-shooting on a more pleasant day.  Nice shot, though - the composition is very good, and the photo meets the challenge well.', '2005-02-16 03:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173100, 147621, 28476, '<td valign="top">OK.<br/>I totaly missed the point in this one.<br/></td>', 'OK.I totaly missed the point in this one.', '2005-02-16 03:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173102, 147622, 16790, '<td valign="top">While this does meet the challenge, this isn''t a particularly interesting shot for a couple of reasons.  The first is that you can pretty clearly see the surroundings, and there is no suggestion of a never ending bridge, or of isolation - if it were darker around the edges, this would be a more dramatic and therefore more interesting shot.  Secondly, the colour is very drab and washed out.  A black and white conversion or some colour work would drastically improve the appeal.  Good effort, though :)</td>', 'While this does meet the challenge, this isn''t a particularly interesting shot for a couple of reasons.  The first is that you can pretty clearly see the surroundings, and there is no suggestion of a never ending bridge, or of isolation - if it were darker around the edges, this would be a more dramatic and therefore more interesting shot.  Secondly, the colour is very drab and washed out.  A black and white conversion or some colour work would drastically improve the appeal.  Good effort, though :)', '2005-02-16 03:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173103, 146986, 28875, '<td valign="top">I''ve walked across this bridge,Istanbul. would like to have seen more of bridge.</td>', 'I''ve walked across this bridge,Istanbul. would like to have seen more of bridge.', '2005-02-16 03:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173104, 147290, 28476, '<td valign="top">More flowers and this would have been great.</td>', 'More flowers and this would have been great.', '2005-02-16 03:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173105, 147554, 28476, '<td valign="top">The flash ruins the photo.</td>', 'The flash ruins the photo.', '2005-02-16 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173106, 147311, 16241, '<td valign="top">very cool!  i must learn some new adjectives!</td>', 'very cool!  i must learn some new adjectives!', '2005-02-16 03:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173107, 147023, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like what you tried to do here, but there are a few elements that could use some improvement.  Firstly, the white balance is off - everything has a strange cast to it that is just not appealing.  It feels dreary, depressing, and in general not very inviting.  Second, the trees don''t provide atmosphere as much as annoyance.. they are out of focus and blocking the view.  Focus is a problem here.  If you had been standing a bit to the right and knelt down a bit, the view of the bridge through the trees would have been much better.  The colour could be fixed with post processing, or maybe conversion to b&amp;w.  This has a lot of potential, and it does meet the challenge - good effort.</td>', 'I like what you tried to do here, but there are a few elements that could use some improvement.  Firstly, the white balance is off - everything has a strange cast to it that is just not appealing.  It feels dreary, depressing, and in general not very inviting.  Second, the trees don''t provide atmosphere as much as annoyance.. they are out of focus and blocking the view.  Focus is a problem here.  If you had been standing a bit to the right and knelt down a bit, the view of the bridge through the trees would have been much better.  The colour could be fixed with post processing, or maybe conversion to b&w.  This has a lot of potential, and it does meet the challenge - good effort.', '2005-02-16 03:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173108, 147157, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome perspective and lighting. You were in the right place at the right time. Hope to see this in the top 10. I don''t like how saturated the red is, but may be natural.</td>', 'Awsome perspective and lighting. You were in the right place at the right time. Hope to see this in the top 10. I don''t like how saturated the red is, but may be natural.', '2005-02-16 03:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173109, 147261, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is very well exposed, and so crisp and clean!  I really like the sepia toning; it sets the atmosphere.  Good job!</td>', 'This is very well exposed, and so crisp and clean!  I really like the sepia toning; it sets the atmosphere.  Good job!', '2005-02-16 03:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173110, 145650, 28476, '<td valign="top">If the music elevates the mind, there probably is something else than a loudspeaker.<br/>Nice photo of a loudspeaker though.</td>', 'If the music elevates the mind, there probably is something else than a loudspeaker.Nice photo of a loudspeaker though.', '2005-02-16 03:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1173113, 147601, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the colours are fantastic, and the composition is excellent.  It''d be nice if there was a bit more light on the girl, but that''s pretty minor as she is still very clear and the darkness makes a nice contrast with the bright background.  I love the colour cast to this.  Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful - the colours are fantastic, and the composition is excellent.  It''d be nice if there was a bit more light on the girl, but that''s pretty minor as she is still very clear and the darkness makes a nice contrast with the bright background.  I love the colour cast to this.  Very nice!', '2005-02-16 03:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
