(1173120, 147178, 16790, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  This bridge looks more than a little scary to me... and I love it.  Good job working with the fog - the brightness and contrast are perfect to my eyes, and the focus is right on.</td>', 'Great capture!  This bridge looks more than a little scary to me... and I love it.  Good job working with the fog - the brightness and contrast are perfect to my eyes, and the focus is right on.', '2005-02-16 03:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
