(1173131, 147479, 16790, '<td valign="top">This looks as if it may be a tad oversharpened, or else oddly resized.  The bridge seems just a little overexposed - it''s kind of hard to look at because it feels bright - but the setting is quite lovely, and the blues of the sky reflecting in the background look beautiful.  I would like to see the scene from a few steps back, with more of the bridge, but otherwise this is a good effort.</td>', 'This looks as if it may be a tad oversharpened, or else oddly resized.  The bridge seems just a little overexposed - it''s kind of hard to look at because it feels bright - but the setting is quite lovely, and the blues of the sky reflecting in the background look beautiful.  I would like to see the scene from a few steps back, with more of the bridge, but otherwise this is a good effort.', '2005-02-16 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
