(1173813, 147128, 18080, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge<br/>a 10 from me<br/>my only crit (if i have give one) i can''t decide if i like the horizon at the same level as the bridge. It is a strange one. I have tried to imagine if it would look better above or below the bridge or if that would make it look a bit strange. <br/>I have decided that as you are the photographer you have made the correct decsion. Whatever i ramble on about doesn''t take away from the fact that this is a fantastic capture.<br/>Good luck with the challenge. If this doesn''t take a ribbon then there is no justice. (unless you already have a bucket load of ribbons and in that case give me one!!!)<br/>Once again well done on such a great picture.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'My favorite of this challengea 10 from memy only crit (if i have give one) i can''t decide if i like the horizon at the same level as the bridge. It is a strange one. I have tried to imagine if it would look better above or below the bridge or if that would make it look a bit strange. I have decided that as you are the photographer you have made the correct decsion. Whatever i ramble on about doesn''t take away from the fact that this is a fantastic capture.Good luck with the challenge. If this doesn''t take a ribbon then there is no justice. (unless you already have a bucket load of ribbons and in that case give me one!!!)Once again well done on such a great picture. Kev', '2005-02-16 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
