(1174068, 147631, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors in this shot a lot, but it''s a bit soft in focus, which is very common with low-light shots.  I actually like the little tree in the foreground, but I think she shot could be improved by including less of the road in the bottom-left corner.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors in this shot a lot, but it''s a bit soft in focus, which is very common with low-light shots.  I actually like the little tree in the foreground, but I think she shot could be improved by including less of the road in the bottom-left corner.', '2005-02-16 11:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
