(1174112, 145374, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection and nice colors in the lights.  I love experimenting with shots like these.  The only thing I think I''d try to do differently, and this is entirely personal preference, understand, is to try to darken the shrub in the foreground.  Something about the lighter brown compared to the black silhouettes in the back feels a bit out of place.  Upping the contrast a bit might help this.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection and nice colors in the lights.  I love experimenting with shots like these.  The only thing I think I''d try to do differently, and this is entirely personal preference, understand, is to try to darken the shrub in the foreground.  Something about the lighter brown compared to the black silhouettes in the back feels a bit out of place.  Upping the contrast a bit might help this.', '2005-02-16 11:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174115, 147609, 13305, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of the lights on the water</td>', 'Love the reflection of the lights on the water', '2005-02-16 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1);
