(1174129, 147026, 13381, '<td valign="top">The colors here are gorgeous -- really stunning -- but the railing on the bridge looks a bit out of focus.  Maybe it''s just the haloing of the backlighting making it look so, but I think it''s a bit soft.  I think I''d prefer to see the railing sillhouetted a bit more, as well, darker against the sky.</td>', 'The colors here are gorgeous -- really stunning -- but the railing on the bridge looks a bit out of focus.  Maybe it''s just the haloing of the backlighting making it look so, but I think it''s a bit soft.  I think I''d prefer to see the railing sillhouetted a bit more, as well, darker against the sky.', '2005-02-16 11:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
