(1174171, 146654, 32239, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.<br/> <br/>I would have waited until there were no cars though.  I know it would have taken a great deal of patience, but the cars on the left and on the bridge distract you from the Rockies.  <br/> <br/>Too bad it wasn''t a clear blue sky that day too.  Would have brought the colour of the grass, bridge and snow atop of the Rockies more alive.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice composition. I would have waited until there were no cars though.  I know it would have taken a great deal of patience, but the cars on the left and on the bridge distract you from the Rockies.   Too bad it wasn''t a clear blue sky that day too.  Would have brought the colour of the grass, bridge and snow atop of the Rockies more alive. ', '2005-02-16 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
