(1174538, 146608, 33560, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite understand why, but this doesn''t do it for me.  I think it looks too cluttered for the rhythmic elements to be clearly comprehended.  The lighting hurts the photo in so many ways.  I understand that it''s not an element in the photographer''s control, but I imagine the bridge could look much better in diffuse light of a cloudy day or when the sun is just below the horizon.</td>', 'Can''t quite understand why, but this doesn''t do it for me.  I think it looks too cluttered for the rhythmic elements to be clearly comprehended.  The lighting hurts the photo in so many ways.  I understand that it''s not an element in the photographer''s control, but I imagine the bridge could look much better in diffuse light of a cloudy day or when the sun is just below the horizon.', '2005-02-16 13:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
