(1174753, 147302, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear what is to be found at the bottom of the glass.  I guess that could be the point, except the title - if we take it at face value - suggests otherwise. It''s clever construction is completely wasted on me from the twee violet background with rose to the surreal green environment in which the only element I can identify appears to be a blue wastebasket.</td>', 'It''s not clear what is to be found at the bottom of the glass.  I guess that could be the point, except the title - if we take it at face value - suggests otherwise. It''s clever construction is completely wasted on me from the twee violet background with rose to the surreal green environment in which the only element I can identify appears to be a blue wastebasket.', '2005-02-16 13:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
