(1174838, 145318, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. The gull is a little distraction. I would also have cropped more off the bottom. The full reflection draws my eye from the primary subject.</td>', 'Nice color and composition. The gull is a little distraction. I would also have cropped more off the bottom. The full reflection draws my eye from the primary subject.', '2005-02-16 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174839, 147568, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. And nicely realized. Great bokeh.  I wonder where one finds this flora and fauna in early February.  I suppose it must be a submission from the southern hemisphere.</td>', 'Very nice idea. And nicely realized. Great bokeh.  I wonder where one finds this flora and fauna in early February.  I suppose it must be a submission from the southern hemisphere.', '2005-02-16 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
