(1174847, 147444, 2022, '<td valign="top">Fantatsic picture, I like the colors and the composition. One of my favorites in this challenge (10)</td>', 'Fantatsic picture, I like the colors and the composition. One of my favorites in this challenge (10)', '2005-02-16 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174848, 146586, 33560, '<td valign="top">Strongly architectural bridge, but the angle seems to do justice neither to the repeating architectural elements on each span nor to the repeating spans themselves.  Mostly the photo is water, sky, and piers - each of which is uninteresting.</td>', 'Strongly architectural bridge, but the angle seems to do justice neither to the repeating architectural elements on each span nor to the repeating spans themselves.  Mostly the photo is water, sky, and piers - each of which is uninteresting.', '2005-02-16 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174849, 147159, 32792, '<td valign="top">I guess I know whose pic is this! LoL!!!!<br/>Good choice on the B&amp;W!!! 8</td>', 'I guess I know whose pic is this! LoL!!!!Good choice on the B&W!!! 8', '2005-02-16 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174851, 146175, 29256, '<td valign="top">Shame the light is there on the left. Picture sshould be aligned perfectly with the horizon or a more acute angle. Choice of B&amp;W is a good one but the dark coror in the right is troublesome.</td>', 'Shame the light is there on the left. Picture sshould be aligned perfectly with the horizon or a more acute angle. Choice of B&W is a good one but the dark coror in the right is troublesome.', '2005-02-16 14:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174852, 147585, 32792, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!!!!! 8</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!!!!! 8', '2005-02-16 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174855, 147057, 29256, '<td valign="top">Clean, clear and crisp. Great blues.</td>', 'Clean, clear and crisp. Great blues.', '2005-02-16 14:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174859, 146928, 2022, '<td valign="top">I get the idea here. However, it seems to me that your idea is mainly conveyed via the title, not the pciture itself. Good attempt nonetheless (5)</td>', 'I get the idea here. However, it seems to me that your idea is mainly conveyed via the title, not the pciture itself. Good attempt nonetheless (5)', '2005-02-16 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174860, 147516, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am reminded of a feng shui principle of combining round and square elements. I like the color - even the oversaturation.  The fact that the sky is pure white is fine since it is mostly filled with palm trees.  And I appreciate the photographer''s choice of not chopping off the light fixture at the top of the standard.  There is something different, refreshing about this take on bridges</td>', 'I am reminded of a feng shui principle of combining round and square elements. I like the color - even the oversaturation.  The fact that the sky is pure white is fine since it is mostly filled with palm trees.  And I appreciate the photographer''s choice of not chopping off the light fixture at the top of the standard.  There is something different, refreshing about this take on bridges', '2005-02-16 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174862, 145592, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes less is more.</td>', 'Sometimes less is more.', '2005-02-16 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174863, 147424, 32792, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but colors are somewhat faded! could have worked on the colors (curves, levels, saturation and stuff)</td>', 'Looks good, but colors are somewhat faded! could have worked on the colors (curves, levels, saturation and stuff)', '2005-02-16 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174865, 147158, 32792, '<td valign="top">Very good! very good indeed! 8</td>', 'Very good! very good indeed! 8', '2005-02-16 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174869, 147373, 2022, '<td valign="top">Its a great picture in many ways. Good compositions, appealing colors. I am not sure though about connection to the challeneg theme...I give it 7 anyhow and would give more in a more relevant challenge theme.</td>', 'Its a great picture in many ways. Good compositions, appealing colors. I am not sure though about connection to the challeneg theme...I give it 7 anyhow and would give more in a more relevant challenge theme.', '2005-02-16 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174871, 147490, 33560, '<td valign="top">Remarkable contrast between industrial wasteland and nature''s ability to engulf and redeem the worst of our aesthetic sins.  Also I like the water.</td>', 'Remarkable contrast between industrial wasteland and nature''s ability to engulf and redeem the worst of our aesthetic sins.  Also I like the water.', '2005-02-16 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174872, 147442, 2022, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I love the colors and the composition. One of my favorites in this challenge (10)</td>', 'Fantastic, I love the colors and the composition. One of my favorites in this challenge (10)', '2005-02-16 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174877, 147556, 31533, '<td valign="top">I like the idea though I would have included more sky. Could be sharper too.</td>', 'I like the idea though I would have included more sky. Could be sharper too.', '2005-02-16 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174879, 146171, 31533, '<td valign="top">Is this a bridge ?</td>', 'Is this a bridge ?', '2005-02-16 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174881, 147015, 2022, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture. I hoped mine would ribbon, now I know it won''t. Yours should. (10)</td>', 'Fantastic picture. I hoped mine would ribbon, now I know it won''t. Yours should. (10)', '2005-02-16 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174883, 147001, 33560, '<td valign="top">If this competition were not about bridges, I think I''d vote to have the focus be closer to the bridge than the bottom of the fingerboard (if that''s what it''s called.)  But if the photo really was not taken for this competition, it is doubly hard to undersand the point at which it focusses (unless it is a physical limitation of the equipment.)  The composition and lighting are very strong - I like the warm and cool lighting.  The top 20% iof the photo adds nothing.</td>', 'If this competition were not about bridges, I think I''d vote to have the focus be closer to the bridge than the bottom of the fingerboard (if that''s what it''s called.)  But if the photo really was not taken for this competition, it is doubly hard to undersand the point at which it focusses (unless it is a physical limitation of the equipment.)  The composition and lighting are very strong - I like the warm and cool lighting.  The top 20% iof the photo adds nothing.', '2005-02-16 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174884, 147490, 31533, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark on my screen.</td>', 'A bit too dark on my screen.', '2005-02-16 14:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174888, 146455, 29256, '<td valign="top">Bridge looks broken due to the heavy lighted/shaded areas around the tressels</td>', 'Bridge looks broken due to the heavy lighted/shaded areas around the tressels', '2005-02-16 14:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174889, 145464, 2022, '<td valign="top">Hmm...your picture is so very small....maybe that''s why I really cannot see the connection to the challenge theme...</td>', 'Hmm...your picture is so very small....maybe that''s why I really cannot see the connection to the challenge theme...', '2005-02-16 14:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174890, 147303, 29256, '<td valign="top">Too much going on. Not sure where to focus.</td>', 'Too much going on. Not sure where to focus.', '2005-02-16 14:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174891, 147586, 2022, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Too bad that it is so small. Also the lighting is problematic. I wish I could give it more than 3. Good try though.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Too bad that it is so small. Also the lighting is problematic. I wish I could give it more than 3. Good try though.', '2005-02-16 14:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174893, 147030, 33560, '<td valign="top">Architecturally this is a very strong bridge, taken in very good light.  I happen to find the people distracting (though what is one to do?)  And I wonder if the photo wouldn''t be just a bit better from a step or two closer up.</td>', 'Architecturally this is a very strong bridge, taken in very good light.  I happen to find the people distracting (though what is one to do?)  And I wonder if the photo wouldn''t be just a bit better from a step or two closer up.', '2005-02-16 14:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174895, 147295, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, too bad it''s not sharp. 6.</td>', 'Nice picture, too bad it''s not sharp. 6.', '2005-02-16 14:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174896, 147331, 29256, '<td valign="top">I know it could not be helped from where you were...(stopping in the middle of the road) but pic is too busy on the left. IMO this lacks compositional balance. If there were not so many cars on the left. Good use of DOF.</td>', 'I know it could not be helped from where you were...(stopping in the middle of the road) but pic is too busy on the left. IMO this lacks compositional balance. If there were not so many cars on the left. Good use of DOF.', '2005-02-16 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174900, 147311, 2022, '<td valign="top">This is so fantastic. I like the composition,b/w rendition, the eerie aura about it. Definitely a 10. Darn and I thought I stood a chance for a ribbon in this challenge...poor me...</td>', 'This is so fantastic. I like the composition,b/w rendition, the eerie aura about it. Definitely a 10. Darn and I thought I stood a chance for a ribbon in this challenge...poor me...', '2005-02-16 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174901, 147491, 29256, '<td valign="top">Overall very nice, almost looks painted in the background. Boats look out of focus, were you in a shaded area causing a longer shutter speed?</td>', 'Overall very nice, almost looks painted in the background. Boats look out of focus, were you in a shaded area causing a longer shutter speed?', '2005-02-16 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174902, 147391, 33081, '<td valign="top">nice photo, difficult to see the bridge, however.</td>', 'nice photo, difficult to see the bridge, however.', '2005-02-16 14:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174905, 145921, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice colors ! I would have lost the foreground though. 6</td>', 'Nice colors ! I would have lost the foreground though. 6', '2005-02-16 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174909, 146208, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice content and sceen but appears too blown out in the sky. I would have darkened this and more contrast, IMO I think it would help.</td>', 'Nice content and sceen but appears too blown out in the sky. I would have darkened this and more contrast, IMO I think it would help.', '2005-02-16 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174911, 146554, 31533, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been an OK shot if the horizon were level.<br/></td>', 'I think this would have been an OK shot if the horizon were level.', '2005-02-16 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174913, 147606, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice colors !</td>', 'Nice colors !', '2005-02-16 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174914, 147529, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am trying to find a single photogenic element in this photo.  I imagine that in just the right light and from just the right angle those big round concrete piers could be interesting. Perhaps that''s what you saw? The green roof and yellow striped deck are interesting, though possibly cluttered.  The fact that the road and the river curve are interesting - but all the other stuff in the photo keep us from seeing this pre-development beauty (which would have been almost impossible to capture well).  Finally, the lighting is too harsh for most digital cameras.  The highlights in the Border Patrol car are all blown. And the shadows beneath the bridge are all black.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'I am trying to find a single photogenic element in this photo.  I imagine that in just the right light and from just the right angle those big round concrete piers could be interesting. Perhaps that''s what you saw? The green roof and yellow striped deck are interesting, though possibly cluttered.  The fact that the road and the river curve are interesting - but all the other stuff in the photo keep us from seeing this pre-development beauty (which would have been almost impossible to capture well).  Finally, the lighting is too harsh for most digital cameras.  The highlights in the Border Patrol car are all blown. And the shadows beneath the bridge are all black.  Better luck next time.', '2005-02-16 14:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174915, 145374, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice sceen but the brush up front is troublesome. Waiting to snap this a little later would have made the bridge towers really POP.</td>', 'Nice sceen but the brush up front is troublesome. Waiting to snap this a little later would have made the bridge towers really POP.', '2005-02-16 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174917, 147128, 2022, '<td valign="top">Cool (9)</td>', 'Cool (9)', '2005-02-16 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174919, 145410, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice !</td>', 'Nice !', '2005-02-16 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174921, 145823, 33560, '<td valign="top">Super.  I love the way the arch  of the bridge is echoed in the arc of the roof.  The lighting is exquisite.</td>', 'Super.  I love the way the arch  of the bridge is echoed in the arc of the roof.  The lighting is exquisite.', '2005-02-16 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174922, 146487, 29256, '<td valign="top">cropped too much off the top. Nice symetry and use of B&amp;W. IMO a different angle to have the bridge walkway meld into the shoreline and not the water would have been better.</td>', 'cropped too much off the top. Nice symetry and use of B&W. IMO a different angle to have the bridge walkway meld into the shoreline and not the water would have been better.', '2005-02-16 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174923, 147585, 31533, '<td valign="top">Would have been an OK shot if the horizon were level.</td>', 'Would have been an OK shot if the horizon were level.', '2005-02-16 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174925, 145497, 29256, '<td valign="top">A very different approach to the subject. Support on the right out of focus and the overhead is way too distracting. Blues and greens seem yellowish. Play with white balance to compensate.</td>', 'A very different approach to the subject. Support on the right out of focus and the overhead is way too distracting. Blues and greens seem yellowish. Play with white balance to compensate.', '2005-02-16 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174928, 145259, 2022, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I think though that the lighting is problematic and also larger size wouldn''t hurt. I mean larger size of the picture ;-)</td>', 'Interesting picture. I think though that the lighting is problematic and also larger size wouldn''t hurt. I mean larger size of the picture ;-)', '2005-02-16 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174929, 146520, 29256, '<td valign="top">I guess it goes against the rules but cloning out the light post and clouds would have worked great.</td>', 'I guess it goes against the rules but cloning out the light post and clouds would have worked great.', '2005-02-16 14:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174932, 146654, 33560, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting.  I happen to find the lighting really difficult to appreciate.  And I find the left and right, top and bottom quarters of the photo to be uninteresting.  I''m not sure my own approach would be better, but it might be worth trying: It''s such a long span that I think it would be interesting to use a longer lens and bring the bridge to the top of the photo,  Then we''d have cars and trucks passing over the rockies.  It could be really striking at twilight when the sky is darkening and the sun is just catching the peaks; the lights would leave red trails on the bridge.  Just a thought.</td>', 'The idea is interesting.  I happen to find the lighting really difficult to appreciate.  And I find the left and right, top and bottom quarters of the photo to be uninteresting.  I''m not sure my own approach would be better, but it might be worth trying: It''s such a long span that I think it would be interesting to use a longer lens and bring the bridge to the top of the photo,  Then we''d have cars and trucks passing over the rockies.  It could be really striking at twilight when the sky is darkening and the sun is just catching the peaks; the lights would leave red trails on the bridge.  Just a thought.', '2005-02-16 14:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174933, 147362, 29256, '<td valign="top">Very cool and eerie. I like this. Great details and DOF. Color choice really works here and the tree in the center is above the bridge is intriguing. Did you try more sephia tones too?</td>', 'Very cool and eerie. I like this. Great details and DOF. Color choice really works here and the tree in the center is above the bridge is intriguing. Did you try more sephia tones too?', '2005-02-16 14:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174935, 145409, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice color &amp; texture !</td>', 'Nice color & texture !', '2005-02-16 14:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174936, 146208, 33081, '<td valign="top">the bridge seems to be less in focus than the foreground. also, took me a second to find the bridge in the photo.  maybe a little more cropping at the botttom would help.</td>', 'the bridge seems to be less in focus than the foreground. also, took me a second to find the bridge in the photo.  maybe a little more cropping at the botttom would help.', '2005-02-16 14:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
