(1174945, 147606, 24073, '<td valign="top">Wow what amazing colors, clarity, and reflection.  I hope you get a great score, you got one in my book.</td>', 'Wow what amazing colors, clarity, and reflection.  I hope you get a great score, you got one in my book.', '2005-02-16 14:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174953, 147616, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I take it this was hand-held? Fore ground and lower right building are out of focus.</td>', 'Nice composition. I take it this was hand-held? Fore ground and lower right building are out of focus.', '2005-02-16 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174957, 146950, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright I am going to take a gamble, and say you won this challenge.  If not, you certainly did in my book, my only 10.  Just thought I''d give you props.</td>', 'Alright I am going to take a gamble, and say you won this challenge.  If not, you certainly did in my book, my only 10.  Just thought I''d give you props.', '2005-02-16 15:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174959, 147567, 31533, '<td valign="top">Is there a tilt to the bridge or is the picture angled ? Confusing.<br/>Nice colors.</td>', 'Is there a tilt to the bridge or is the picture angled ? Confusing.Nice colors.', '2005-02-16 15:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174960, 147618, 29256, '<td valign="top">looses the impact in full B&amp;W.</td>', 'looses the impact in full B&W.', '2005-02-16 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174964, 145807, 3102, '<td valign="top">This would have been an awesome shot had you left it alone, I think.  The toning is just creepy-ish, and there''s an awful lot of noise in the background.</td>', 'This would have been an awesome shot had you left it alone, I think.  The toning is just creepy-ish, and there''s an awful lot of noise in the background.', '2005-02-16 15:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174967, 146986, 33560, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily I dislike this kind of photo.  The haze seems too strong and the water''s highlights blown.  The structure at the bottom of the ramp is ugly and disturbing and hard to make out.  Everything seems cluttered and confusing.  Yet somehow it works.  What I mean is, ordinarily I''d rate a photo like this about a 3.  But I like the rhythm of the lamp posts, the rhythmo fo the guardrail posts, the rhythm of the bumpers on the pier, and the rhythm of the windows in the mosque.  There is even a kind of uneven rhythm in the pedestrian traffic.  And the double meaning - which would normally force a photo with this many elements to be too cluttered - really works.  It reminds us somehow of the gap between the modern secular world and the medieval religious one.  This very gap and an attempt to bridge the gap is embodied in the bridge itself. It is of modern concrete and steel construction, but the guardrail  has a beautiful byzantine design. And the haziness appropriately obscures our view of heaven..  The photo''s concept is extraordinarily strong.</td>', 'Ordinarily I dislike this kind of photo.  The haze seems too strong and the water''s highlights blown.  The structure at the bottom of the ramp is ugly and disturbing and hard to make out.  Everything seems cluttered and confusing.  Yet somehow it works.  What I mean is, ordinarily I''d rate a photo like this about a 3.  But I like the rhythm of the lamp posts, the rhythmo fo the guardrail posts, the rhythm of the bumpers on the pier, and the rhythm of the windows in the mosque.  There is even a kind of uneven rhythm in the pedestrian traffic.  And the double meaning - which would normally force a photo with this many elements to be too cluttered - really works.  It reminds us somehow of the gap between the modern secular world and the medieval religious one.  This very gap and an attempt to bridge the gap is embodied in the bridge itself. It is of modern concrete and steel construction, but the guardrail  has a beautiful byzantine design. And the haziness appropriately obscures our view of heaven..  The photo''s concept is extraordinarily strong.', '2005-02-16 15:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174968, 146837, 29256, '<td valign="top">Shame all that brush was there in the foreground.</td>', 'Shame all that brush was there in the foreground.', '2005-02-16 15:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174969, 146862, 33560, '<td valign="top">Visually compelling</td>', 'Visually compelling', '2005-02-16 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174972, 146167, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice, IMO a tighter crop at the top would help. I scrolled the page to remove just the sky and guardrail and it worked for me.</td>', 'Nice, IMO a tighter crop at the top would help. I scrolled the page to remove just the sky and guardrail and it worked for me.', '2005-02-16 15:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174976, 147299, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow... something really whacky happened to this one, I''m afraid.  It''s all washed out and lacks contrast.  Not sure what you may have done to accomplish that.</td>', 'Wow... something really whacky happened to this one, I''m afraid.  It''s all washed out and lacks contrast.  Not sure what you may have done to accomplish that.', '2005-02-16 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174981, 147553, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- stunning shot!  Excellent exposure and vantage point -- definitely a 10!</td>', 'Wow -- stunning shot!  Excellent exposure and vantage point -- definitely a 10!', '2005-02-16 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174982, 146218, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice color combo. Great rugged lines. All this and, good heavens, a holy cow!</td>', 'Nice color combo. Great rugged lines. All this and, good heavens, a holy cow!', '2005-02-16 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
