(1174991, 146164, 31213, '<td valign="top">A slightly longer shutter would have made everything "pop" a little more in this pic and would ahve bightened it up a touch.  nice shot though.</td>', 'A slightly longer shutter would have made everything "pop" a little more in this pic and would ahve bightened it up a touch.  nice shot though.', '2005-02-16 15:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174995, 147125, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I wonder how we got this to look like it was taken with a brownie camera on consumer film of the ''50s.  Is there a Photoshop filter for this?  It would have been a bad picture then - the falls fighting the bridge for prominence across the middle of the photo.  And I think today our standards are higher.</td>', 'Hmm, I wonder how we got this to look like it was taken with a brownie camera on consumer film of the ''50s.  Is there a Photoshop filter for this?  It would have been a bad picture then - the falls fighting the bridge for prominence across the middle of the photo.  And I think today our standards are higher.', '2005-02-16 15:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174999, 147477, 29256, '<td valign="top">What happened to the blue sky?</td>', 'What happened to the blue sky?', '2005-02-16 15:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175003, 147514, 29256, '<td valign="top">excellent, crisp clean perfect DOF and lighting.</td>', 'excellent, crisp clean perfect DOF and lighting.', '2005-02-16 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175005, 147627, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is the third viol bridge I''ve seen in this competition and it is easily the best.  For instrument bridges this and the guitar bridge are in a close heat.  The focus is clearly on the bridge itself and those sumptuous sound slots in the wood. Lighting is perfect and so is the composition.</td>', 'This is the third viol bridge I''ve seen in this competition and it is easily the best.  For instrument bridges this and the guitar bridge are in a close heat.  The focus is clearly on the bridge itself and those sumptuous sound slots in the wood. Lighting is perfect and so is the composition.', '2005-02-16 15:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175006, 146740, 33560, '<td valign="top">Normally black space is wasted. Not here.</td>', 'Normally black space is wasted. Not here.', '2005-02-16 15:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
