(1175035, 147617, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, like the line along the river in front. A bit more velvia colors would work better. The bridge itself is a bit too much in the middle of the frame so it lacks some oomph.</td>', 'Nice sky, like the line along the river in front. A bit more velvia colors would work better. The bridge itself is a bit too much in the middle of the frame so it lacks some oomph.', '2005-02-16 15:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
