(1175054, 145409, 33560, '<td valign="top">Rusted steel and iron work can take on such extraordinary  almost organic shapes and textures. And here it is lit superbly with warm orange sunset light at just the right angle.    But I find the wave, the sliver of a column on the left edge, and the wedge of yellow at the top right corner distracting.</td>', 'Rusted steel and iron work can take on such extraordinary  almost organic shapes and textures. And here it is lit superbly with warm orange sunset light at just the right angle.    But I find the wave, the sliver of a column on the left edge, and the wedge of yellow at the top right corner distracting.', '2005-02-16 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
