(1175075, 145945, 31637, '<td valign="top">I like the way all the lights radiate. You probably could of gotten a little more color out of this. The structure of the bridge is not too noticable. I guess try using a slower shutter.</td>', 'I like the way all the lights radiate. You probably could of gotten a little more color out of this. The structure of the bridge is not too noticable. I guess try using a slower shutter.', '2005-02-16 15:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
