(1175078, 147345, 33520, '<td valign="top">i really like the photo, but it was really hard to spot the bridge. lovely colours</td>', 'i really like the photo, but it was really hard to spot the bridge. lovely colours', '2005-02-16 15:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175079, 147464, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hideous acid-green light. The flash shadow. The wrong trousers, the unexplained green blanket on a green carpet, the awkward pose, the static composition, the empty green walls - it''s all sooooo ugly.  Perhaps it would have been better to turn the flash off and make the photo purposefully blurred and out of focus. We would be convinced that it is a perfect parody of bad snapshots. Apologies to the person who took this photo, but this viewer finds it offends just about every aesthetic sensibility.</td>', 'Hideous acid-green light. The flash shadow. The wrong trousers, the unexplained green blanket on a green carpet, the awkward pose, the static composition, the empty green walls - it''s all sooooo ugly.  Perhaps it would have been better to turn the flash off and make the photo purposefully blurred and out of focus. We would be convinced that it is a perfect parody of bad snapshots. Apologies to the person who took this photo, but this viewer finds it offends just about every aesthetic sensibility.', '2005-02-16 15:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175080, 145807, 22656, '<td valign="top">Nice tone...</td>', 'Nice tone...', '2005-02-16 15:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
