(1175102, 147491, 4517, '<td valign="top">You picked a good day to take this. Boats look toy like.</td>', 'You picked a good day to take this. Boats look toy like.', '2005-02-16 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175103, 147286, 16790, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of a motherboard!  Via chipset, huh? :)  Looks like a K7 series, so AMD?  Great focus and this is quite the unique take on the challenge... though many people won''t get it :)</td>', 'Nice close up of a motherboard!  Via chipset, huh? :)  Looks like a K7 series, so AMD?  Great focus and this is quite the unique take on the challenge... though many people won''t get it :)', '2005-02-16 15:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175105, 147345, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth photo.8</td>', 'Nice smooth photo.8', '2005-02-16 15:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175106, 146045, 33520, '<td valign="top">lovely image</td>', 'lovely image', '2005-02-16 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175107, 147340, 33161, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better taken from the water, the umbrella distracts a wonderfull photo.</td>', 'I think this would have been better taken from the water, the umbrella distracts a wonderfull photo.', '2005-02-16 15:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175110, 146222, 4517, '<td valign="top">Wow what a view. That`s a big bridge. 9</td>', 'Wow what a view. That`s a big bridge. 9', '2005-02-16 15:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175112, 147341, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  The desaturation really works for this; the yellow draws the eyes to the top of the bridge and the deeply shadowed black and white really give the scene a delicious sense of foreboding.  Brilliantly composed and wonderfully clear.  Fantastic work!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  The desaturation really works for this; the yellow draws the eyes to the top of the bridge and the deeply shadowed black and white really give the scene a delicious sense of foreboding.  Brilliantly composed and wonderfully clear.  Fantastic work!', '2005-02-16 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175113, 147023, 4517, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper. Maybe a closer shot of the bridge would be better.</td>', 'Could be sharper. Maybe a closer shot of the bridge would be better.', '2005-02-16 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175114, 146661, 33161, '<td valign="top">did you use a filter on this? The sky is a wonderfull color</td>', 'did you use a filter on this? The sky is a wonderfull color', '2005-02-16 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175115, 146267, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an interesting bridge. I like the composition but wonder if more could have been done with the reflection. The light is very good, soft and warm, makes for an interesting sky as well.<br/> <br/>Skansen, isn''t that in Stockholm?</td>', 'Wow, that''s an interesting bridge. I like the composition but wonder if more could have been done with the reflection. The light is very good, soft and warm, makes for an interesting sky as well. Skansen, isn''t that in Stockholm?', '2005-02-16 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175116, 145592, 4517, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, i like it. 9</td>', 'Cool shot, i like it. 9', '2005-02-16 15:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175117, 147217, 33161, '<td valign="top">peaceful photo.</td>', 'peaceful photo.', '2005-02-16 15:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175118, 145783, 23053, '<td valign="top">The barbed wire is a nice touch...</td>', 'The barbed wire is a nice touch...', '2005-02-16 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175119, 147604, 19040, '<td valign="top">Nice and gothic looking.</td>', 'Nice and gothic looking.', '2005-02-16 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175120, 147125, 22656, '<td valign="top">Better focous would have helped.</td>', 'Better focous would have helped.', '2005-02-16 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175121, 147527, 33161, '<td valign="top">This is a neat angle.</td>', 'This is a neat angle.', '2005-02-16 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175122, 145900, 4517, '<td valign="top">Film, orrible stuff :)</td>', 'Film, orrible stuff :)', '2005-02-16 15:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175123, 145786, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you used some imagination in selecting this type of bridge.</td>', 'I like the fact that you used some imagination in selecting this type of bridge.', '2005-02-16 15:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175124, 147595, 3032, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky, nice, provides a great background for the bridge as a profile.</td>', 'Dramatic sky, nice, provides a great background for the bridge as a profile.', '2005-02-16 15:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175126, 147247, 33520, '<td valign="top">then i should be on it...sorry i am sure u got it from others too.otherwise interesting, nice colours</td>', 'then i should be on it...sorry i am sure u got it from others too.otherwise interesting, nice colours', '2005-02-16 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175127, 147567, 19040, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I like the crop and the reflection.</td>', 'Nice color. I like the crop and the reflection.', '2005-02-16 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175128, 147458, 3032, '<td valign="top">Shof from a great angle, the cars on the bridge give a good scale reference. Shame about the blown out sky, a graduated ND filter can help with that.</td>', 'Shof from a great angle, the cars on the bridge give a good scale reference. Shame about the blown out sky, a graduated ND filter can help with that.', '2005-02-16 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175130, 147276, 24137, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2005-02-16 15:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175131, 146308, 33520, '<td valign="top">wow, the green really makes it work to me,nice</td>', 'wow, the green really makes it work to me,nice', '2005-02-16 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175132, 146222, 33520, '<td valign="top">this is very unusual,</td>', 'this is very unusual,', '2005-02-16 16:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175133, 146807, 3102, '<td valign="top">Is this Oakland (Pittsburgh) at Presbyterian Hospital?  If not, it sure looks like it!</td>', 'Is this Oakland (Pittsburgh) at Presbyterian Hospital?  If not, it sure looks like it!', '2005-02-16 16:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175134, 147560, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- very stunning location!!</td>', 'Wow -- very stunning location!!', '2005-02-16 16:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175138, 145815, 33520, '<td valign="top">nice pic, the black&amp;white really work</td>', 'nice pic, the black&white really work', '2005-02-16 16:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175139, 147532, 33560, '<td valign="top">The bridge works perfectly with its environment.  It''s a little hard to believe that the railing was quite that green and the rest of the composition that black and white.  Whether it complies with the rules or not, it is a nice aesthetic choice to make.  Those icecicles are really the ''icing'' on the cake. Nice.</td>', 'The bridge works perfectly with its environment.  It''s a little hard to believe that the railing was quite that green and the rest of the composition that black and white.  Whether it complies with the rules or not, it is a nice aesthetic choice to make.  Those icecicles are really the ''icing'' on the cake. Nice.', '2005-02-16 16:02:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1175140, 147304, 9581, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white treatment. Totally different view is awesome! :)</td>', 'Love the black and white treatment. Totally different view is awesome! :)', '2005-02-16 16:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175142, 147274, 3102, '<td valign="top">Could this be a Beaver County, PA shot??  Looks suspiciously like a bridge in my area, although it could certainly be anywhere...!</td>', 'Could this be a Beaver County, PA shot??  Looks suspiciously like a bridge in my area, although it could certainly be anywhere...!', '2005-02-16 16:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175144, 146165, 33520, '<td valign="top">very dramatic,</td>', 'very dramatic,', '2005-02-16 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175145, 147604, 32672, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that it looks like you got EXACTLY what you wanted.  It''s great.  It looks like an eerie Brigadoon.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that it looks like you got EXACTLY what you wanted.  It''s great.  It looks like an eerie Brigadoon.', '2005-02-16 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175150, 147278, 33560, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand.  Is this the veiw from the bridge of a whaling ship or something?  I simply do not understand anything in th photo.  In any case, the photo is too dark and flat - probably because the auto exposure saw too much snow.  Bad compositon, lighting,  exposure.  <br/> <br/>I have the impression that the material in the foreground, if exposed correctly could be quite drammatic and gory. And the snow in the background would be a good foiil.  Finally, it would be more helpful if we know what it is - even if the title tells us this.  And we can draw our own conclusions from the content of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t understand.  Is this the veiw from the bridge of a whaling ship or something?  I simply do not understand anything in th photo.  In any case, the photo is too dark and flat - probably because the auto exposure saw too much snow.  Bad compositon, lighting,  exposure.   I have the impression that the material in the foreground, if exposed correctly could be quite drammatic and gory. And the snow in the background would be a good foiil.  Finally, it would be more helpful if we know what it is - even if the title tells us this.  And we can draw our own conclusions from the content of the photo.', '2005-02-16 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175151, 147427, 31637, '<td valign="top">very nice shot...the bridge closest is so strange. you deserve a 6</td>', 'very nice shot...the bridge closest is so strange. you deserve a 6', '2005-02-16 16:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175152, 147567, 33520, '<td valign="top">well done!!!</td>', 'well done!!!', '2005-02-16 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175153, 147281, 3032, '<td valign="top">Intersting how the bridge construction works as a strong border (visually) between the road and the walkway. The man walking adds a lot of interest.<br/>What is on the bridge diagonal in front? The Yeti''s footprint? :)</td>', 'Intersting how the bridge construction works as a strong border (visually) between the road and the walkway. The man walking adds a lot of interest.What is on the bridge diagonal in front? The Yeti''s footprint? :)', '2005-02-16 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175156, 147402, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s made to look like it''s a bridge in the middle of nowhere  without so much as a road to connect to it.  The lighting is strong and makes us focus on the bridge.  The composition is simple and compelling.</td>', 'It''s made to look like it''s a bridge in the middle of nowhere  without so much as a road to connect to it.  The lighting is strong and makes us focus on the bridge.  The composition is simple and compelling.', '2005-02-16 16:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175160, 146167, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, looks like tough lighting conditions, focus looks a little soft.</td>', 'Very nicely done, looks like tough lighting conditions, focus looks a little soft.', '2005-02-16 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175166, 147554, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny; a sort of bridge of last resort.  Does it seem wise  - in an emergency - to rely on a bridge unsuited to normal traffic?   Sorry, comment is supposed to be about the photo...The melange of textures is interesting, but mostly the photo seems cluttered, not interestinlgy lit.</td>', 'Very funny; a sort of bridge of last resort.  Does it seem wise  - in an emergency - to rely on a bridge unsuited to normal traffic?   Sorry, comment is supposed to be about the photo...The melange of textures is interesting, but mostly the photo seems cluttered, not interestinlgy lit.', '2005-02-16 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175169, 146593, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think you had nice light in this image, would like to see a little sharper focus (or unsharp mask) and tilt the first floorboard on the bridge clockwise a few degrees. Your title and the little garbage can are awesome!! I''m laughing out loud hahaha - it increased your score from me by a lot - thanks!</td>', 'I think you had nice light in this image, would like to see a little sharper focus (or unsharp mask) and tilt the first floorboard on the bridge clockwise a few degrees. Your title and the little garbage can are awesome!! I''m laughing out loud hahaha - it increased your score from me by a lot - thanks!', '2005-02-16 16:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175170, 145592, 31865, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I wish it faded into a true black, but I have a really bright monitor..which seems to get me into trouble a lot on this site, so I''m giving this the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I wish it faded into a true black, but I have a really bright monitor..which seems to get me into trouble a lot on this site, so I''m giving this the benefit of the doubt.', '2005-02-16 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175174, 146941, 31865, '<td valign="top">very subtle.  If the bridge wasn''t in the reflection, I would have scored it lower; not because I don''t get the metaphor, but the reflection really kicks it up a notch.</td>', 'very subtle.  If the bridge wasn''t in the reflection, I would have scored it lower; not because I don''t get the metaphor, but the reflection really kicks it up a notch.', '2005-02-16 16:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175175, 146449, 32672, '<td valign="top">Cute idea--I remember playing on those!</td>', 'Cute idea--I remember playing on those!', '2005-02-16 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175178, 147234, 33560, '<td valign="top">I think this more likely was a pier; but the posts are interesting.  Not finding the sky or the weeds or even the water very interesting.  And there''s just not quite enough rotted wood to carry photo otherwise.</td>', 'I think this more likely was a pier; but the posts are interesting.  Not finding the sky or the weeds or even the water very interesting.  And there''s just not quite enough rotted wood to carry photo otherwise.', '2005-02-16 16:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175179, 146168, 32672, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery, pretty subject.  Looks like something out of ''Country Magazine.''</td>', 'Pretty scenery, pretty subject.  Looks like something out of ''Country Magazine.''', '2005-02-16 16:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175181, 147574, 32672, '<td valign="top">I like the slight tilt.</td>', 'I like the slight tilt.', '2005-02-16 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175182, 146412, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the uniqueness of this shot.  Looks like focus could be a little soft but could also be my monitor.</td>', 'I like the uniqueness of this shot.  Looks like focus could be a little soft but could also be my monitor.', '2005-02-16 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175183, 147311, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is among the more photogenic bridges seen in this competition.  And this is one of the good ones.</td>', 'This is among the more photogenic bridges seen in this competition.  And this is one of the good ones.', '2005-02-16 16:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175185, 147517, 31133, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this has lost a point from me because I can''t study the picture at this size. Otherwise, it looks like it is a pretty good photo - I''m just frustrated that I can''t see those beautiful blue lights better. It looks like extremely beautiful colors!</td>', 'Unfortunately, this has lost a point from me because I can''t study the picture at this size. Otherwise, it looks like it is a pretty good photo - I''m just frustrated that I can''t see those beautiful blue lights better. It looks like extremely beautiful colors!', '2005-02-16 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175186, 147061, 33560, '<td valign="top">The haze and blue don''t work for me.</td>', 'The haze and blue don''t work for me.', '2005-02-16 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175189, 146045, 13305, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture of the lights reflecting off the clouds.  Almost gives the photo a surreal feel.</td>', 'Outstanding capture of the lights reflecting off the clouds.  Almost gives the photo a surreal feel.', '2005-02-16 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175190, 147466, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the story this shot tells. It''s such a nice contrast with the big modern bridge next to this skeleton. The brush growing around the old bridge (railroad bridge?) really drive home the subject.</td>', 'I love the story this shot tells. It''s such a nice contrast with the big modern bridge next to this skeleton. The brush growing around the old bridge (railroad bridge?) really drive home the subject.', '2005-02-16 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175192, 146217, 33560, '<td valign="top">Love the color.  Was there no way to get the great sweep of the curved bridge into the photo?</td>', 'Love the color.  Was there no way to get the great sweep of the curved bridge into the photo?', '2005-02-16 16:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175194, 145945, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-02-16 16:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175198, 147302, 3102, '<td valign="top">I gotta admit I have no idea what I''m looking at :\</td>', 'I gotta admit I have no idea what I''m looking at :\', '2005-02-16 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175199, 145798, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the shot. The sky really gives an eerie feeling.</td>', 'I like the angle of the shot. The sky really gives an eerie feeling.', '2005-02-16 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175200, 147291, 13305, '<td valign="top">This is almost post card material.  Work with the levels a bit more,  you managed to avoid the blue tint of lots of snow, but the dark colors are a bit too dark.  Let us see some detail on the sides of the house.</td>', 'This is almost post card material.  Work with the levels a bit more,  you managed to avoid the blue tint of lots of snow, but the dark colors are a bit too dark.  Let us see some detail on the sides of the house.', '2005-02-16 16:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175201, 147015, 32378, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunning!!  Can''t wait till voting is done to see how you got this shot.</td>', 'This shot is stunning!!  Can''t wait till voting is done to see how you got this shot.', '2005-02-16 16:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175204, 147052, 13305, '<td valign="top">Great arcitechural shot.  I really like the line of lights leading off into the distance.  I''d really like to see a wider angle, so more of the bridge is visible.</td>', 'Great arcitechural shot.  I really like the line of lights leading off into the distance.  I''d really like to see a wider angle, so more of the bridge is visible.', '2005-02-16 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175208, 146834, 33560, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary.</td>', 'Extraordinary.', '2005-02-16 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175210, 146496, 13305, '<td valign="top">I understand bokeh, but I think this would look better in sharp focus all the way.</td>', 'I understand bokeh, but I think this would look better in sharp focus all the way.', '2005-02-16 16:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175211, 146518, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see a different interpretation of this challenge! Is that kolidascope glass or what that makes that star? I also like how the area to the right of the glass is sunny, while the left side shows an approaching storm. I''d like to see a slightly different crop so you could make the vertical a little, 15% or so larger.</td>', 'It''s nice to see a different interpretation of this challenge! Is that kolidascope glass or what that makes that star? I also like how the area to the right of the glass is sunny, while the left side shows an approaching storm. I''d like to see a slightly different crop so you could make the vertical a little, 15% or so larger.', '2005-02-16 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175213, 146929, 33427, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-02-16 16:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175215, 147567, 32378, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this a little more, if there was a little less sky and more foreground. Also would have liked it a little bit lighter to catch more of the reflection of the bridge.</td>', 'I would have liked this a little more, if there was a little less sky and more foreground. Also would have liked it a little bit lighter to catch more of the reflection of the bridge.', '2005-02-16 16:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175217, 147604, 13305, '<td valign="top">Love the fog on this pic.  The lack of color and fog together seem to make the bridge seem that much bigger and forboding.  Great effort.</td>', 'Love the fog on this pic.  The lack of color and fog together seem to make the bridge seem that much bigger and forboding.  Great effort.', '2005-02-16 16:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175224, 147503, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sorry, in this viewer''s eyes this is a godawful ugly guitar, and the photo just happens to be entirely about this ugly monster.</td>', 'Sorry, in this viewer''s eyes this is a godawful ugly guitar, and the photo just happens to be entirely about this ugly monster.', '2005-02-16 16:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175229, 146590, 32378, '<td valign="top">Like the rugged look of the bridge.</td>', 'Like the rugged look of the bridge.', '2005-02-16 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175230, 146950, 33603, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but something is giving it an unnatural look. I''d like to see the colors in the original because they look a little too vibrant in this copy.</td>', 'Great shot, but something is giving it an unnatural look. I''d like to see the colors in the original because they look a little too vibrant in this copy.', '2005-02-16 16:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175238, 147576, 32672, '<td valign="top">That''s the Christo thing in orange, isn''t it? I love how you showed the delicate detail in the bridgework.</td>', 'That''s the Christo thing in orange, isn''t it? I love how you showed the delicate detail in the bridgework.', '2005-02-16 16:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175239, 147567, 33161, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in your photo. Good job.</td>', 'I like the colors in your photo. Good job.', '2005-02-16 16:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175242, 147630, 32672, '<td valign="top">Great tones.</td>', 'Great tones.', '2005-02-16 16:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175244, 146218, 23053, '<td valign="top">My top photograph with color for the challenge...lots of black &amp; white in this go-round.  Congratulations on the shot - lots of bridges to see.  The color is lush and deep, and the metal bridge in the background stands out well despite being lightened by mist because it''s the only unnatural thing here.  The nice stone bridges only add to the shot.  Good work.</td>', 'My top photograph with color for the challenge...lots of black & white in this go-round.  Congratulations on the shot - lots of bridges to see.  The color is lush and deep, and the metal bridge in the background stands out well despite being lightened by mist because it''s the only unnatural thing here.  The nice stone bridges only add to the shot.  Good work.', '2005-02-16 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175249, 145672, 33785, '<td valign="top">I''ll be shocked if this doesn''t win.</td>', 'I''ll be shocked if this doesn''t win.', '2005-02-16 16:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175251, 146460, 31440, '<td valign="top">going for the brown?</td>', 'going for the brown?', '2005-02-16 16:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175255, 146600, 32378, '<td valign="top">Biggest problem is the angle with the bridge going up hill (or down) and falling over backwards.</td>', 'Biggest problem is the angle with the bridge going up hill (or down) and falling over backwards.', '2005-02-16 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175256, 147574, 30743, '<td valign="top">if i could give you a zero i would, but i realy mean this in the most constructive way cheers!<br/></td>', 'if i could give you a zero i would, but i realy mean this in the most constructive way cheers!', '2005-02-16 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175259, 146941, 33427, '<td valign="top">Nice!  great reflection and comp.  The off kilter background would normally bother me, but not in this shot, it works.</td>', 'Nice!  great reflection and comp.  The off kilter background would normally bother me, but not in this shot, it works.', '2005-02-16 16:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175260, 145534, 33603, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation. However, I think this is against the rules (basic editing).</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation. However, I think this is against the rules (basic editing).', '2005-02-16 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175262, 147362, 33520, '<td valign="top">this is really nice</td>', 'this is really nice', '2005-02-16 16:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175263, 147030, 32378, '<td valign="top">I liked this bridge, nice color.  However, for me  I think another persepctive that showed more of the bridge deck and less of the sky would have helped.</td>', 'I liked this bridge, nice color.  However, for me  I think another persepctive that showed more of the bridge deck and less of the sky would have helped.', '2005-02-16 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175269, 147183, 19035, '<td valign="top">Hello Clevelander...Nice shot - I took a picture of this bridge as well, I like your colors better, very dramatic. 8.</td>', 'Hello Clevelander...Nice shot - I took a picture of this bridge as well, I like your colors better, very dramatic. 8.', '2005-02-16 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175275, 147618, 11895, '<td valign="top">too dark and colorless, the red suits are almost the same as the black ones</td>', 'too dark and colorless, the red suits are almost the same as the black ones', '2005-02-16 16:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175284, 147537, 33427, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and comp.  since the sky washed out, I think I would have cropped some of it off.  Good Job!</td>', 'Nice DOF and comp.  since the sky washed out, I think I would have cropped some of it off.  Good Job!', '2005-02-16 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
