(1175812, 147585, 31859, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the reflection. Not always easy to capture.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the reflection. Not always easy to capture.', '2005-02-16 20:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175819, 146607, 31859, '<td valign="top">Like a postcard!</td>', 'Like a postcard!', '2005-02-16 20:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175822, 147627, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and framing.  If this had been a member challenge, I''d recommend some dodging and burning to make the highlights and shadows more contrasty.  Definitely some potential.</td>', 'I like the subject and framing.  If this had been a member challenge, I''d recommend some dodging and burning to make the highlights and shadows more contrasty.  Definitely some potential.', '2005-02-16 20:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175823, 145787, 509, '<td valign="top">I think a little more contrast would help add some impact to this.  The bridge blends in a little with the trees in the foreground and background.</td>', 'I think a little more contrast would help add some impact to this.  The bridge blends in a little with the trees in the foreground and background.', '2005-02-16 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175825, 146958, 31859, '<td valign="top">I like the colors captured here. Very nice framing of the picture, too.</td>', 'I like the colors captured here. Very nice framing of the picture, too.', '2005-02-16 20:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175828, 147304, 31859, '<td valign="top">very dramatic. nice.</td>', 'very dramatic. nice.', '2005-02-16 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175830, 146440, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast and shape.  I especially like the continuation of the bridge through its shadow.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast and shape.  I especially like the continuation of the bridge through its shadow.', '2005-02-16 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175831, 147259, 33515, '<td valign="top">This is such a good photograph; it takes on the look of a beautiful painting if I may. The colors in the park under the arch really pulled my eyes in. Stunning.</td>', 'This is such a good photograph; it takes on the look of a beautiful painting if I may. The colors in the park under the arch really pulled my eyes in. Stunning.', '2005-02-16 20:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175833, 145890, 25261, '<td valign="top">Cross this beauty everyday. Hard to not eyeball the glass museum and all the new work on the old Albers Mill building. Good luck</td>', 'Cross this beauty everyday. Hard to not eyeball the glass museum and all the new work on the old Albers Mill building. Good luck', '2005-02-16 20:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175837, 147532, 509, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the use of selective desaturation here.  It doesn''t really add to the photo other than to prevent the guardrail from blending in too much with the trees - adding some contrast might have accomplished that in a better way imho.  Also, the bridge is not perfectly horizontal - in this framing, it is somewhat awkward.  Might be better to include part of the bridge that is connected to the ground.</td>', 'Not really fond of the use of selective desaturation here.  It doesn''t really add to the photo other than to prevent the guardrail from blending in too much with the trees - adding some contrast might have accomplished that in a better way imho.  Also, the bridge is not perfectly horizontal - in this framing, it is somewhat awkward.  Might be better to include part of the bridge that is connected to the ground.', '2005-02-16 20:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175838, 145782, 29309, '<td valign="top">the snow appears overexposed and lacks detail that would add t the image</td>', 'the snow appears overexposed and lacks detail that would add t the image', '2005-02-16 20:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175842, 147559, 509, '<td valign="top">Great wide angle effect  = )<br/>I like how the image is divided between light (left side) and shadow (right side).  The bridge serves a dual purpose of separating this lighting and adds to the scene.</td>', 'Great wide angle effect  = )I like how the image is divided between light (left side) and shadow (right side).  The bridge serves a dual purpose of separating this lighting and adds to the scene.', '2005-02-16 20:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175848, 146520, 20168, '<td valign="top">A bit too much underbelly darkness and not enough sky for my preferences in composition.  I do like the diagonal bold lines though, and focus is excellent.  Dramatic!</td>', 'A bit too much underbelly darkness and not enough sky for my preferences in composition.  I do like the diagonal bold lines though, and focus is excellent.  Dramatic!', '2005-02-16 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175851, 147159, 20168, '<td valign="top">I too took a covered bridge shot, but you have me outdistanced with this elegant b/w photo in all its soft focus glory.  Thanks for a beauty!  10</td>', 'I too took a covered bridge shot, but you have me outdistanced with this elegant b/w photo in all its soft focus glory.  Thanks for a beauty!  10', '2005-02-16 20:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175854, 147197, 29309, '<td valign="top">any idea what the white streaks are planes?</td>', 'any idea what the white streaks are planes?', '2005-02-16 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175855, 146317, 29858, '<td valign="top">Slight cropping to remove the distracting elements in the bottom right corner would have improved this.</td>', 'Slight cropping to remove the distracting elements in the bottom right corner would have improved this.', '2005-02-16 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175857, 146586, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very nice camera angle and contrast.</td>', 'Very nice camera angle and contrast.', '2005-02-16 20:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175858, 147632, 20168, '<td valign="top">Us covered bridge folks share a common interest in things past.  I love the dark silhoulette against a beautiful sky.  The landscape, unfortunately, is quite dull.  Perhaps, less land with a closer angle upwards?  Still, a better catch than my own covered bridge attempt.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Us covered bridge folks share a common interest in things past.  I love the dark silhoulette against a beautiful sky.  The landscape, unfortunately, is quite dull.  Perhaps, less land with a closer angle upwards?  Still, a better catch than my own covered bridge attempt.  Best of luck.', '2005-02-16 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175862, 145410, 29309, '<td valign="top">the small apeture  stars around the lights are great. at the top of my list</td>', 'the small apeture  stars around the lights are great. at the top of my list', '2005-02-16 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175863, 145887, 29309, '<td valign="top">more saturation to the colors would add to the impact</td>', 'more saturation to the colors would add to the impact', '2005-02-16 20:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
