(1176233, 147338, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot that just happens to have a bridge in it.  It doesn''t seem to meet the challenge as well as some of the other submissions.  Overall, good capture of the child.</td>', 'This is a good shot that just happens to have a bridge in it.  It doesn''t seem to meet the challenge as well as some of the other submissions.  Overall, good capture of the child.', '2005-02-16 22:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
