(1176236, 146600, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think the skewed angle could be a great idea, and make a shot very interesting, but in this case I don''t think it does anything positive for the photo.</td>', 'I think the skewed angle could be a great idea, and make a shot very interesting, but in this case I don''t think it does anything positive for the photo.', '2005-02-16 22:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176237, 145323, 31905, '<td valign="top">love the water</td>', 'love the water', '2005-02-16 22:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176241, 146607, 29009, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard!  Great shot.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard!  Great shot.', '2005-02-16 22:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176242, 147560, 31905, '<td valign="top">breathtaking.</td>', 'breathtaking.', '2005-02-16 22:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176243, 146208, 25232, '<td valign="top">Too gray. Doesn''t encompase the tonal range that is needed to complete most black and whites. (no pure black) I''ll attribute the shortcoming to haze or smog. Great composition. 7</td>', 'Too gray. Doesn''t encompase the tonal range that is needed to complete most black and whites. (no pure black) I''ll attribute the shortcoming to haze or smog. Great composition. 7', '2005-02-16 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176244, 147268, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea that seems to have lots of potential, but It just does''nt seem to be working here. I think the boat is kind of distracting, and I''m not sure if the city in the background helps or not.</td>', 'An interesting idea that seems to have lots of potential, but It just does''nt seem to be working here. I think the boat is kind of distracting, and I''m not sure if the city in the background helps or not.', '2005-02-16 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176246, 147466, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Composition seems a bit messy, shot lacks a clear focal point.  Colors convey abandonment well.</td>', 'Good idea.  Composition seems a bit messy, shot lacks a clear focal point.  Colors convey abandonment well.', '2005-02-16 22:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176247, 147250, 25232, '<td valign="top"><br/>I think that''s what it must look like when you car is flipping end over at 93mph. <br/> <br/>Dizzying.</td>', 'I think that''s what it must look like when you car is flipping end over at 93mph.  Dizzying.', '2005-02-16 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176249, 146989, 25232, '<td valign="top">Great. 9</td>', 'Great. 9', '2005-02-16 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176250, 147458, 33081, '<td valign="top">sky seems blown out, but otherwise a great capture!</td>', 'sky seems blown out, but otherwise a great capture!', '2005-02-16 22:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176251, 147015, 32239, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! The water is basically a mirror-- so calm! Love the composition and sharpness. Good job.</td>', 'Fabulous! The water is basically a mirror-- so calm! Love the composition and sharpness. Good job.', '2005-02-16 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176253, 147585, 19831, '<td valign="top">Like the capture of the reflection. Good choice for b/w IMO. Nice composition.</td>', 'Like the capture of the reflection. Good choice for b/w IMO. Nice composition.', '2005-02-16 22:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176255, 147343, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!  I love the starburst pattern in the lights.  This shot truly has a "wow" factor.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent job!  I love the starburst pattern in the lights.  This shot truly has a "wow" factor.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-02-16 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176262, 146520, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve tried to capture the bridge from a unique viewpoint.  With regard to composition, the lines aren''t quite as visually appealing as you might have intended.  The underside of the bridge is very dark and lacks detail.  Overall, this is a decent shot and I congratulate your effort.</td>', 'I like how you''ve tried to capture the bridge from a unique viewpoint.  With regard to composition, the lines aren''t quite as visually appealing as you might have intended.  The underside of the bridge is very dark and lacks detail.  Overall, this is a decent shot and I congratulate your effort.', '2005-02-16 22:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176265, 145832, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot. Great lines. Good job.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot. Great lines. Good job.', '2005-02-16 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176269, 147061, 29009, '<td valign="top">Lines are just a bit off, I''d rotate just a few degrees and crop the shot so that there is no white space between the bridge and the top of the frame.  Otherwise a great shot with regard to composition.</td>', 'Lines are just a bit off, I''d rotate just a few degrees and crop the shot so that there is no white space between the bridge and the top of the frame.  Otherwise a great shot with regard to composition.', '2005-02-16 22:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176272, 145890, 29009, '<td valign="top">Colors are great.  A tighter crop that excluded the traffic signs might have had a more dramatic impact.  The lines of the bridge are classic, but get lost in the rest of the frame.</td>', 'Colors are great.  A tighter crop that excluded the traffic signs might have had a more dramatic impact.  The lines of the bridge are classic, but get lost in the rest of the frame.', '2005-02-16 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176273, 146607, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Good perspective and composition. I really like the textures and for some reason the rust colors add a nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Good perspective and composition. I really like the textures and for some reason the rust colors add a nice touch.', '2005-02-16 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176279, 146537, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Extra points from me for the humor.  :-)</td>', 'Very cute. Extra points from me for the humor.  :-)', '2005-02-16 22:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176280, 147444, 32239, '<td valign="top">That "Slippery When Wet" sign on the bridge throws it off.  You should have taken it down for the shot.</td>', 'That "Slippery When Wet" sign on the bridge throws it off.  You should have taken it down for the shot.', '2005-02-16 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176281, 147452, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The line in the upper left corner is just a little off, but with such a unique take I''m going to ignore.  You''ve got some great depth here.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The line in the upper left corner is just a little off, but with such a unique take I''m going to ignore.  You''ve got some great depth here.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-02-16 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176282, 147341, 10151, '<td valign="top">A little dark, would have liked to see some detail on the far bank.  Good comp and I like the selective desat with the doors :)</td>', 'A little dark, would have liked to see some detail on the far bank.  Good comp and I like the selective desat with the doors :)', '2005-02-16 22:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176283, 146497, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great calendar shot.</td>', 'Great calendar shot.', '2005-02-16 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176286, 147259, 10151, '<td valign="top">Color is brilliant, seems almost sureal.</td>', 'Color is brilliant, seems almost sureal.', '2005-02-16 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176289, 146233, 10151, '<td valign="top">Seems a little hazy or washed out. Curves or contrast? Very nice image though!! 7</td>', 'Seems a little hazy or washed out. Curves or contrast? Very nice image though!! 7', '2005-02-16 22:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176290, 147435, 3461, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the bridge appears out of focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately the bridge appears out of focus.', '2005-02-16 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176292, 147293, 19035, '<td valign="top">I hope you win the blue ribbon - this is stunning.</td>', 'I hope you win the blue ribbon - this is stunning.', '2005-02-16 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176293, 147591, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  :-)  How''d you get your models to cooperate?</td>', 'Very cute.  :-)  How''d you get your models to cooperate?', '2005-02-16 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176294, 146222, 3461, '<td valign="top">If I were nitpicking I''d say it looks slightly off center and would work perfectly if it were centered. Nice shot.</td>', 'If I were nitpicking I''d say it looks slightly off center and would work perfectly if it were centered. Nice shot.', '2005-02-16 22:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176295, 145464, 29009, '<td valign="top">Image size is very small - although I''m sure you''ll hear that from others.  Good idea here.  There appears to be a problem with your crop -- blank white space takes up some of the frame for no apparent artistic reason.  Building in the background is distracting from the focal point - next time let more of the sky into the background.  Black and white was a good choice here.  Overall, it was a fresh idea with potential.</td>', 'Image size is very small - although I''m sure you''ll hear that from others.  Good idea here.  There appears to be a problem with your crop -- blank white space takes up some of the frame for no apparent artistic reason.  Building in the background is distracting from the focal point - next time let more of the sky into the background.  Black and white was a good choice here.  Overall, it was a fresh idea with potential.', '2005-02-16 22:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176297, 145993, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and composed, creative.  Nice break from the traditional bridges I have been perusing (It would have been fitting to title this photo ''Interlude'').</td>', 'Well exposed and composed, creative.  Nice break from the traditional bridges I have been perusing (It would have been fitting to title this photo ''Interlude'').', '2005-02-16 22:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176298, 146929, 33233, '<td valign="top">It''s well composed but I don''t get it</td>', 'It''s well composed but I don''t get it', '2005-02-16 22:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176300, 145731, 33233, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo but I don''t ge the bridge metaphor</td>', 'It''s a good photo but I don''t ge the bridge metaphor', '2005-02-16 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176302, 147550, 33233, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good repeating pattern, good lighting</td>', 'Good composition, good repeating pattern, good lighting', '2005-02-16 22:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176303, 147536, 29009, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This shot has it all - fantastic composition, great colors, lots and lots of visual interest.  Oops, I had to stop typing because I was busy admiring!  Um, I could keep praising but I rather just look some more and enjoy.... Needless to say - (10)</td>', 'Wow.  This shot has it all - fantastic composition, great colors, lots and lots of visual interest.  Oops, I had to stop typing because I was busy admiring!  Um, I could keep praising but I rather just look some more and enjoy.... Needless to say - (10)', '2005-02-16 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176304, 147057, 29009, '<td valign="top">Dramatic composition.  Good job!</td>', 'Dramatic composition.  Good job!', '2005-02-16 22:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176305, 147618, 6519, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but not the color treatment or the noise. I am missing the punch that the colored suits would give to the photo.</td>', 'Love the idea, but not the color treatment or the noise. I am missing the punch that the colored suits would give to the photo.', '2005-02-16 22:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176306, 147435, 33233, '<td valign="top">I get the sensation of a tilted picture, other than that an interesting angle and good composition.</td>', 'I get the sensation of a tilted picture, other than that an interesting angle and good composition.', '2005-02-16 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176308, 147457, 33233, '<td valign="top">A well composed picture with good lighting but a bit of a stretch for the topic.</td>', 'A well composed picture with good lighting but a bit of a stretch for the topic.', '2005-02-16 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176311, 147340, 10151, '<td valign="top">Truley lovely scene. Too bad about the head on the far right. 7</td>', 'Truley lovely scene. Too bad about the head on the far right. 7', '2005-02-16 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
