(1176331, 146168, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition.  Unfortunately, the main part of the bridge is in shadow.  Overall, a decent shot that would have been great at a different time of day....</td>', 'This is a great composition.  Unfortunately, the main part of the bridge is in shadow.  Overall, a decent shot that would have been great at a different time of day....', '2005-02-16 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
