(1176585, 145696, 33233, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and lighting but I think you have a blue color cast that can be corrected. An overcast sky will do that because an outdoor setting is color tuned for sunlight. I deal with that  lot here in the Pacific NW.</td>', 'Good composition, and lighting but I think you have a blue color cast that can be corrected. An overcast sky will do that because an outdoor setting is color tuned for sunlight. I deal with that  lot here in the Pacific NW.', '2005-02-17 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
