(1176767, 146541, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The black and white with deep shadows really gives this the peculiar feel of unreality... it''s both appealing and a little disconcerting. The branches coming down really add to the slight unease, which is in strong contrast with the picturesque buildings.  Very interesting image that is lots of fun to examine closely!</td>', 'Lovely.  The black and white with deep shadows really gives this the peculiar feel of unreality... it''s both appealing and a little disconcerting. The branches coming down really add to the slight unease, which is in strong contrast with the picturesque buildings.  Very interesting image that is lots of fun to examine closely!', '2005-02-17 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176768, 146862, 16790, '<td valign="top">Interesting take and very nicely lit.  The simplicity of this and the slight amount of colour give this real appeal.  I like the centered composition - good job.</td>', 'Interesting take and very nicely lit.  The simplicity of this and the slight amount of colour give this real appeal.  I like the centered composition - good job.', '2005-02-17 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
