(1176836, 147458, 30364, '<td valign="top">With a name like that he couldn''t afford to build crap bridges, and this one''s a beauty.  So is the photo.  Pity about the tree in the foreground ... you should have cut it down (Brunel probably would have).  7.</td>', 'With a name like that he couldn''t afford to build crap bridges, and this one''s a beauty.  So is the photo.  Pity about the tree in the foreground ... you should have cut it down (Brunel probably would have).  7.', '2005-02-17 03:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176849, 146218, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  The bridge looks ethereal, &amp; for that reason I wonder if you tried with the cow and all the grass cropped out?  I feel the foreground diminishes the delicate character of the image.  6.</td>', 'This is very good.  The bridge looks ethereal, & for that reason I wonder if you tried with the cow and all the grass cropped out?  I feel the foreground diminishes the delicate character of the image.  6.', '2005-02-17 03:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176856, 147607, 30364, '<td valign="top">But not, alas, to mine.  I see your point (pardon the pun), and the photograph is certainly technically impressive, but it''s really just a good picture of stationery ... not very stimulating.  However, points for an original idea &amp; points for a quality photograph.  5.</td>', 'But not, alas, to mine.  I see your point (pardon the pun), and the photograph is certainly technically impressive, but it''s really just a good picture of stationery ... not very stimulating.  However, points for an original idea & points for a quality photograph.  5.', '2005-02-17 03:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176860, 147574, 31047, '<td valign="top">too bad that the perspective is wrong.</td>', 'too bad that the perspective is wrong.', '2005-02-17 03:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176861, 147583, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an arresting composition, and competently photographed as well.  I hope you won''t be offended if I say I think it''s better than it appears at first glance ... what I mean is it rewards a more careful examination.  6.</td>', 'This is an arresting composition, and competently photographed as well.  I hope you won''t be offended if I say I think it''s better than it appears at first glance ... what I mean is it rewards a more careful examination.  6.', '2005-02-17 03:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
