(1178018, 147377, 31865, '<td valign="top">I''m betting some comments are saying, "too bad that lampost is in the way", but I love that it''s there.  Throws off the monotony.  Nice photo.</td>', 'I''m betting some comments are saying, "too bad that lampost is in the way", but I love that it''s there.  Throws off the monotony.  Nice photo.', '2005-02-17 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178019, 146537, 31133, '<td valign="top">Haha, cute humor! The shot seems just a tad blurry (but far better than my usual, so don''t take it personally :-). I think you''ve got an excellent composition here and it''s great that you even have the old-fashioned map.</td>', 'Haha, cute humor! The shot seems just a tad blurry (but far better than my usual, so don''t take it personally :-). I think you''ve got an excellent composition here and it''s great that you even have the old-fashioned map.', '2005-02-17 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178020, 146997, 31865, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective in this with both the bridge and boats converging to a point offscreen.  It needs a little more contrast.  It''s a little grey, but very nice composition.</td>', 'I like the perspective in this with both the bridge and boats converging to a point offscreen.  It needs a little more contrast.  It''s a little grey, but very nice composition.', '2005-02-17 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178021, 147293, 32997, '<td valign="top">Wow..the sky! I lov ethe way the elements come together!</td>', 'Wow..the sky! I lov ethe way the elements come together!', '2005-02-17 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178023, 146296, 15212, '<td valign="top">520 or I-90? I''m too far north to use them often enough to know the difference. Nicely Taken.</td>', '520 or I-90? I''m too far north to use them often enough to know the difference. Nicely Taken.', '2005-02-17 16:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178025, 146183, 31865, '<td valign="top">Where is this bridge?  South America?  I''ve heard of it before.  I wonder what the significance of the date is, because that''s my birthday.  I should go there.  Nice shot.  You must have been high up.  In a plane perhaps?  I like the slight curvature to the horizon.</td>', 'Where is this bridge?  South America?  I''ve heard of it before.  I wonder what the significance of the date is, because that''s my birthday.  I should go there.  Nice shot.  You must have been high up.  In a plane perhaps?  I like the slight curvature to the horizon.', '2005-02-17 16:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178028, 147627, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think the bridge of the violin might have been better placed off to one side or the other- the composition is a bit static with it so close to the center.</td>', 'I think the bridge of the violin might have been better placed off to one side or the other- the composition is a bit static with it so close to the center.', '2005-02-17 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178030, 147604, 32997, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work! It keeps me staring at it.</td>', 'Beautiful work! It keeps me staring at it.', '2005-02-17 16:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178031, 147563, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I wonder if that''s moonlight or a street light - my eye is definitely drawn to the left where the light is - ah, I think it''s headlights now.  The crop is very expressive and works wonderfully here. Also like the wagon sitting by the road. 8</td>', 'Very nice! I wonder if that''s moonlight or a street light - my eye is definitely drawn to the left where the light is - ah, I think it''s headlights now.  The crop is very expressive and works wonderfully here. Also like the wagon sitting by the road. 8', '2005-02-17 16:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178033, 146994, 31865, '<td valign="top">I think if the colors were a little more intense and that sign wasn''t there, this would be a great photo.  I know you can''t help the sign though.  I like how the line of the top boulder is parallel with the telephone wire.</td>', 'I think if the colors were a little more intense and that sign wasn''t there, this would be a great photo.  I know you can''t help the sign though.  I like how the line of the top boulder is parallel with the telephone wire.', '2005-02-17 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178034, 147402, 32997, '<td valign="top">Contrast is wonderful.</td>', 'Contrast is wonderful.', '2005-02-17 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178038, 147264, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the line of light in the grass- makes a nice symmetry. This is surely as serene as highway overpasses ever get :)</td>', 'I like the line of light in the grass- makes a nice symmetry. This is surely as serene as highway overpasses ever get :)', '2005-02-17 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178040, 145790, 32997, '<td valign="top">It feels like a painting..very effective!</td>', 'It feels like a painting..very effective!', '2005-02-17 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178044, 147326, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love the greyscale old quality to capture the subject of stones in this bridge.  The cropping (or original in-camera composition) seems to truncate the top of the stonework of the bridge, distracting my view a bit.  Lovely photo.</td>', 'I love the greyscale old quality to capture the subject of stones in this bridge.  The cropping (or original in-camera composition) seems to truncate the top of the stonework of the bridge, distracting my view a bit.  Lovely photo.', '2005-02-17 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178045, 146989, 31865, '<td valign="top">lovely photo.  What part of italy is Malgrate in?  Looks beautiful.  But then, all of Italy is beautiful.</td>', 'lovely photo.  What part of italy is Malgrate in?  Looks beautiful.  But then, all of Italy is beautiful.', '2005-02-17 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178051, 147006, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great little bridge, but I really think it would be a more effective photo if some part of it were the focus - that is, if the rocks and trees were a little blurred compared to the bridge. Or maybe if you had chosen to have a different angle or detail shown. Now that I think about, it could just be that it''s small (you''re allowed 640 px at the longest end and you have used only 432).</td>', 'I think this is a great little bridge, but I really think it would be a more effective photo if some part of it were the focus - that is, if the rocks and trees were a little blurred compared to the bridge. Or maybe if you had chosen to have a different angle or detail shown. Now that I think about, it could just be that it''s small (you''re allowed 640 px at the longest end and you have used only 432).', '2005-02-17 16:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178054, 145822, 31865, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque.  I love the blurred birds.  Nice tones too.  This isn''t Portland is it?  The bridges look familiar but the Scene doesnt.</td>', 'Very picturesque.  I love the blurred birds.  Nice tones too.  This isn''t Portland is it?  The bridges look familiar but the Scene doesnt.', '2005-02-17 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178056, 147030, 18318, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting Shot. Love the sky on this image. 10 all the way!!!</td>', 'Very Interesting Shot. Love the sky on this image. 10 all the way!!!', '2005-02-17 16:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178058, 147604, 20168, '<td valign="top">Spectacular mood!  One of my favorites to win this challenge. 10</td>', 'Spectacular mood!  One of my favorites to win this challenge. 10', '2005-02-17 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178061, 147450, 31133, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is nice. The reflections are perfect. It''s a very spooky image. I like that you didn''t crop out the single lamp.</td>', 'Whoa, this is nice. The reflections are perfect. It''s a very spooky image. I like that you didn''t crop out the single lamp.', '2005-02-17 16:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178062, 146251, 31865, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Wish it was bigger.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Wish it was bigger.', '2005-02-17 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178064, 146222, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great angle giving us the viewers a sense of vertigo.  Greens work well in color scheme.</td>', 'Great angle giving us the viewers a sense of vertigo.  Greens work well in color scheme.', '2005-02-17 16:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178067, 147625, 18318, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Image but it doesnt really fit the challenge. otherwise 10/10. Sorry for low mark</td>', 'Fantastic Image but it doesnt really fit the challenge. otherwise 10/10. Sorry for low mark', '2005-02-17 16:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178071, 146907, 18318, '<td valign="top">Otical illusion. nice</td>', 'Otical illusion. nice', '2005-02-17 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178077, 147446, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is another great shot! Beautiful colors and composition. The lights under the bridge look so cool behind the near silouhettes of the boats. Can''t think of a single constructive criticism - oh wait, yes I can, but it''s little: The group of two boats plus a restaurant on the far left could have been cropped out. But then maybe you wouldn''t have had such a nice long, arch-effect of seeing the whole bridge...</td>', 'This is another great shot! Beautiful colors and composition. The lights under the bridge look so cool behind the near silouhettes of the boats. Can''t think of a single constructive criticism - oh wait, yes I can, but it''s little: The group of two boats plus a restaurant on the far left could have been cropped out. But then maybe you wouldn''t have had such a nice long, arch-effect of seeing the whole bridge...', '2005-02-17 16:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178078, 147569, 18318, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Composition</td>', 'Fantastic Composition', '2005-02-17 16:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178083, 146261, 18318, '<td valign="top">Superb</td>', 'Superb', '2005-02-17 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178085, 147261, 18318, '<td valign="top">nice geometry</td>', 'nice geometry', '2005-02-17 16:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178089, 147515, 18318, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-02-17 16:41:33.000000', NULL, 1);
