(1178350, 145783, 18128, '<td valign="top">6.2 and climbing ,Keith should know all about B&amp;W at his age ,by the way colours cheaper than B&amp;W film anyway?? HAHA.gave you a 10 (feeling sorry for you)!!!!!</td>', '6.2 and climbing ,Keith should know all about B&W at his age ,by the way colours cheaper than B&W film anyway?? HAHA.gave you a 10 (feeling sorry for you)!!!!!', '2005-02-17 18:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178352, 147553, 26450, '<td valign="top">that is so cool.. love the colors on this.. great job.. 10</td>', 'that is so cool.. love the colors on this.. great job.. 10', '2005-02-17 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178358, 147015, 30214, '<td valign="top">great photo or the bridge which is very familar to me :) Great timig for a well-balanced lighting, bad weather worked to your advantage here.</td>', 'great photo or the bridge which is very familar to me :) Great timig for a well-balanced lighting, bad weather worked to your advantage here.', '2005-02-17 18:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178362, 145807, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice photo overall, my only gripe is that bridge is somewhat secondary in the shot</td>', 'nice photo overall, my only gripe is that bridge is somewhat secondary in the shot', '2005-02-17 18:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178363, 147450, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The overwhelming brown tones drown out a little of the detail in this, but I think, given the title, the mood the colours set works for the theme/feel of the photograph.  Very dark and a little eerie - nice job.</td>', 'Very nice.  The overwhelming brown tones drown out a little of the detail in this, but I think, given the title, the mood the colours set works for the theme/feel of the photograph.  Very dark and a little eerie - nice job.', '2005-02-17 18:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178365, 147377, 30214, '<td valign="top">i am not sure I like the crop here.</td>', 'i am not sure I like the crop here.', '2005-02-17 18:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178368, 147564, 30214, '<td valign="top">the crop could be a lot better: lots of snow in front, and cropped ligh posts on the bridge...</td>', 'the crop could be a lot better: lots of snow in front, and cropped ligh posts on the bridge...', '2005-02-17 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178369, 145832, 16790, '<td valign="top">The colours here are decent, and the focus is good.  The composition is interesting with the various lines sort of coming to a point on the right near the vertical center.  The only thing I would love to see different would be if the sky were not cloudy/washed out - blue sky peeking through would really have made this.  Still, an appealing image if a little lacking in vibrancy.</td>', 'The colours here are decent, and the focus is good.  The composition is interesting with the various lines sort of coming to a point on the right near the vertical center.  The only thing I would love to see different would be if the sky were not cloudy/washed out - blue sky peeking through would really have made this.  Still, an appealing image if a little lacking in vibrancy.', '2005-02-17 18:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178371, 147577, 30214, '<td valign="top">is this a bridge? nice abstract, though</td>', 'is this a bridge? nice abstract, though', '2005-02-17 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178372, 147259, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice long-exposure photo</td>', 'nice long-exposure photo', '2005-02-17 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178374, 146308, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting</td>', 'beautiful lighting', '2005-02-17 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178375, 147533, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is lovely - the exposure is perfect, and this has a wonderful, sentimental feel about it.  The softness that I assume is processing does work for this particular picture very well, and the sepia tones are right on.  Lovely work!</td>', 'This is lovely - the exposure is perfect, and this has a wonderful, sentimental feel about it.  The softness that I assume is processing does work for this particular picture very well, and the sepia tones are right on.  Lovely work!', '2005-02-17 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178376, 146923, 30214, '<td valign="top">wow, what an envious location!!!</td>', 'wow, what an envious location!!!', '2005-02-17 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178377, 147588, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love how the deep shadows add such a large amount of contrast without the whites being blown out - this is a well balanced and very appealing image.  The details are fantastic.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love how the deep shadows add such a large amount of contrast without the whites being blown out - this is a well balanced and very appealing image.  The details are fantastic.  Excellent work.', '2005-02-17 18:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178380, 146593, 30214, '<td valign="top">seems a little under-exposed</td>', 'seems a little under-exposed', '2005-02-17 18:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178381, 147340, 30214, '<td valign="top">i''d love to be in Venice for this challenge, too:)</td>', 'i''d love to be in Venice for this challenge, too:)', '2005-02-17 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178382, 147418, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like the strong lines of the top half of this photograph, but I find the rocks to be.. a bit distracting, especially where the light is shining through on the left side.  I think this could have been improved by leaving less of the rock visible - i.e. by having the bottom of the bridge take up 3/4 of the photo instead of half, and by cropping to leave out the highlighted stones.  Still, this has a lot of potential with the strong lines and nicely exposed shadows/highlights of the bridge.  Good effort!</td>', 'I like the strong lines of the top half of this photograph, but I find the rocks to be.. a bit distracting, especially where the light is shining through on the left side.  I think this could have been improved by leaving less of the rock visible - i.e. by having the bottom of the bridge take up 3/4 of the photo instead of half, and by cropping to leave out the highlighted stones.  Still, this has a lot of potential with the strong lines and nicely exposed shadows/highlights of the bridge.  Good effort!', '2005-02-17 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178385, 146950, 30214, '<td valign="top">great shot. The rainbow is somewhat secondary in it, though</td>', 'great shot. The rainbow is somewhat secondary in it, though', '2005-02-17 18:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178386, 146907, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective</td>', 'interesting perspective', '2005-02-17 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178389, 147551, 30214, '<td valign="top">I guess the timing of the shot is not good - it is almost invisible agains the dark background</td>', 'I guess the timing of the shot is not good - it is almost invisible agains the dark background', '2005-02-17 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178390, 147176, 16790, '<td valign="top">These colours feel just a tad cool to me, probably because of the blue-green hue of the snow.  I assume this is because that bit was in shadow?  Regardless, the sunny highlight on the grass bits and the nice dashes of golden colour shining through the steel looks lovely, and the pastels of the sky work nicely in contrast to the greys of metal and concrete.  I would probably like this a bit more if the right side were cropped so that the building (?)  did not occupy a small bit of the edge, but it is still a strong image. Nice work.</td>', 'These colours feel just a tad cool to me, probably because of the blue-green hue of the snow.  I assume this is because that bit was in shadow?  Regardless, the sunny highlight on the grass bits and the nice dashes of golden colour shining through the steel looks lovely, and the pastels of the sky work nicely in contrast to the greys of metal and concrete.  I would probably like this a bit more if the right side were cropped so that the building (?)  did not occupy a small bit of the edge, but it is still a strong image. Nice work.', '2005-02-17 18:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178392, 147608, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and color tonality</td>', 'nice lighting and color tonality', '2005-02-17 18:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178395, 147446, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very clear and pretty!  The colours are fantastic, and I like how the boats and the bridge are little more than silhouettes.  I would love to see a closer zoom of this, however, maybe cropping out the leftmost boats that are cut off on the edge?  I cannot help but feel that there''s no real main focus.  That said, this is still a gorgeous picture that is great to look at as a whole even if no particular part of it draws the eye more than any other.  The focus is great, the light level/exposure is perfect, and the scene is just beautiful.  Great job!</td>', 'Very clear and pretty!  The colours are fantastic, and I like how the boats and the bridge are little more than silhouettes.  I would love to see a closer zoom of this, however, maybe cropping out the leftmost boats that are cut off on the edge?  I cannot help but feel that there''s no real main focus.  That said, this is still a gorgeous picture that is great to look at as a whole even if no particular part of it draws the eye more than any other.  The focus is great, the light level/exposure is perfect, and the scene is just beautiful.  Great job!', '2005-02-17 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178396, 147151, 30214, '<td valign="top">sorry, did not get the title</td>', 'sorry, did not get the title', '2005-02-17 18:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178397, 147248, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice balance of artificial lighting and sky</td>', 'nice balance of artificial lighting and sky', '2005-02-17 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178399, 147380, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... the silky smoothness of the water compliments the crisp lines of the bridge very nicely, and the border really suits this picture.  I love the faint blue tones and the deep shadows - the exposure is perfect with no blown out highlights and just the right amount of contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful... the silky smoothness of the water compliments the crisp lines of the bridge very nicely, and the border really suits this picture.  I love the faint blue tones and the deep shadows - the exposure is perfect with no blown out highlights and just the right amount of contrast.', '2005-02-17 18:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178400, 146837, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice composition - gives a feeling of lightness and height of the bridge</td>', 'nice composition - gives a feeling of lightness and height of the bridge', '2005-02-17 18:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178402, 147460, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective, but technically the shot is so-so. Great DOF would help a lot.</td>', 'interesting perspective, but technically the shot is so-so. Great DOF would help a lot.', '2005-02-17 18:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178405, 146928, 33182, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, but other than the title there is nothing to actually "bridge" the title with the picture. It''s a nice picture, but I would have liked to have seen a child for the father to show his devotion on.</td>', 'I really like the concept, but other than the title there is nothing to actually "bridge" the title with the picture. It''s a nice picture, but I would have liked to have seen a child for the father to show his devotion on.', '2005-02-17 18:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
