(1178420, 147505, 16790, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the soft focus/post processing (?) on this one, as it contains a person - otherwise, I think it would be much more effectively pulled off.  I do like the composition, and the setting is lovely; my only suggestion would be to perhaps warm the colours a tad, as warmer colours do tend to look nicer with a soft focus.</td>', 'Not sure about the soft focus/post processing (?) on this one, as it contains a person - otherwise, I think it would be much more effectively pulled off.  I do like the composition, and the setting is lovely; my only suggestion would be to perhaps warm the colours a tad, as warmer colours do tend to look nicer with a soft focus.', '2005-02-17 19:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178421, 146620, 33542, '<td valign="top">I love the bridge... I wonder if they did the XOX on purpose. As for composition, I think it would have been better to show the road after the bridge rather than in front b/c it sends the message that you are travelling past the bridge, not just to it (you could have done it by taking the picture from the other side of the bridge)... it''s a matter of personal preference, I guess. Also, I would not have cropped off the top of the bridge, although that''s minor.</td>', 'I love the bridge... I wonder if they did the XOX on purpose. As for composition, I think it would have been better to show the road after the bridge rather than in front b/c it sends the message that you are travelling past the bridge, not just to it (you could have done it by taking the picture from the other side of the bridge)... it''s a matter of personal preference, I guess. Also, I would not have cropped off the top of the bridge, although that''s minor.', '2005-02-17 19:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178425, 147600, 30214, '<td valign="top">I like the idea very much, and a great shot of "The gates"!</td>', 'I like the idea very much, and a great shot of "The gates"!', '2005-02-17 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
