(1178477, 146833, 33542, '<td valign="top">Might have been nice to see more of the bridge (vertically), and I would have liked to see this picture in color, but I like the motion of the water and the exposure level is perfect.</td>', 'Might have been nice to see more of the bridge (vertically), and I would have liked to see this picture in color, but I like the motion of the water and the exposure level is perfect.', '2005-02-17 19:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
