(1178767, 147502, 32769, '<td valign="top">Great pic...this bridge makes me very happy..looking at it takes me to a wonderful place! the tree makes a good spot to spend time sitting on a blanket while kicking off my shoes and reading to myself...Good job!</td>', 'Great pic...this bridge makes me very happy..looking at it takes me to a wonderful place! the tree makes a good spot to spend time sitting on a blanket while kicking off my shoes and reading to myself...Good job!', '2005-02-17 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
