(1178773, 147493, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''m tempted to challenge this photo for validation - something about it just doesn''t seem real to me - but I could be wrong.  ;-)</td>', 'I''m tempted to challenge this photo for validation - something about it just doesn''t seem real to me - but I could be wrong.  ;-)', '2005-02-17 21:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178777, 147232, 31319, '<td valign="top">Dynamic perspective</td>', 'Dynamic perspective', '2005-02-17 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178778, 147444, 28742, '<td valign="top">Aaaagghhh! WHERE is this magical place?? Awesome! You''ll have to change the title to "At the Blue Ribbon Lagoon" :-)</td>', 'Aaaagghhh! WHERE is this magical place?? Awesome! You''ll have to change the title to "At the Blue Ribbon Lagoon" :-)', '2005-02-17 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178781, 147577, 31319, '<td valign="top">Muscular architectural study.</td>', 'Muscular architectural study.', '2005-02-17 21:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178794, 147402, 31319, '<td valign="top">Surreal</td>', 'Surreal', '2005-02-17 21:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178803, 147452, 31319, '<td valign="top">Vertiginous symmetry.</td>', 'Vertiginous symmetry.', '2005-02-17 21:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178808, 146009, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice looking couple, but sort of too cliché / corny for my taste. Couldn''t you at least have posed on a real bridge? Best of luck to you - with both challenges.  ;-)</td>', 'Nice shot, nice looking couple, but sort of too cliché / corny for my taste. Couldn''t you at least have posed on a real bridge? Best of luck to you - with both challenges.  ;-)', '2005-02-17 21:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178809, 145740, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, seems like it might''ve been less effort to actually go out and find a bridge.  ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm, seems like it might''ve been less effort to actually go out and find a bridge.  ;-)', '2005-02-17 21:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178813, 147136, 28742, '<td valign="top">Deducting a point for the distracting reflector on the left - not your fault although maybe you could''ve cropped in tighter. Symmetry is good though.</td>', 'Deducting a point for the distracting reflector on the left - not your fault although maybe you could''ve cropped in tighter. Symmetry is good though.', '2005-02-17 21:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178814, 146497, 28742, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of those places the Huns or Mongrols would storm into to burn and pillage. Curious to know where this is.</td>', 'This looks like one of those places the Huns or Mongrols would storm into to burn and pillage. Curious to know where this is.', '2005-02-17 21:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178815, 147362, 30669, '<td valign="top">I love this shot</td>', 'I love this shot', '2005-02-17 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178816, 145790, 6803, '<td valign="top">There is another just like this one, but not as good 7</td>', 'There is another just like this one, but not as good 7', '2005-02-17 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178819, 147302, 33182, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I just don''t get this one.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I just don''t get this one.', '2005-02-17 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178821, 147333, 30669, '<td valign="top">I love this shot</td>', 'I love this shot', '2005-02-17 21:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178824, 146261, 30457, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal value in the greys. Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the tonal value in the greys. Nice composition.', '2005-02-17 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178826, 147042, 28742, '<td valign="top">I love the image, but struggling with the challenge relevance. ...oh, I see - you have the word "Bridge" in the title. I know you will make some case for abstract thinking - doesn''t work for me. :(</td>', 'I love the image, but struggling with the challenge relevance. ...oh, I see - you have the word "Bridge" in the title. I know you will make some case for abstract thinking - doesn''t work for me. :(', '2005-02-17 21:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178827, 146430, 30669, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-02-17 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178828, 147304, 30457, '<td valign="top">Eye catching. Gives the feeling of suspense.</td>', 'Eye catching. Gives the feeling of suspense.', '2005-02-17 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178829, 145790, 30457, '<td valign="top">Very nice. You did a good job on exposing in low light conditions.</td>', 'Very nice. You did a good job on exposing in low light conditions.', '2005-02-17 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178830, 147208, 33182, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get this one, Sorry. At first I thought you were going for the bridge of the nose, but you don''t really show it.</td>', 'I just don''t get this one, Sorry. At first I thought you were going for the bridge of the nose, but you don''t really show it.', '2005-02-17 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178877, 147607, 14735, '<td valign="top">Wondered how many people would choose the symbolic road. Very nice photo, good light</td>', 'Wondered how many people would choose the symbolic road. Very nice photo, good light', '2005-02-17 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178889, 146430, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I really like the perspective here, works great. The cyclist I think really helps an already good shot, it kind of adds a human element that helps the viewer "connect" to the photo. Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot. I really like the perspective here, works great. The cyclist I think really helps an already good shot, it kind of adds a human element that helps the viewer "connect" to the photo. Good job.', '2005-02-17 22:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178891, 146574, 31319, '<td valign="top">Compelling composition.  Seems out of focus?</td>', 'Compelling composition.  Seems out of focus?', '2005-02-17 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178899, 147057, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good perspective. Strong interesting lines. I see the lines of the bridge, the lights, evrything flowing in one direction, and then are nicely opposed by the angle of the large support structure. Gives a good path for the eye to travel and then takes you to a strong focal point. Good job.</td>', 'Nicely composed, good perspective. Strong interesting lines. I see the lines of the bridge, the lights, evrything flowing in one direction, and then are nicely opposed by the angle of the large support structure. Gives a good path for the eye to travel and then takes you to a strong focal point. Good job.', '2005-02-17 22:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178901, 147560, 31319, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to shoot; the light is perpetually harsh and the shadows deep. You''ve done well.</td>', 'This is a tough one to shoot; the light is perpetually harsh and the shadows deep. You''ve done well.', '2005-02-17 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178906, 147416, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasant composition. Strong leading lines and interesting texture. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice pleasant composition. Strong leading lines and interesting texture. Good shot.', '2005-02-17 22:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178907, 146234, 31319, '<td valign="top">What a curious structure.  Technically strong.</td>', 'What a curious structure.  Technically strong.', '2005-02-17 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178910, 146600, 31319, '<td valign="top">The hard angle just doesn''t work for me, but undeniably an enviable location and fabulous subject.</td>', 'The hard angle just doesn''t work for me, but undeniably an enviable location and fabulous subject.', '2005-02-17 22:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178915, 146740, 31319, '<td valign="top">Intense lighting is great.  Maybe could use an ever so slight ccw rotation?</td>', 'Intense lighting is great.  Maybe could use an ever so slight ccw rotation?', '2005-02-17 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178916, 147556, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see a good complimenting of color, or balance between the water and the sky, split nicely by the bridge, however, I''m wondering if perhaps this would be a much stronger shot by placing the bridge/horizon lower or higher. I''m not normally a real stickler for having to use the rot all the time, but I think it might help in this case.</td>', 'I see a good complimenting of color, or balance between the water and the sky, split nicely by the bridge, however, I''m wondering if perhaps this would be a much stronger shot by placing the bridge/horizon lower or higher. I''m not normally a real stickler for having to use the rot all the time, but I think it might help in this case.', '2005-02-17 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178926, 147507, 31319, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and laudable, that you chose to pan back over the city rather than the bridge. Kudos for composing out of the box.</td>', 'Interesting, and laudable, that you chose to pan back over the city rather than the bridge. Kudos for composing out of the box.', '2005-02-17 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178930, 147000, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. I like the negative space of the darkness. Good leading lines and the light reflections are perfect.</td>', 'Very nice job. I like the negative space of the darkness. Good leading lines and the light reflections are perfect.', '2005-02-17 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178931, 147445, 31319, '<td valign="top">What an exotic location!</td>', 'What an exotic location!', '2005-02-17 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178932, 147277, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Composition is good. I think would be better if focus were sharper and a little bit of light on the subject to bring out some detail.</td>', 'Cute idea. Composition is good. I think would be better if focus were sharper and a little bit of light on the subject to bring out some detail.', '2005-02-17 22:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178935, 147424, 31319, '<td valign="top">Oh miy gosh - so modern.  Not my perception of the Nile.  Offers a new insight to an ancient geological feature.  Perhaps the rail at the bottom could have been cropped with no sacrifice to the message of the pic?</td>', 'Oh miy gosh - so modern.  Not my perception of the Nile.  Offers a new insight to an ancient geological feature.  Perhaps the rail at the bottom could have been cropped with no sacrifice to the message of the pic?', '2005-02-17 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178940, 147451, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the starburst effect on the lights. May seem a bit nitpicky, but might be a little better if you''d have let the plane pass by so as not to have the distracting light in the middle of the sky.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the starburst effect on the lights. May seem a bit nitpicky, but might be a little better if you''d have let the plane pass by so as not to have the distracting light in the middle of the sky.', '2005-02-17 22:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
