(1179180, 147574, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love the way this photo disappears into utter darkness, leading us into mystery, a great photo of faith, as we step out across the suspension, into the unknown future, our only confidence in the strength of the Bridge and the Bridgebuilder to support our lives as we journey onward.  Cool photo!</td>', 'I love the way this photo disappears into utter darkness, leading us into mystery, a great photo of faith, as we step out across the suspension, into the unknown future, our only confidence in the strength of the Bridge and the Bridgebuilder to support our lives as we journey onward.  Cool photo!', '2005-02-18 02:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179182, 147429, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love stonework, especially in an old bridge.  What I desire to see is the facade of the stonework, the arch over the water, the beauty of the stones laid in the arching grace over the reflective surface.  The location looks great.</td>', 'I love stonework, especially in an old bridge.  What I desire to see is the facade of the stonework, the arch over the water, the beauty of the stones laid in the arching grace over the reflective surface.  The location looks great.', '2005-02-18 02:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179183, 147607, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great simplicity showing that truth, "less is more".  Thanks for this bridge!</td>', 'Great simplicity showing that truth, "less is more".  Thanks for this bridge!', '2005-02-18 02:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179187, 146569, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely sepia duotone for this covered bridge.  You have my covered bridge shot beat hands down!  I love the symmetry of the bridge siding and the spillway lines.  Best of luck!</td>', 'Lovely sepia duotone for this covered bridge.  You have my covered bridge shot beat hands down!  I love the symmetry of the bridge siding and the spillway lines.  Best of luck!', '2005-02-18 02:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179192, 146168, 20168, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the complementary colors in the vibrant red and blue, set off by the purity of the white trim and snow.  Great time of day to capture this historic beauty.  You have my covered bridge photo outdistanced by two whole points!  Best of luck.</td>', 'I enjoy the complementary colors in the vibrant red and blue, set off by the purity of the white trim and snow.  Great time of day to capture this historic beauty.  You have my covered bridge photo outdistanced by two whole points!  Best of luck.', '2005-02-18 02:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179196, 146950, 20168, '<td valign="top">My choice for a ribbon...an outstanding photo: colors, composition, capture, lighting focus, depth.  Mythical.  What is that white glitch in the turf in the lower left?  That''s the only possible detractor.  Still, a standout in an excellent collection of photos.  10</td>', 'My choice for a ribbon...an outstanding photo: colors, composition, capture, lighting focus, depth.  Mythical.  What is that white glitch in the turf in the lower left?  That''s the only possible detractor.  Still, a standout in an excellent collection of photos.  10', '2005-02-18 02:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179198, 147178, 20168, '<td valign="top">One of the outstanding greyscale in this challenge.  Lovely lyrical photo!</td>', 'One of the outstanding greyscale in this challenge.  Lovely lyrical photo!', '2005-02-18 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179200, 146593, 30364, '<td valign="top">Appealing shot; the rubbish bin adds a touch of whimsy, and an extra point. 6.<br/> <br/>P.S.  The forest is leaning a bit to the right.</td>', 'Appealing shot; the rubbish bin adds a touch of whimsy, and an extra point. 6. P.S.  The forest is leaning a bit to the right.', '2005-02-18 02:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179204, 147566, 20168, '<td valign="top">The artist''s truth, "less is more" shines through this simple but profound photo.  Great silhoulette, with the strongest bridge message in the whole challenge.  I especially love the hint of the moon just above the steeple/cross, evoking a yearning for the heavens beyond this mortal life.  Thanks for an extraordinary entry.  10</td>', 'The artist''s truth, "less is more" shines through this simple but profound photo.  Great silhoulette, with the strongest bridge message in the whole challenge.  I especially love the hint of the moon just above the steeple/cross, evoking a yearning for the heavens beyond this mortal life.  Thanks for an extraordinary entry.  10', '2005-02-18 02:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179211, 146923, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nah ... 1903 is too early; the challenge period was Feb 2005.  Sorry, just being a dumass.  It''s a very good photograph.  Your composition (even if it is from a standard lookout spot) puts the bridge in context, which obviously adds to the impact.  The bridge and the falls are each enhanced in interest by the presence of the other.  6</td>', 'Nah ... 1903 is too early; the challenge period was Feb 2005.  Sorry, just being a dumass.  It''s a very good photograph.  Your composition (even if it is from a standard lookout spot) puts the bridge in context, which obviously adds to the impact.  The bridge and the falls are each enhanced in interest by the presence of the other.  6', '2005-02-18 02:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179214, 145786, 20168, '<td valign="top">Love the cello, warm tones, though the strings seem just a wee bit blurred.  Great alternative to the other entries.</td>', 'Love the cello, warm tones, though the strings seem just a wee bit blurred.  Great alternative to the other entries.', '2005-02-18 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179222, 147429, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is bold; making the bridge more interesting by not revealing it.  Must be a feminine bridge, I guess.  Anyway, it works ... the dark reflections and the viscous-looking water with its mysterious sub-surface swirls hint at what kind of a bridge this might be.  Forces the viewer to imagine it.  And there''s nothing wrong with that, as an artistic proposition.  7.</td>', 'This is bold; making the bridge more interesting by not revealing it.  Must be a feminine bridge, I guess.  Anyway, it works ... the dark reflections and the viscous-looking water with its mysterious sub-surface swirls hint at what kind of a bridge this might be.  Forces the viewer to imagine it.  And there''s nothing wrong with that, as an artistic proposition.  7.', '2005-02-18 02:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179234, 147223, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wow, you guys really brand everything!  Very interesting perspective and perfect lighting to emphasise that Lone Star.  7</td>', 'Wow, you guys really brand everything!  Very interesting perspective and perfect lighting to emphasise that Lone Star.  7', '2005-02-18 02:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
