(1179382, 145832, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and details of picture... I think i would croped more from top. That dark pillar bit distract eye to go all the way on bridge.</td>', 'Nice colors and details of picture... I think i would croped more from top. That dark pillar bit distract eye to go all the way on bridge.', '2005-02-18 05:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179383, 146217, 25024, '<td valign="top">I can''t helpbut feel you could have got a better shot by panning more to your right and including that lovely bend in the bridge. This would have emphasised the bridge, removed the distracting elements on the left and fit the challenge much better.  Please regard this as constructive criticism - it is not a bad shot at all</td>', 'I can''t helpbut feel you could have got a better shot by panning more to your right and including that lovely bend in the bridge. This would have emphasised the bridge, removed the distracting elements on the left and fit the challenge much better.  Please regard this as constructive criticism - it is not a bad shot at all', '2005-02-18 05:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179385, 147607, 25024, '<td valign="top">A good attempt at the unusual and thinking out of the box - well done</td>', 'A good attempt at the unusual and thinking out of the box - well done', '2005-02-18 05:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
