(1179448, 147318, 17507, '<td valign="top">what a great place to shoot. that tresswork does produce some interesting curves. I feel like there''s a wee bit too much sky, and I think an adjustment to the levels would really bring out the depth in the metal.</td>', 'what a great place to shoot. that tresswork does produce some interesting curves. I feel like there''s a wee bit too much sky, and I think an adjustment to the levels would really bring out the depth in the metal.', '2005-02-18 06:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179450, 147340, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  And if I wanted to cross it, it would have to be sans wife.  It''s an appealing, whimsical photograph ... maybe it''s the umbrella.  7</td>', 'Yes it is.  And if I wanted to cross it, it would have to be sans wife.  It''s an appealing, whimsical photograph ... maybe it''s the umbrella.  7', '2005-02-18 06:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179451, 145921, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hm... did you try taking pictures that didn''t include the sign? i feel like it''s distracting me from the rest of a very pretty image. (7)</td>', 'Hm... did you try taking pictures that didn''t include the sign? i feel like it''s distracting me from the rest of a very pretty image. (7)', '2005-02-18 06:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179452, 147567, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Colors are amazing!</td>', 'Very nice! Colors are amazing!', '2005-02-18 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179455, 145740, 31046, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of vigneting on this photo .... also looks like flash has been used ...<br/>not very good!</td>', 'There is a lot of vigneting on this photo .... also looks like flash has been used ...not very good!', '2005-02-18 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179458, 147606, 31046, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition! The reflection is very cool!<br/>The colors are a bit weird</td>', 'Excellent composition! The reflection is very cool!The colors are a bit weird', '2005-02-18 06:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179460, 146833, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!</td>', 'Very cool idea!', '2005-02-18 06:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179462, 147451, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Title is inappropriate; it appears anything but troubled water.  6</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Title is inappropriate; it appears anything but troubled water.  6', '2005-02-18 06:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179463, 147429, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shapes and colors. image is a bit dark, though. selective color and levels will do wonders, though i guess it would be hard to avoid blowing out the reflected sky.</td>', 'Great shapes and colors. image is a bit dark, though. selective color and levels will do wonders, though i guess it would be hard to avoid blowing out the reflected sky.', '2005-02-18 06:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179472, 147604, 31046, '<td valign="top">Good one, excellent perspective!</td>', 'Good one, excellent perspective!', '2005-02-18 06:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179474, 147563, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unlike most absurdly small entries, this one is a very good photograph.  It looks like a beautiful, quiet scene, a nice composition and well executed in camera and after.  But it''s just too small for you to get the full credit you probably deserve.  5</td>', 'Unlike most absurdly small entries, this one is a very good photograph.  It looks like a beautiful, quiet scene, a nice composition and well executed in camera and after.  But it''s just too small for you to get the full credit you probably deserve.  5', '2005-02-18 06:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179477, 146929, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and colors</td>', 'Very good composition and colors', '2005-02-18 06:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179480, 146526, 31046, '<td valign="top">Good perspective</td>', 'Good perspective', '2005-02-18 06:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179482, 146217, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve left too much of the bridge out.  Deliberately, obviously, but I just can''t see any reason why.  Even a bit more bridge would have made it work better for me.  Sorry.  4</td>', 'I think you''ve left too much of the bridge out.  Deliberately, obviously, but I just can''t see any reason why.  Even a bit more bridge would have made it work better for me.  Sorry.  4', '2005-02-18 06:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179483, 147569, 31046, '<td valign="top">Perfect colors, average composition</td>', 'Perfect colors, average composition', '2005-02-18 06:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179485, 147061, 31046, '<td valign="top">Average composition, terrible colors.</td>', 'Average composition, terrible colors.', '2005-02-18 06:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179486, 147533, 30364, '<td valign="top">How''d he jump off this then?  Is there a window?  <br/>It''s a terrific image: just enough interior detail to work, not enough to blow out the background.  Nice figure (BJ?), plus good camera and processing work.  8.</td>', 'How''d he jump off this then?  Is there a window?  It''s a terrific image: just enough interior detail to work, not enough to blow out the background.  Nice figure (BJ?), plus good camera and processing work.  8.', '2005-02-18 06:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179487, 147601, 30364, '<td valign="top">What I love about this photograph is that you haven''t just taken a dramatic photo of a big, serious, imposing bridge (there''s dozens of those).  Instead you''ve taken a position regarding your subject bridge.  It may be a rather wacky position, but at least you''re saying something!  So, even though this is not the most technically perfect image, it has an artistic vitality that''s missing from virtually all of the many images that will inevitably finish higher in the voting.  Therefore I''ll do my tiny bit to redress that.  10</td>', 'What I love about this photograph is that you haven''t just taken a dramatic photo of a big, serious, imposing bridge (there''s dozens of those).  Instead you''ve taken a position regarding your subject bridge.  It may be a rather wacky position, but at least you''re saying something!  So, even though this is not the most technically perfect image, it has an artistic vitality that''s missing from virtually all of the many images that will inevitably finish higher in the voting.  Therefore I''ll do my tiny bit to redress that.  10', '2005-02-18 06:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179488, 146283, 31046, '<td valign="top">Good quality, average composition</td>', 'Good quality, average composition', '2005-02-18 06:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179490, 147535, 31046, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit dull</td>', 'Looks a bit dull', '2005-02-18 06:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179492, 146430, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very good composition</td>', 'Very good composition', '2005-02-18 06:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179494, 147030, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, good colors</td>', 'Very interesting, good colors', '2005-02-18 06:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179496, 146487, 31046, '<td valign="top">Good composition, maybe needs a little bit more sky</td>', 'Good composition, maybe needs a little bit more sky', '2005-02-18 06:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179498, 147125, 31046, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and composition, does not look sharp enough</td>', 'Excellent subject and composition, does not look sharp enough', '2005-02-18 06:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179500, 147015, 31046, '<td valign="top">Excellent, very good colors</td>', 'Excellent, very good colors', '2005-02-18 06:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179503, 146817, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is terrific, and everything that makes it so impressive happened in your head.  Great imagination!  Some pedants might quibble about minor technical issues, but the hell with them .. they didn''t have this good idea, you did.  Well done.  8</td>', 'This is terrific, and everything that makes it so impressive happened in your head.  Great imagination!  Some pedants might quibble about minor technical issues, but the hell with them .. they didn''t have this good idea, you did.  Well done.  8', '2005-02-18 06:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179504, 147023, 22431, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft.', '2005-02-18 06:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179507, 147293, 31046, '<td valign="top">Stunning in every aspect!<br/>The sky is unbelievable!</td>', 'Stunning in every aspect!The sky is unbelievable!', '2005-02-18 06:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179509, 146923, 27812, '<td valign="top">I have seen this in my life under less nice circumstances. What you now are doing is showing me the true beauty of this wonderfull world. Magnificent picture. 10</td>', 'I have seen this in my life under less nice circumstances. What you now are doing is showing me the true beauty of this wonderfull world. Magnificent picture. 10', '2005-02-18 06:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179512, 146856, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo! Excellent composition!</td>', 'Very interesting photo! Excellent composition!', '2005-02-18 06:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179515, 146640, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, the sky looks a bit odd but still good</td>', 'Very good composition, the sky looks a bit odd but still good', '2005-02-18 06:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179517, 146950, 30364, '<td valign="top">The very best of all the metaphorical bridge images in the challenge.  First, it''s a worthy metaphor; not strained at all.  And second, it''s a worthy photograph of the henge.  The rainbow is also useful; it looks good, and helps those with limited imagination to participate.  10.</td>', 'The very best of all the metaphorical bridge images in the challenge.  First, it''s a worthy metaphor; not strained at all.  And second, it''s a worthy photograph of the henge.  The rainbow is also useful; it looks good, and helps those with limited imagination to participate.  10.', '2005-02-18 06:56:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1179527, 146456, 31046, '<td valign="top">Amazing! Excellent composition and colors!</td>', 'Amazing! Excellent composition and colors!', '2005-02-18 07:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179534, 147303, 30498, '<td valign="top">A uinque one.</td>', 'A uinque one.', '2005-02-18 07:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179543, 147164, 30364, '<td valign="top">A good idea that says something original about a bridge.  7</td>', 'A good idea that says something original about a bridge.  7', '2005-02-18 07:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179545, 146950, 19643, '<td valign="top">Incredible color in this photograph.  I especially like the grass in the foreground, amazing that in the winter, it is still so green.  This shot should be on a postcard!!  My choice for the Blue. 10!</td>', 'Incredible color in this photograph.  I especially like the grass in the foreground, amazing that in the winter, it is still so green.  This shot should be on a postcard!!  My choice for the Blue. 10!', '2005-02-18 07:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179549, 147178, 30364, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''ve seen this before.  Not this shot, or even this bridge, but this idea.  Anyway, it''s a visually striking image, very well composed/cropped for maximum impact.  8</td>', 'I feel like I''ve seen this before.  Not this shot, or even this bridge, but this idea.  Anyway, it''s a visually striking image, very well composed/cropped for maximum impact.  8', '2005-02-18 07:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179551, 147042, 31046, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo</td>', 'Very interesting photo', '2005-02-18 07:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179559, 147453, 31046, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the colors and exposure don''t look quite right</td>', 'Good composition, but the colors and exposure don''t look quite right', '2005-02-18 07:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179564, 147403, 30364, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the several good "underneath" shots.  I like the beautiful warm lighting.  (How''d you do that; is it sunlight?  It''s not upside down, is it?)  And the receding geometric shapes look great as well.  A well composed and well executed image.  8</td>', 'My favourite of the several good "underneath" shots.  I like the beautiful warm lighting.  (How''d you do that; is it sunlight?  It''s not upside down, is it?)  And the receding geometric shapes look great as well.  A well composed and well executed image.  8', '2005-02-18 07:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179565, 147302, 25024, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original - good luck</td>', 'Interesting and original - good luck', '2005-02-18 07:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179566, 147507, 25735, '<td valign="top">without any comment, i would like to thank you very much for this great photo. honestly this is one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'without any comment, i would like to thank you very much for this great photo. honestly this is one of the best in this challenge.', '2005-02-18 07:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
