(1179590, 146164, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice composition adn the light is decent. I hate to sey it but it looks like a touristy shot because the people in the shot- perhaps its a bit blue too- but you knew all this. I like the sky alot.</td>', 'Nice composition adn the light is decent. I hate to sey it but it looks like a touristy shot because the people in the shot- perhaps its a bit blue too- but you knew all this. I like the sky alot.', '2005-02-18 07:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
