(1179600, 147591, 12611, '<td valign="top">you have much technical skill and patience, but your subject matter is atrocious, <br/>stop kidding around and take some pictures that are artistic. would you paint such a picture, no? than don''t snapshot it. I''m sorry, but what is the sense? Is this going to win a ribbon? do you want it on your wall? I don''t mean to be mean but if you can expose a shot this well, with claritym focus and spot on color, why waste your time for a goof? oh yeah- 7</td>', 'you have much technical skill and patience, but your subject matter is atrocious, stop kidding around and take some pictures that are artistic. would you paint such a picture, no? than don''t snapshot it. I''m sorry, but what is the sense? Is this going to win a ribbon? do you want it on your wall? I don''t mean to be mean but if you can expose a shot this well, with claritym focus and spot on color, why waste your time for a goof? oh yeah- 7', '2005-02-18 07:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
