(1179901, 147277, 16106, '<td valign="top">Clearly there is something going on here I just have no idea what it is. Ilike the shift in colors from blue light to yellow, and the focus is good on the guitar, but the bear is too soft, and the concept is a bit fuzzy too.</td>', 'Clearly there is something going on here I just have no idea what it is. Ilike the shift in colors from blue light to yellow, and the focus is good on the guitar, but the bear is too soft, and the concept is a bit fuzzy too.', '2005-02-18 11:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179904, 147448, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice masses but too contrasty</td>', 'nice masses but too contrasty', '2005-02-18 11:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179910, 146485, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the resulting graphic is muddled in composition. Technical values are fine, but since you had controll over the composition, you might have done more with this idea.</td>', 'nice idea, but the resulting graphic is muddled in composition. Technical values are fine, but since you had controll over the composition, you might have done more with this idea.', '2005-02-18 12:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
