(1180303, 145672, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.. colours are lovely and the composition is very interesting.  The only thing that bothers me even a little is the treetop... but it looks like to avoid that you''d have lost a lot of the water, and I''d rather see the treetop :)  Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful.. colours are lovely and the composition is very interesting.  The only thing that bothers me even a little is the treetop... but it looks like to avoid that you''d have lost a lot of the water, and I''d rather see the treetop :)  Good job.', '2005-02-18 15:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
