(1180307, 146432, 16790, '<td valign="top">Eww... nice clarity, though.  The design on what I assume is a plate is a little distracting, though, and I''m not sure about whatever is in the background.  If you could''ve used a solid white plate and a more solid background, this would be much more appealing and easy to see.  Still, the detail is great.</td>', 'Eww... nice clarity, though.  The design on what I assume is a plate is a little distracting, though, and I''m not sure about whatever is in the background.  If you could''ve used a solid white plate and a more solid background, this would be much more appealing and easy to see.  Still, the detail is great.', '2005-02-18 15:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180310, 147183, 16790, '<td valign="top">This feels as if it''s had the saturation kicked up a tad, and I like the effect.  The vibrant colours really make this feel somehow electric and alive... lovely.  It''d be nice to see a bit more of the reflections below, but as it is it looks pretty awesome.  Nice work!</td>', 'This feels as if it''s had the saturation kicked up a tad, and I like the effect.  The vibrant colours really make this feel somehow electric and alive... lovely.  It''d be nice to see a bit more of the reflections below, but as it is it looks pretty awesome.  Nice work!', '2005-02-18 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180311, 147450, 8284, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this shot.  Great lighting.  Nicely focused.  Wonderfully framed.  Fix your title (Ripper''s) &amp; make this available as a print.</td>', 'I love the feel of this shot.  Great lighting.  Nicely focused.  Wonderfully framed.  Fix your title (Ripper''s) & make this available as a print.', '2005-02-18 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180312, 146399, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very old-world feeling - I like the grain and the slight vignetting here.  The strong sepia tones really seem to work for this particular photo, and the details are great.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Very old-world feeling - I like the grain and the slight vignetting here.  The strong sepia tones really seem to work for this particular photo, and the details are great.  Very nice work!', '2005-02-18 15:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180313, 147564, 8284, '<td valign="top">I guess I won''t be the only one to say this, but the snow &amp; the sky are both blown out.  Title works.  Cropped too low.  Cutting off the lightposts detracts.  Might be too much snow in the foreground.</td>', 'I guess I won''t be the only one to say this, but the snow & the sky are both blown out.  Title works.  Cropped too low.  Cutting off the lightposts detracts.  Might be too much snow in the foreground.', '2005-02-18 15:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180314, 147000, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great night shot.</td>', 'A great night shot.', '2005-02-18 15:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180316, 147458, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the blown out sky, and deep shadows, but otherwise this is gorgeous.  Lovely vista with excellent clarity, and the framing is perfect.  Great job.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the blown out sky, and deep shadows, but otherwise this is gorgeous.  Lovely vista with excellent clarity, and the framing is perfect.  Great job.', '2005-02-18 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180318, 147061, 8284, '<td valign="top">I think B&amp;W works better with this shot.   Too hazy.  The sky is too blown out. Nice composition, though.</td>', 'I think B&W works better with this shot.   Too hazy.  The sky is too blown out. Nice composition, though.', '2005-02-18 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180319, 146954, 16790, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this with a bit more contrast and perhaps some very faint sepia toning.  The composition itself is good, but there doesn''t seem to be a lot of range in the tones - it''d be nice if the bridge stood out just a bit more from the background.  Maybe different lighting?  Nonetheless, meets the challenge and the focus is good.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this with a bit more contrast and perhaps some very faint sepia toning.  The composition itself is good, but there doesn''t seem to be a lot of range in the tones - it''d be nice if the bridge stood out just a bit more from the background.  Maybe different lighting?  Nonetheless, meets the challenge and the focus is good.', '2005-02-18 15:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180324, 146528, 8284, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  My eye travels all over &amp; finds something appealing in every area.  Great color, clarity.  Long exposure?</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  My eye travels all over & finds something appealing in every area.  Great color, clarity.  Long exposure?', '2005-02-18 15:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180325, 147343, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting angle that offers a lot of drama.  At first glance it looks a tad oversharpened, but that might just be because of the high contrast between the lights and darks - which I really like.  The colours and contrast are fantastic, and I like the way you''ve composed this photograph - very fun to look at and very pretty.  Great balance of reflections, bridge, and sky - overall lovely work.</td>', 'This is a very interesting angle that offers a lot of drama.  At first glance it looks a tad oversharpened, but that might just be because of the high contrast between the lights and darks - which I really like.  The colours and contrast are fantastic, and I like the way you''ve composed this photograph - very fun to look at and very pretty.  Great balance of reflections, bridge, and sky - overall lovely work.', '2005-02-18 15:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180328, 146856, 31865, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous composition.  It''s the rule of thirds kicked into high gear.  Beautiful tones as well, and the person (you?) is a nice touch to detail.</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous composition.  It''s the rule of thirds kicked into high gear.  Beautiful tones as well, and the person (you?) is a nice touch to detail.', '2005-02-18 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180329, 147489, 8284, '<td valign="top">This hurts my eyes to look at.  Were you trying to convert to sepia?  Strong color on the left side, gray in the center, pale color on the right.  The bridge itself is a little hard to see.  Composition is framed well enough, I think, but your post-processing needs some work.</td>', 'This hurts my eyes to look at.  Were you trying to convert to sepia?  Strong color on the left side, gray in the center, pale color on the right.  The bridge itself is a little hard to see.  Composition is framed well enough, I think, but your post-processing needs some work.', '2005-02-18 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180330, 147518, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, in the photo as well as in the subject matter.  Good choice to use a curving section of the bridge.  B&amp;W is good here.</td>', 'Nice contrast, in the photo as well as in the subject matter.  Good choice to use a curving section of the bridge.  B&W is good here.', '2005-02-18 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180333, 145410, 31865, '<td valign="top">very nice capture.  Where''s that reflection coming from?   Without the cool reflection it would be just another bridge photo (although well done), but that detail makes this twice the photo.</td>', 'very nice capture.  Where''s that reflection coming from?   Without the cool reflection it would be just another bridge photo (although well done), but that detail makes this twice the photo.', '2005-02-18 15:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180337, 147505, 8284, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Looks like a candid snap.  Would be nice with the bridge in focus, instead of the tree in the foreground, but when it''s done in the moment, sometimes we don''t get to make those decisions.  Nice subtle colors.  I like the haze in the background.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Looks like a candid snap.  Would be nice with the bridge in focus, instead of the tree in the foreground, but when it''s done in the moment, sometimes we don''t get to make those decisions.  Nice subtle colors.  I like the haze in the background.', '2005-02-18 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180338, 147340, 31865, '<td valign="top">Great bridge. Is this venice?  I love the people with the umbrella, but it seems a little too compressed .  I wish it wasn''t because it could be a really beautiful picture, the couple giving it the extra character that makes it great.</td>', 'Great bridge. Is this venice?  I love the people with the umbrella, but it seems a little too compressed .  I wish it wasn''t because it could be a really beautiful picture, the couple giving it the extra character that makes it great.', '2005-02-18 15:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180339, 147158, 16790, '<td valign="top">I love this... the DOF is great and the composition is very striking - it draws the eye to the graffiti but not before the viewer takes in the surroundings.  Your choice of colours and desaturation works perfectly for the mood you''re setting with this - excellent work.</td>', 'I love this... the DOF is great and the composition is very striking - it draws the eye to the graffiti but not before the viewer takes in the surroundings.  Your choice of colours and desaturation works perfectly for the mood you''re setting with this - excellent work.', '2005-02-18 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180340, 147309, 8284, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice clean feel to it.  The stars from the lights are cool.  Good color.  Good composition.</td>', 'This has a really nice clean feel to it.  The stars from the lights are cool.  Good color.  Good composition.', '2005-02-18 15:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180342, 147620, 16790, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, perfectly exposed with excellent clarity and fantastic composition. The background is subtle but really helps to set the mood for this photograph - marvelous work, one of my favourites.</td>', 'Wonderful capture, perfectly exposed with excellent clarity and fantastic composition. The background is subtle but really helps to set the mood for this photograph - marvelous work, one of my favourites.', '2005-02-18 16:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180343, 145817, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice soft feel to this shot.  Wish you could read the plaque better.</td>', 'Nice soft feel to this shot.  Wish you could read the plaque better.', '2005-02-18 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180344, 146923, 33864, '<td valign="top">I bungie jumped from this bridge a few years back . . . thanks for raising that memory!</td>', 'I bungie jumped from this bridge a few years back . . . thanks for raising that memory!', '2005-02-18 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180345, 147333, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous... your exposure is right on and the toning works to perfection.  The clarity and simple dark/light lines make this stunning.</td>', 'Gorgeous... your exposure is right on and the toning works to perfection.  The clarity and simple dark/light lines make this stunning.', '2005-02-18 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180346, 147586, 19333, '<td valign="top">sorry, too dark and small...</td>', 'sorry, too dark and small...', '2005-02-18 16:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180347, 147311, 8284, '<td valign="top">Couple of clouds(?) that look like finger smudges are distracting, but this is a terrific shot.  Like a movie still.  Some kind of mechanical soldiers advancing in the background.  Where''s Arnold?  Nice composition.</td>', 'Couple of clouds(?) that look like finger smudges are distracting, but this is a terrific shot.  Like a movie still.  Some kind of mechanical soldiers advancing in the background.  Where''s Arnold?  Nice composition.', '2005-02-18 16:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180349, 147507, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - composition is perfect in my opinion, and I really like the colours.  DOF is perfect and the light was just right fior this shot.  Nice to see one that doesn''t look oversharpened - and a daylight shot no less! :)  Great work.</td>', 'Gorgeous - composition is perfect in my opinion, and I really like the colours.  DOF is perfect and the light was just right fior this shot.  Nice to see one that doesn''t look oversharpened - and a daylight shot no less! :)  Great work.', '2005-02-18 16:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180350, 147042, 31865, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  There seem to be two bridges in this photo, the sandbridge across the reflection, and the arc of the reflection itself could symbolize a bridging of earth and sky.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  There seem to be two bridges in this photo, the sandbridge across the reflection, and the arc of the reflection itself could symbolize a bridging of earth and sky.', '2005-02-18 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180353, 147577, 8284, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract feel of this.  We have to take your word for it that it''s a bridge, though.</td>', 'I like the abstract feel of this.  We have to take your word for it that it''s a bridge, though.', '2005-02-18 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180361, 147274, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between natural and industrial that you''ve shown here - the composition works, but there are a couple of things that take away from the shot to my eyes.  FIrst is the sense of movement shown by the trains... the very slight blur is in this case just distracting.  My suggestion would be either to use a longer exposure and really blur these well enough to show movement (ND filter maybe? since it seems so bright out?), or just let them be caught in time - stopped but clear.  Second, the sky, which is bright white and causing the upper bits of the metal to be quite blue.  I realize this is hard to expose for, though, and it does kind of work to contrast between the colour below and the cold industrial tones above.  Overall this is an interesting photo with a lot of potential - good effort.</td>', 'I like the contrast between natural and industrial that you''ve shown here - the composition works, but there are a couple of things that take away from the shot to my eyes.  FIrst is the sense of movement shown by the trains... the very slight blur is in this case just distracting.  My suggestion would be either to use a longer exposure and really blur these well enough to show movement (ND filter maybe? since it seems so bright out?), or just let them be caught in time - stopped but clear.  Second, the sky, which is bright white and causing the upper bits of the metal to be quite blue.  I realize this is hard to expose for, though, and it does kind of work to contrast between the colour below and the cold industrial tones above.  Overall this is an interesting photo with a lot of potential - good effort.', '2005-02-18 16:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180363, 147564, 19333, '<td valign="top">way too overexposed... is it a high key attempt? :)</td>', 'way too overexposed... is it a high key attempt? :)', '2005-02-18 16:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180364, 146590, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice colors and lighting</td>', 'nice colors and lighting', '2005-02-18 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180365, 147509, 8284, '<td valign="top">The more modern bridge really spoils a great view.  I like the vertical crop, bringing in the tree limb.  Works really well with the covered bridge.  Focusing on the smaller bridge, blurring the background would help a lot, I think.</td>', 'The more modern bridge really spoils a great view.  I like the vertical crop, bringing in the tree limb.  Works really well with the covered bridge.  Focusing on the smaller bridge, blurring the background would help a lot, I think.', '2005-02-18 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180367, 147552, 16790, '<td valign="top">There''s a feeling of softness here that I can''t quite place, but it looks beautiful.  The lighting really makes this one attractive, and the composition is just lovely.</td>', 'There''s a feeling of softness here that I can''t quite place, but it looks beautiful.  The lighting really makes this one attractive, and the composition is just lovely.', '2005-02-18 16:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180368, 145783, 30214, '<td valign="top">very interesting find</td>', 'very interesting find', '2005-02-18 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180369, 145885, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective saturating.  Good perspective on the structure itself.  Good focus.</td>', 'Nice use of selective saturating.  Good perspective on the structure itself.  Good focus.', '2005-02-18 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180370, 147554, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice find, the photograph could''ve been better (very flat look due to flash)</td>', 'nice find, the photograph could''ve been better (very flat look due to flash)', '2005-02-18 16:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180371, 147631, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very pretty... I would suggest cropping out the very bright light to the left, though.  I could do without the tree/bush at the bottom, too - maybe a slightly different angle?  Still, very pretty capture.</td>', 'Very pretty... I would suggest cropping out the very bright light to the left, though.  I could do without the tree/bush at the bottom, too - maybe a slightly different angle?  Still, very pretty capture.', '2005-02-18 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180375, 147630, 8284, '<td valign="top">The border you used helps to make this look like a really old photo.</td>', 'The border you used helps to make this look like a really old photo.', '2005-02-18 16:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180376, 146574, 19333, '<td valign="top">shame it''s low contrasted! try some levels. Very nice anyway</td>', 'shame it''s low contrasted! try some levels. Very nice anyway', '2005-02-18 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180377, 147215, 30214, '<td valign="top">i understand your point from the title, but the photo itself does not convey this message, or at least not strongly enough.</td>', 'i understand your point from the title, but the photo itself does not convey this message, or at least not strongly enough.', '2005-02-18 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180379, 147607, 19333, '<td valign="top">some may even see it  as a wall to stuck to instead as a bridge... nice otherwise</td>', 'some may even see it  as a wall to stuck to instead as a bridge... nice otherwise', '2005-02-18 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180380, 147343, 8284, '<td valign="top">That white light is annoying.  Beautiful shot, otherwise.  The lights in the center might be just a bit too strong.  Makes it difficult to look at that part of the pic.</td>', 'That white light is annoying.  Beautiful shot, otherwise.  The lights in the center might be just a bit too strong.  Makes it difficult to look at that part of the pic.', '2005-02-18 16:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180381, 147515, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a bridge, and this shot has a lot of potential.  For some reason, though, it just feels too blue - the bridg blends into the sky despite the clarity of its lines.  Also, the eye is drawn almost exclusively to the right side because of the strong lines and shadows there.  I would like to see this in a high contrast b&amp;w - I think that would really pull the bridge into the foreground rather than allowing it to blend into the background (because the road seems to be the main subject here, as it is isolated by both distance and colour).</td>', 'This is certainly a bridge, and this shot has a lot of potential.  For some reason, though, it just feels too blue - the bridg blends into the sky despite the clarity of its lines.  Also, the eye is drawn almost exclusively to the right side because of the strong lines and shadows there.  I would like to see this in a high contrast b&w - I think that would really pull the bridge into the foreground rather than allowing it to blend into the background (because the road seems to be the main subject here, as it is isolated by both distance and colour).', '2005-02-18 16:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180382, 145815, 16790, '<td valign="top">The high contrast is almost a little blinding, but I like it.  The waters below are captured nicely, and though the bridge is very dark the lines of the stone/brick are still visible to give it texture.  Nice work!</td>', 'The high contrast is almost a little blinding, but I like it.  The waters below are captured nicely, and though the bridge is very dark the lines of the stone/brick are still visible to give it texture.  Nice work!', '2005-02-18 16:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180383, 147457, 30214, '<td valign="top">well, any landcape shot can be "sold" under this title, and this particular shot is not the most suited. Also, low contrast and boring sky make it a less appealing shot.</td>', 'well, any landcape shot can be "sold" under this title, and this particular shot is not the most suited. Also, low contrast and boring sky make it a less appealing shot.', '2005-02-18 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180385, 147427, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting</td>', 'nice composition and lighting', '2005-02-18 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180387, 147577, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very simple and beautiful, this has a wonderful abstract feel to it.  I love the colours and smooth lines - it feels simplistic and smooth, but there''s so much detail and texture to be seen.  Just gorgeous!</td>', 'Very simple and beautiful, this has a wonderful abstract feel to it.  I love the colours and smooth lines - it feels simplistic and smooth, but there''s so much detail and texture to be seen.  Just gorgeous!', '2005-02-18 16:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180388, 147163, 19333, '<td valign="top">which is the main subject, the tower or the bridge? for me the tower is too overwhelming, didn''t even noticed the bridge at first glance. tittle adds up.</td>', 'which is the main subject, the tower or the bridge? for me the tower is too overwhelming, didn''t even noticed the bridge at first glance. tittle adds up.', '2005-02-18 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
