(1180403, 146185, 31133, '<td valign="top">It looks like you spent a lot of time shooting this - the framing is interesting. It might also be nice with some curves in Photoshop to add a little color contrast.</td>', 'It looks like you spent a lot of time shooting this - the framing is interesting. It might also be nice with some curves in Photoshop to add a little color contrast.', '2005-02-18 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180408, 147301, 8284, '<td valign="top">If this wasn''t a last-minute idea, you should have looked for a nicer web.  Tough subject to focus on if it''s not covered in dew.  Nothing here with any visual appeal.  The web is ratty and the structure behind is dirty, with nothing interesting about it physically.  The photo itself isn''t bad, technically.</td>', 'If this wasn''t a last-minute idea, you should have looked for a nicer web.  Tough subject to focus on if it''s not covered in dew.  Nothing here with any visual appeal.  The web is ratty and the structure behind is dirty, with nothing interesting about it physically.  The photo itself isn''t bad, technically.', '2005-02-18 16:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
