(1180428, 147373, 30214, '<td valign="top">I must admit, i did not get it</td>', 'I must admit, i did not get it', '2005-02-18 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180433, 147052, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice crop &amp; composition.  Focused.  Good color.  Interesting subject.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice crop & composition.  Focused.  Good color.  Interesting subject.  Good lighting.', '2005-02-18 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180434, 147362, 19333, '<td valign="top">too much neatimage? textures are lost, both on the bridge and the trees. or maybe it''s too small or compressed.</td>', 'too much neatimage? textures are lost, both on the bridge and the trees. or maybe it''s too small or compressed.', '2005-02-18 16:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180436, 147293, 8284, '<td valign="top">Postcard material.  Great colors!</td>', 'Postcard material.  Great colors!', '2005-02-18 16:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180438, 146396, 31133, '<td valign="top">Sorry for not giving a big old constructive comment - all I can say is that this is beautiful!</td>', 'Sorry for not giving a big old constructive comment - all I can say is that this is beautiful!', '2005-02-18 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180444, 147157, 30214, '<td valign="top">Golden Gate is the Golden Gate. I wish I lived in SF, sigh...</td>', 'Golden Gate is the Golden Gate. I wish I lived in SF, sigh...', '2005-02-18 16:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180448, 147125, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely bridge and a beaufitul scene in general. Could be helped by better focus and some contrast (like curves in Photoshop, if you have it). This looks like a fantastic place.</td>', 'It''s a lovely bridge and a beaufitul scene in general. Could be helped by better focus and some contrast (like curves in Photoshop, if you have it). This looks like a fantastic place.', '2005-02-18 16:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180451, 147178, 30214, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, one of my favorites</td>', 'very nice shot, one of my favorites', '2005-02-18 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180456, 147157, 8284, '<td valign="top">Great color, obviously.  Reminds me of Peter Max or Andy Warhol.  To be honest, though, that''s all that really grabs me here.  Somehow, there''s nothing that makes me want to stare at this image.  On the other hand, I don''t know what I would suggest to change that.  Good luck.  This should do well.</td>', 'Great color, obviously.  Reminds me of Peter Max or Andy Warhol.  To be honest, though, that''s all that really grabs me here.  Somehow, there''s nothing that makes me want to stare at this image.  On the other hand, I don''t know what I would suggest to change that.  Good luck.  This should do well.', '2005-02-18 16:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180459, 145409, 30214, '<td valign="top">this is spectacular find. and nice lighting, too</td>', 'this is spectacular find. and nice lighting, too', '2005-02-18 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180462, 146541, 8284, '<td valign="top">First impression: This looks like it would be better in full color.  There''s a lot going on here, and the bridge seems to get lost in B&amp;W.  I''d love to see the original.</td>', 'First impression: This looks like it would be better in full color.  There''s a lot going on here, and the bridge seems to get lost in B&W.  I''d love to see the original.', '2005-02-18 16:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180463, 147450, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. Lacks a bit of contrast in my opinion, and the horizon seems to be tilted to the right</td>', 'interesting idea. Lacks a bit of contrast in my opinion, and the horizon seems to be tilted to the right', '2005-02-18 16:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180464, 147628, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice morning lighting here</td>', 'nice morning lighting here', '2005-02-18 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180467, 146709, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the illusion of a rail bridge.  Great use of the light; shot at exactly the right moment.  Harmonious composition and subtle processing (if any).  8.<br/> <br/>PS.  I see it''s been validated ... someone thought you''d spot-edited a train out?</td>', 'I like the illusion of a rail bridge.  Great use of the light; shot at exactly the right moment.  Harmonious composition and subtle processing (if any).  8. PS.  I see it''s been validated ... someone thought you''d spot-edited a train out?', '2005-02-18 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180469, 147620, 8284, '<td valign="top">Evocative shot.  Makes you wonder what happened that day...  Might look good in color, too.  Lighting looks a little flat.</td>', 'Evocative shot.  Makes you wonder what happened that day...  Might look good in color, too.  Lighting looks a little flat.', '2005-02-18 16:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180472, 145731, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice sky shot, but I don''t see a bridge here, in any sense.</td>', 'Nice sky shot, but I don''t see a bridge here, in any sense.', '2005-02-18 16:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180476, 146417, 29739, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus on the background, I find distracting the lights on the right though</td>', 'Perfect focus on the background, I find distracting the lights on the right though', '2005-02-18 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180485, 147631, 26633, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colours but unforti=unately everything looks blurry to me.</td>', 'Nice composition and colours but unforti=unately everything looks blurry to me.', '2005-02-18 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180486, 147001, 8284, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is off.  It''s not really on the bridge.  Nice shot, though.  Like the dark colors. Reflections aren''t harsh.  Like the perspective &amp; rotation, negative space.</td>', 'I think the focus is off.  It''s not really on the bridge.  Nice shot, though.  Like the dark colors. Reflections aren''t harsh.  Like the perspective & rotation, negative space.', '2005-02-18 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180491, 145900, 26633, '<td valign="top">Amusing title but the rest of the picture looks rather dull, sorry.</td>', 'Amusing title but the rest of the picture looks rather dull, sorry.', '2005-02-18 16:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180492, 147057, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful, graceful image of a bridge.  You have made it look like a cathedral; not just with the obvious arch motif, but also the repeating verticals of the foreground and even the ecclesiastical feel of the light.  Well done.  8</td>', 'This is a very beautiful, graceful image of a bridge.  You have made it look like a cathedral; not just with the obvious arch motif, but also the repeating verticals of the foreground and even the ecclesiastical feel of the light.  Well done.  8', '2005-02-18 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180499, 146528, 33114, '<td valign="top">Like an Escher work of art. Breathtaking. Best by far.</td>', 'Like an Escher work of art. Breathtaking. Best by far.', '2005-02-18 16:48:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1180500, 147587, 26633, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but it looks like the photographer wasn''t entirely committed to the shot. Tidying away the clutter and giving the doggy a touch of fill-flash would have been a bonus.</td>', 'Interesting idea but it looks like the photographer wasn''t entirely committed to the shot. Tidying away the clutter and giving the doggy a touch of fill-flash would have been a bonus.', '2005-02-18 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180501, 146486, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular sunset or sunrise! I wonder if could use just a miniscule amount of clockwise rotation - ah, nah... it''s just great.</td>', 'This is a spectacular sunset or sunrise! I wonder if could use just a miniscule amount of clockwise rotation - ah, nah... it''s just great.', '2005-02-18 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180504, 147509, 21621, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition, I really like how you''ve framed these two bridges.  Focus could be a little sharper, but it''s not bad, however the one thing that''s holding this image back is the color.  Looks as if the saturation has been pushed too far.  If you can resolve the color issue I think you might have great photo here.  Good luck</td>', 'Fantastic composition, I really like how you''ve framed these two bridges.  Focus could be a little sharper, but it''s not bad, however the one thing that''s holding this image back is the color.  Looks as if the saturation has been pushed too far.  If you can resolve the color issue I think you might have great photo here.  Good luck', '2005-02-18 16:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180506, 147457, 26633, '<td valign="top">Sorry to be negative but the colours look a bit sludgy and there''s an awful lot of blank sky there.</td>', 'Sorry to be negative but the colours look a bit sludgy and there''s an awful lot of blank sky there.', '2005-02-18 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180513, 147460, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, a different type of bridge! I like this shot a lot, but would also like to see a little sharpness added. I love, love, love the way you framed with her legs and little footies.</td>', 'Wow, a different type of bridge! I like this shot a lot, but would also like to see a little sharpness added. I love, love, love the way you framed with her legs and little footies.', '2005-02-18 16:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180514, 145672, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, effectively executed.  I nearly overlooked it, because it''s so pretty, but this is also a fine composition and a skilful photograph.  But it''s your original idea that really makes it so good.  8</td>', 'Very good idea, effectively executed.  I nearly overlooked it, because it''s so pretty, but this is also a fine composition and a skilful photograph.  But it''s your original idea that really makes it so good.  8', '2005-02-18 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180516, 146485, 26633, '<td valign="top">there are times when contriving an image to fit a brief just doesn''t work, this looks like one of those times.<br/>Nicely exposedhands and love the background, just can''t connect them.</td>', 'there are times when contriving an image to fit a brief just doesn''t work, this looks like one of those times.Nicely exposedhands and love the background, just can''t connect them.', '2005-02-18 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180521, 147435, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great composition. A bit out of focus?</td>', 'Great composition. A bit out of focus?', '2005-02-18 16:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180522, 147557, 26633, '<td valign="top">Love the sky and the water but the bridge is just lost. One of those days when there''s good light and no subject? Maybe another viewpoint would have helped.</td>', 'Love the sky and the water but the bridge is just lost. One of those days when there''s good light and no subject? Maybe another viewpoint would have helped.', '2005-02-18 16:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180524, 145887, 32767, '<td valign="top">A little more sky than bridge?</td>', 'A little more sky than bridge?', '2005-02-18 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180525, 145594, 26633, '<td valign="top">Just too dark, sorry. Not sure why the ''stuff'' in the top right corner has been included.</td>', 'Just too dark, sorry. Not sure why the ''stuff'' in the top right corner has been included.', '2005-02-18 16:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180527, 146417, 31133, '<td valign="top">I realize you meant to keep the flames in the shot, but I know I would love this if they were cropped out. It''s a very, very nice shot of the skyline, water, and bridge.</td>', 'I realize you meant to keep the flames in the shot, but I know I would love this if they were cropped out. It''s a very, very nice shot of the skyline, water, and bridge.', '2005-02-18 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180532, 147259, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really good time exposure.  Great composition &amp; tonal range.  Even if this were an Advanced Editing challenge, I wouldn''t change a thing about this image.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Really good time exposure.  Great composition & tonal range.  Even if this were an Advanced Editing challenge, I wouldn''t change a thing about this image.  Well done.  8', '2005-02-18 16:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180540, 147215, 26633, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like the girl in the white hat.<br/>But, that white sky glares and I really don''t see that tilting the camera helps at all. Crop the sky off and straighten up the image and it''s worth far more points.</td>', 'Nice idea and I like the girl in the white hat.But, that white sky glares and I really don''t see that tilting the camera helps at all. Crop the sky off and straighten up the image and it''s worth far more points.', '2005-02-18 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180542, 145318, 32767, '<td valign="top">Majestic. Great comp. This is one of the best day time straight full color shots of the lot. Many shots like this that I enjoyed were the long exposure night shots. This one took great timing.</td>', 'Majestic. Great comp. This is one of the best day time straight full color shots of the lot. Many shots like this that I enjoyed were the long exposure night shots. This one took great timing.', '2005-02-18 17:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180547, 147300, 26633, '<td valign="top">Rather dull, partly the weather, partly the colour balance and partly the subject.</td>', 'Rather dull, partly the weather, partly the colour balance and partly the subject.', '2005-02-18 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180550, 146317, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good composition that elevates the interest.  It''s probably just another bridge seen from a more conventional viewpoint.  Nice lighting and a competent photograph, too.  But the best thing you did was to stand right there.  8</td>', 'Good composition that elevates the interest.  It''s probably just another bridge seen from a more conventional viewpoint.  Nice lighting and a competent photograph, too.  But the best thing you did was to stand right there.  8', '2005-02-18 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180555, 146818, 26633, '<td valign="top">This had better not be my monitor but this picture just doesn''t look sharp. The white sky and big patch of empty grass doesn''t help either. Definitely worth a return trip with a tripod on a day with some sky.</td>', 'This had better not be my monitor but this picture just doesn''t look sharp. The white sky and big patch of empty grass doesn''t help either. Definitely worth a return trip with a tripod on a day with some sky.', '2005-02-18 17:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180562, 146396, 32767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bridge shot and great comp. I would have tried to knock out some of the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful bridge shot and great comp. I would have tried to knock out some of the blue.', '2005-02-18 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180563, 147321, 26633, '<td valign="top">Holiday brochure material, and that''s meant to be a compliment!<br/>I hope we get to see a larger version sometime.</td>', 'Holiday brochure material, and that''s meant to be a compliment!I hope we get to see a larger version sometime.', '2005-02-18 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180564, 147176, 31133, '<td valign="top">This might benefit by having the right-hand side, with the house cropped out so the bridge frame went all the way across the photo frame. It''s very pretty light.</td>', 'This might benefit by having the right-hand side, with the house cropped out so the bridge frame went all the way across the photo frame. It''s very pretty light.', '2005-02-18 17:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180569, 147395, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very cool comp. Well done all around</td>', 'Very cool comp. Well done all around', '2005-02-18 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180570, 147595, 26633, '<td valign="top">If only the dial went all the way up to 11 ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'If only the dial went all the way up to 11 ;) ', '2005-02-18 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180577, 146542, 26633, '<td valign="top">Perfect rendition of a frequently-photographed scene.</td>', 'Perfect rendition of a frequently-photographed scene.', '2005-02-18 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180584, 147291, 22656, '<td valign="top">Simple but sweet<br/></td>', 'Simple but sweet', '2005-02-18 17:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180589, 147536, 22656, '<td valign="top">Grteat impact in this image.</td>', 'Grteat impact in this image.', '2005-02-18 17:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180591, 147548, 22656, '<td valign="top">He looks likes he wants to get off your finger...</td>', 'He looks likes he wants to get off your finger...', '2005-02-18 17:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180592, 147380, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s such a powerful and delicate picture that I think the frame is a little too thick for it, but I didn''t subtract from the score because of that. Other than the frame, there''s little for me to say but that, in my opinion,  this is absolutely one of the better shots in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s such a powerful and delicate picture that I think the frame is a little too thick for it, but I didn''t subtract from the score because of that. Other than the frame, there''s little for me to say but that, in my opinion,  this is absolutely one of the better shots in the challenge.', '2005-02-18 17:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180593, 147178, 26633, '<td valign="top">Probably the creepiest picture in the challenge.</td>', 'Probably the creepiest picture in the challenge.', '2005-02-18 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180598, 147276, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good interpretation of the challenge, with a good title to boot. It might just be me, but it seems like it suffers from a little bit of out of focus. Nice setup.</td>', 'I think this is a good interpretation of the challenge, with a good title to boot. It might just be me, but it seems like it suffers from a little bit of out of focus. Nice setup.', '2005-02-18 17:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180600, 146923, 22656, '<td valign="top">Great shot how high were you?</td>', 'Great shot how high were you?', '2005-02-18 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180603, 147533, 22656, '<td valign="top">Great impact.</td>', 'Great impact.', '2005-02-18 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180605, 147516, 22656, '<td valign="top">I envy you!</td>', 'I envy you!', '2005-02-18 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180609, 146018, 30364, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 3, my lowest score.  So you have a right to know why.  First, I don''t know what it is.  It looks like an abandoned construction site.  Second, who''s George?  Maybe you meant Waldo, but I can''t find the little bugger.  And third, it''s noisy and harsh.  I''m sorry to rate it so low..if I''ve missed the point, feel free to tell me what it was.</td>', 'I gave it a 3, my lowest score.  So you have a right to know why.  First, I don''t know what it is.  It looks like an abandoned construction site.  Second, who''s George?  Maybe you meant Waldo, but I can''t find the little bugger.  And third, it''s noisy and harsh.  I''m sorry to rate it so low..if I''ve missed the point, feel free to tell me what it was.', '2005-02-18 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180620, 146989, 30364, '<td valign="top">A beautiful composition and a very well chosen moment.  It''s a fine example of how to capture the character of a bridge without needing to show us the whole thing.  The Devil is in the Details.  An instructive and intelligent photograph.  9</td>', 'A beautiful composition and a very well chosen moment.  It''s a fine example of how to capture the character of a bridge without needing to show us the whole thing.  The Devil is in the Details.  An instructive and intelligent photograph.  9', '2005-02-18 17:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180623, 147318, 26633, '<td valign="top">One of the simplest shots in the whole challenge and one of the most effective. <br/>Beautiful use of light and form.</td>', 'One of the simplest shots in the whole challenge and one of the most effective. Beautiful use of light and form.', '2005-02-18 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180625, 147442, 30364, '<td valign="top">A dramatic, Wagnerian sort of bridge image.  It''s a very good composition from a well-chosen point-of-view, and the lighting is marvellous.  There are no distractions or flaws, and everything works in harmony. Given the Basic Editing constraints, this is a superb achievement. 9</td>', 'A dramatic, Wagnerian sort of bridge image.  It''s a very good composition from a well-chosen point-of-view, and the lighting is marvellous.  There are no distractions or flaws, and everything works in harmony. Given the Basic Editing constraints, this is a superb achievement. 9', '2005-02-18 17:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180627, 145807, 26633, '<td valign="top">Superb take on an old favourite location. Keeping in only one tower of the bridge in order to  concentrate on the little pier would never have occurred to me. The gull is a bonus!</td>', 'Superb take on an old favourite location. Keeping in only one tower of the bridge in order to  concentrate on the little pier would never have occurred to me. The gull is a bonus!', '2005-02-18 17:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180633, 145822, 26633, '<td valign="top">There''s something timeless about this. Crappy light, crappy sky and it still deserves a 9 ;)</td>', 'There''s something timeless about this. Crappy light, crappy sky and it still deserves a 9 ;)', '2005-02-18 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180636, 147442, 26633, '<td valign="top">Looks like something out of an Iain Banks novel!<br/>Perfect sky, perfect light, well chosen viewpoint. What more can be said?</td>', 'Looks like something out of an Iain Banks novel!Perfect sky, perfect light, well chosen viewpoint. What more can be said?', '2005-02-18 17:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180638, 146928, 8284, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but without the title...  Nothing here shows that this is a father, or his devotion to anything.  That said, this is a terrific image.  Sharp focus, good lighting, good skin tones, nice composition, interesting face.  I might try a little Neat Image to make the pores on his face a bit less obvious.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but without the title...  Nothing here shows that this is a father, or his devotion to anything.  That said, this is a terrific image.  Sharp focus, good lighting, good skin tones, nice composition, interesting face.  I might try a little Neat Image to make the pores on his face a bit less obvious.', '2005-02-18 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180646, 147304, 26633, '<td valign="top">Just had to bump this from an 8 to a 9. It''s so wet it''s almost dripping off the monitor!</td>', 'Just had to bump this from an 8 to a 9. It''s so wet it''s almost dripping off the monitor!', '2005-02-18 17:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180671, 147217, 8284, '<td valign="top">This really needs to be bigger to have some impact.  Good shadows on the bridge.  Use that as more of the center subject.  I''d crop this halfway across from the left.  Take the water out entirely.  My 2cts.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'This really needs to be bigger to have some impact.  Good shadows on the bridge.  Use that as more of the center subject.  I''d crop this halfway across from the left.  Take the water out entirely.  My 2cts.  Hope that helps.', '2005-02-18 17:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180694, 145790, 25355, '<td valign="top">I probably won''t be able to get through enough voting to make this one count, but I''d just like to say good luck .... Before I started, I wondered if there''d be any Canberra (my hometown) bridges, and I just found two. This is the better one.</td>', 'I probably won''t be able to get through enough voting to make this one count, but I''d just like to say good luck .... Before I started, I wondered if there''d be any Canberra (my hometown) bridges, and I just found two. This is the better one.', '2005-02-18 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180717, 147464, 33182, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a lot of green. &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Seems to be a lot of green. <g>', '2005-02-18 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180721, 145921, 33182, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion here, but I might have cropped out the railing, however I think you were trying to include the sign, so it''s all okay.</td>', 'Personal opinion here, but I might have cropped out the railing, however I think you were trying to include the sign, so it''s all okay.', '2005-02-18 18:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180730, 147457, 33182, '<td valign="top">Personal Opinion.....White balance seems off.</td>', 'Personal Opinion.....White balance seems off.', '2005-02-18 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180732, 147373, 33182, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word that this is a bridge.</td>', 'I''ll take your word that this is a bridge.', '2005-02-18 18:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180736, 147560, 18403, '<td valign="top">Rio Grande Gorge near Taos?</td>', 'Rio Grande Gorge near Taos?', '2005-02-18 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180740, 147435, 33182, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus.</td>', 'Seems out of focus.', '2005-02-18 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180745, 147004, 32712, '<td valign="top">nice motif but too complicated and unfocused maybe... know it''s difficult but the bridge and train is perfect but other things distract, maybe frame tighter (a lot tighter)</td>', 'nice motif but too complicated and unfocused maybe... know it''s difficult but the bridge and train is perfect but other things distract, maybe frame tighter (a lot tighter)', '2005-02-18 18:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180746, 147458, 31905, '<td valign="top">whoa... nice vantage point.</td>', 'whoa... nice vantage point.', '2005-02-18 18:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180747, 146042, 33182, '<td valign="top">White balance seems off a little, but I really like this pictures.</td>', 'White balance seems off a little, but I really like this pictures.', '2005-02-18 18:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180748, 147304, 32712, '<td valign="top">very cool setting but the framing might be narrower to increase the effect / impact of the photo</td>', 'very cool setting but the framing might be narrower to increase the effect / impact of the photo', '2005-02-18 18:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180749, 147328, 33182, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for my tastes.</td>', 'A little too dark for my tastes.', '2005-02-18 18:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180750, 147558, 32712, '<td valign="top">cool pic</td>', 'cool pic', '2005-02-18 18:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180752, 145731, 32712, '<td valign="top">beutiful picture, I would have framed it differently, cut out the very bottom</td>', 'beutiful picture, I would have framed it differently, cut out the very bottom', '2005-02-18 18:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
