(1180839, 147560, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. There''s such a sense of distance and bigness in this picture. Well done, the only improvement I can think of is maybe taking it from a little closer to the bridge so it feels more 3D, like it''s going away from us instead of just across the frame.  It''s starting to do that, but I feel it would be cool with more.</td>', 'Wow. There''s such a sense of distance and bigness in this picture. Well done, the only improvement I can think of is maybe taking it from a little closer to the bridge so it feels more 3D, like it''s going away from us instead of just across the frame.  It''s starting to do that, but I feel it would be cool with more.', '2005-02-18 18:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
