(1180944, 147402, 30669, '<td valign="top">Rather stark,however, something I realy like about it.Maybe it''s the way the sun is shinning on it and the dark clouds in background.</td>', 'Rather stark,however, something I realy like about it.Maybe it''s the way the sun is shinning on it and the dark clouds in background.', '2005-02-18 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180950, 147454, 30669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful entrance to a beautiful bridge.</td>', 'Beautiful entrance to a beautiful bridge.', '2005-02-18 19:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180958, 147030, 24970, '<td valign="top">NIce shot, it''s so clear! I ache to have just a little bit more on the bottom though.</td>', 'NIce shot, it''s so clear! I ache to have just a little bit more on the bottom though.', '2005-02-18 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180961, 146524, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like how there''s just splashes of color in this otherwise grey picture. It''s a really neat effect.</td>', 'I like how there''s just splashes of color in this otherwise grey picture. It''s a really neat effect.', '2005-02-18 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181002, 146261, 6667, '<td valign="top">Like the gray tones and the patterns. Nice choice of black and white. BOL 7</td>', 'Like the gray tones and the patterns. Nice choice of black and white. BOL 7', '2005-02-18 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181031, 146833, 31214, '<td valign="top">Love the movement you''ve captured and the hanging plants.</td>', 'Love the movement you''ve captured and the hanging plants.', '2005-02-18 19:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181034, 146523, 31214, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo...mostly due to the lighting.  The reflection in the wet road is very nice.  I think the picture may be too "busy" though.  My eyes are drawn to the line of lights on the right....which, while nice, take you away from the theme of the bridge.  Same thin with the building on the left.  but...I know you can''t change those things.  Did you try a tighter crop?  I''ll still rank this high but you good have gotten even better.  Good job!</td>', 'I really like the photo...mostly due to the lighting.  The reflection in the wet road is very nice.  I think the picture may be too "busy" though.  My eyes are drawn to the line of lights on the right....which, while nice, take you away from the theme of the bridge.  Same thin with the building on the left.  but...I know you can''t change those things.  Did you try a tighter crop?  I''ll still rank this high but you good have gotten even better.  Good job!', '2005-02-18 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181036, 145824, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  You''ve captured the real magnitude of this structure.  Very elaobrate!  Nice crop.  If those are lights up there, then I wonder what this would look like at night?</td>', 'Very nice shot.  You''ve captured the real magnitude of this structure.  Very elaobrate!  Nice crop.  If those are lights up there, then I wonder what this would look like at night?', '2005-02-18 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181040, 147030, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture...looks like a spider''s web!  That "M" over there on the left is getting me hungry!  Nice shot!  Whoops, who''s that getting in your picture on the front left?  I guess it is too busy of a walkway to get one totally clear.</td>', 'Very nice capture...looks like a spider''s web!  That "M" over there on the left is getting me hungry!  Nice shot!  Whoops, who''s that getting in your picture on the front left?  I guess it is too busy of a walkway to get one totally clear.', '2005-02-18 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181042, 147055, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I just wish that building wasn''t there on the right.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I just wish that building wasn''t there on the right.', '2005-02-18 20:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181043, 146283, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve mixed the water and the sky into a dark murky atmosphere!</td>', 'I like the way you''ve mixed the water and the sky into a dark murky atmosphere!', '2005-02-18 20:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181044, 146009, 31214, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!</td>', 'Congratulations!', '2005-02-18 20:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181054, 147600, 18403, '<td valign="top">Decent photo...don''t know about the art.  Kinda looks like laundry day at a Buddhist Monastery.  7</td>', 'Decent photo...don''t know about the art.  Kinda looks like laundry day at a Buddhist Monastery.  7', '2005-02-18 20:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181058, 147055, 4281, '<td valign="top">The main fault I see with this picture is that it is too grey and dark for my taste. I guess you should have exposed it a bit more but  it should still have been possible to enhance it by using curves and perhaps increasing the saturation a bit. In addittion, a lot of detail is currently hidden in the shadow areas of the picture which could be recovered with the shadow/highlight filter in Photoshop.<br/> <br/>I''m also of the opinion that this picture would be much better if you tried to crop it slightly from below and make it a panorama crop. I don''t find the foreground to be interesting enough to warrant it''s place in the picture. I think I would crop it slightly below the stone in the snow to the left.<br/> <br/>In addition, try to convert the picture to B&amp;W instead.</td>', 'The main fault I see with this picture is that it is too grey and dark for my taste. I guess you should have exposed it a bit more but  it should still have been possible to enhance it by using curves and perhaps increasing the saturation a bit. In addittion, a lot of detail is currently hidden in the shadow areas of the picture which could be recovered with the shadow/highlight filter in Photoshop. I''m also of the opinion that this picture would be much better if you tried to crop it slightly from below and make it a panorama crop. I don''t find the foreground to be interesting enough to warrant it''s place in the picture. I think I would crop it slightly below the stone in the snow to the left. In addition, try to convert the picture to B&W instead.', '2005-02-18 20:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181068, 145783, 6667, '<td valign="top">Unique photo. I hope it does well because it certainly captures the essence of the theme with the idea that you don''t need to photograph a bridge per say.   BOL  7</td>', 'Unique photo. I hope it does well because it certainly captures the essence of the theme with the idea that you don''t need to photograph a bridge per say.   BOL  7', '2005-02-18 20:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181079, 147630, 6667, '<td valign="top">Cleveland area?</td>', 'Cleveland area?', '2005-02-18 20:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181081, 147568, 8284, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors &amp; light.  Maybe just a tad overexposed, but not much.  A little noise in the background.  Wonderful shot.  Added to my favorites.  9</td>', 'Beautiful colors & light.  Maybe just a tad overexposed, but not much.  A little noise in the background.  Wonderful shot.  Added to my favorites.  9', '2005-02-18 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
