(1181202, 147293, 25553, '<td valign="top">very nice, very nice indeed. especially the change of pink to blue. great way of pulling the eye twds that horizon with the pier too.good use of a polarizer. just great. only thing i dont really like is the ring around the sun. 8</td>', 'very nice, very nice indeed. especially the change of pink to blue. great way of pulling the eye twds that horizon with the pier too.good use of a polarizer. just great. only thing i dont really like is the ring around the sun. 8', '2005-02-18 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
