(1181592, 147442, 30222, '<td valign="top">nice contrast/angle..fantastic bridge</td>', 'nice contrast/angle..fantastic bridge', '2005-02-19 05:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181594, 147454, 30222, '<td valign="top">i just dont like the cars ..but the bridge and picture is very ok</td>', 'i just dont like the cars ..but the bridge and picture is very ok', '2005-02-19 05:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181596, 147311, 30222, '<td valign="top">a fine bridge and a good angle u chose but it deserved a less filthy sky</td>', 'a fine bridge and a good angle u chose but it deserved a less filthy sky', '2005-02-19 05:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181606, 146893, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like that this shot made me look at it longer than I looked at the others. I can''t offer constructive comments about why that is because I don''t know myself why, but I did find myself staring at all the differently lit colors.</td>', 'I like that this shot made me look at it longer than I looked at the others. I can''t offer constructive comments about why that is because I don''t know myself why, but I did find myself staring at all the differently lit colors.', '2005-02-19 05:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181607, 147251, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is very industrial looking and the title helps. This shot could be from the 50''s. Nice with b&amp;w. I like the contrast on the buildings and wish it were just as prominent on the bridge in  this image.</td>', 'This is very industrial looking and the title helps. This shot could be from the 50''s. Nice with b&w. I like the contrast on the buildings and wish it were just as prominent on the bridge in  this image.', '2005-02-19 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181608, 146258, 31133, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot! I might have cropped out the bottom just above the white part of the cable, but then you might have missed the awesome perspective that you have now.</td>', 'Brilliant shot! I might have cropped out the bottom just above the white part of the cable, but then you might have missed the awesome perspective that you have now.', '2005-02-19 05:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181609, 147234, 31133, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s a low quality bridge for you. I think you''ve done a great job with the sepia and the contrast, particularly in the sky.</td>', 'Well, there''s a low quality bridge for you. I think you''ve done a great job with the sepia and the contrast, particularly in the sky.', '2005-02-19 05:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181610, 147335, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it''s missing something for me. Maybe if the trusses stoood out against the sky even more? Overall, I like this entry, mainly because of the depth.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it''s missing something for me. Maybe if the trusses stoood out against the sky even more? Overall, I like this entry, mainly because of the depth.', '2005-02-19 05:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181611, 147164, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the big thing in the foreground more emphasized in post-processing. It seems to be the subject of the photo, but it''s not standing out enough for my taste. Maybe a shot from slightly higher would''ve also worked.</td>', 'I''d like to see the big thing in the foreground more emphasized in post-processing. It seems to be the subject of the photo, but it''s not standing out enough for my taste. Maybe a shot from slightly higher would''ve also worked.', '2005-02-19 05:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181613, 147610, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the graininess works well here.</td>', 'I think the graininess works well here.', '2005-02-19 05:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181614, 147606, 26633, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the composition. <br/>Would have been a 9 if not for the fringing on the arch of the bridge.</td>', 'Love the colours and the composition. Would have been a 9 if not for the fringing on the arch of the bridge.', '2005-02-19 06:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181615, 145823, 26633, '<td valign="top">Moody, mysterious and misty, lovely combination.<br/>I like the way the arch holds back all that white sky and concentrates the eye along the tracks to the station, letting us find the couple on the platform.</td>', 'Moody, mysterious and misty, lovely combination.I like the way the arch holds back all that white sky and concentrates the eye along the tracks to the station, letting us find the couple on the platform.', '2005-02-19 06:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181616, 147452, 26633, '<td valign="top">Simple, graphic and very powerful.</td>', 'Simple, graphic and very powerful.', '2005-02-19 06:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181617, 147343, 26633, '<td valign="top">The square format is great. Love the way the river looks like it''s on fire.<br/>Hate to be technical but ... what a perfect exposure! Has to be a 9.</td>', 'The square format is great. Love the way the river looks like it''s on fire.Hate to be technical but ... what a perfect exposure! Has to be a 9.', '2005-02-19 06:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181618, 147604, 26633, '<td valign="top">I could see this as a 20"x20" print on the office wall. <br/>Bumped up from 8 to 9 on second pass.</td>', 'I could see this as a 20"x20" print on the office wall. Bumped up from 8 to 9 on second pass.', '2005-02-19 06:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181621, 146995, 26633, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, I like the view under the bridge across the river to the mountains but I feel there are a few too many technical niggles. These being:<br/>The are to the left of the bridge support doesn''t add anything; the patch of sky at top left is a distraction; a slightly lower viewpoint might have given us a view of the top of the mountains.</td>', 'A nice idea, I like the view under the bridge across the river to the mountains but I feel there are a few too many technical niggles. These being:The are to the left of the bridge support doesn''t add anything; the patch of sky at top left is a distraction; a slightly lower viewpoint might have given us a view of the top of the mountains.', '2005-02-19 06:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181645, 146897, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Even though you did not frame much of the bridge it works well with this picture. I love the colors and how they blend smoothly together. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Even though you did not frame much of the bridge it works well with this picture. I love the colors and how they blend smoothly together. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-02-19 07:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181649, 146764, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice POV and bridge even though I think the Orange banners above the bridge is distracting. I think you did a good job of framing your photo with good lighting and focus. I wish the picture would of been larger in width it may have made it more dramatic. Wish you well in the challenge. 6</td>', 'Nice POV and bridge even though I think the Orange banners above the bridge is distracting. I think you did a good job of framing your photo with good lighting and focus. I wish the picture would of been larger in width it may have made it more dramatic. Wish you well in the challenge. 6', '2005-02-19 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181651, 146228, 22970, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the duotone color you have chosen does your photo justice. It pops out at me to much. I think a darker feel would of been better, like b&amp;w. Or even the colored version. Seems to lack contrast and very busy. I think you framed it well, i like the tree limb in foreground and the house in the background. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think the duotone color you have chosen does your photo justice. It pops out at me to much. I think a darker feel would of been better, like b&w. Or even the colored version. Seems to lack contrast and very busy. I think you framed it well, i like the tree limb in foreground and the house in the background. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-02-19 07:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181657, 147343, 16241, '<td valign="top">wow thats dramatic!   9</td>', 'wow thats dramatic!   9', '2005-02-19 07:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181673, 147345, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture but this time city and river are more impressive then bridge itself.</td>', 'Very nice picture but this time city and river are more impressive then bridge itself.', '2005-02-19 07:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181701, 147591, 29348, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?</td>', 'How did you do this?', '2005-02-19 08:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181702, 146954, 11895, '<td valign="top">Burnside''s Bridge, I believe; nicely captured</td>', 'Burnside''s Bridge, I believe; nicely captured', '2005-02-19 08:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181709, 146541, 27524, '<td valign="top">Fine b&amp;w...good contrast...just pitty about so lot of branches.</td>', 'Fine b&w...good contrast...just pitty about so lot of branches.', '2005-02-19 08:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181712, 146168, 22656, '<td valign="top">Looks like a church...</td>', 'Looks like a church...', '2005-02-19 08:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181714, 146233, 22656, '<td valign="top">I hope he is not pondering jumping..</td>', 'I hope he is not pondering jumping..', '2005-02-19 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181715, 147595, 29348, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. 10</td>', 'Nice picture. 10', '2005-02-19 08:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181717, 147517, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, we have another philadelphian!  hope you aren''t getting too hammered for the size.  just don''t take it personally.  good luck!</td>', 'ok, we have another philadelphian!  hope you aren''t getting too hammered for the size.  just don''t take it personally.  good luck!', '2005-02-19 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181735, 147051, 21402, '<td valign="top">Potentially this could of been a much better shot if photographed at a different angle</td>', 'Potentially this could of been a much better shot if photographed at a different angle', '2005-02-19 09:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181743, 147305, 33515, '<td valign="top">The lines in the photo are what make it</td>', 'The lines in the photo are what make it', '2005-02-19 09:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181744, 147586, 33515, '<td valign="top">THe picture is to dark to see what the photo should be</td>', 'THe picture is to dark to see what the photo should be', '2005-02-19 09:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181745, 146233, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo</td>', 'Nice Photo', '2005-02-19 09:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181748, 147553, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture with the sunset</td>', 'Very nice picture with the sunset', '2005-02-19 09:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181750, 145790, 33515, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this</td>', 'I love the colors in this', '2005-02-19 09:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181752, 147427, 24212, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the lighting perfectly here.</td>', 'You''ve captured the lighting perfectly here.', '2005-02-19 09:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181753, 147395, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines. I particularly like the way you''ve positioned yourself so that the structure behind (tower? fountain?) is framed.</td>', 'Interesting lines. I particularly like the way you''ve positioned yourself so that the structure behind (tower? fountain?) is framed.', '2005-02-19 09:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181754, 147462, 24212, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be enough sharpness here for  me.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be enough sharpness here for  me.', '2005-02-19 09:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181756, 145807, 24212, '<td valign="top">I guess that you were going for a low-key approach here, but I feel that the end result is a little flat. I think that the gull spoils the negative space in the upper right. I can just make out a blob next to the mast of the Belfast - is it a dirty sensor?</td>', 'I guess that you were going for a low-key approach here, but I feel that the end result is a little flat. I think that the gull spoils the negative space in the upper right. I can just make out a blob next to the mast of the Belfast - is it a dirty sensor?', '2005-02-19 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181757, 146518, 24212, '<td valign="top">Creative effect. I love the way you''ve composed it so that the sky appears different either side of the lens in the centre.</td>', 'Creative effect. I love the way you''ve composed it so that the sky appears different either side of the lens in the centre.', '2005-02-19 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181760, 147403, 24212, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image. The marks on the walls (?) at the top left and top right mar the pattern a little, though.</td>', 'Intriguing image. The marks on the walls (?) at the top left and top right mar the pattern a little, though.', '2005-02-19 09:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181762, 145696, 24212, '<td valign="top">The ''blueness'' of this is quite soothing.</td>', 'The ''blueness'' of this is quite soothing.', '2005-02-19 09:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181765, 145817, 24212, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image, I was going to comment on the plain sky. Then I noticed the fact that it was misty and came to appreciate the overall effect a lot more.</td>', 'When I first saw this image, I was going to comment on the plain sky. Then I noticed the fact that it was misty and came to appreciate the overall effect a lot more.', '2005-02-19 09:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181767, 146485, 33902, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. The background could have been slightly more out of focus.</td>', 'I like this idea. The background could have been slightly more out of focus.', '2005-02-19 09:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181769, 146708, 24212, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get this at first, because of the lack of a really obvious connection between the feet and the apparent headstand. I like it.</td>', 'I didn''t get this at first, because of the lack of a really obvious connection between the feet and the apparent headstand. I like it.', '2005-02-19 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181770, 146498, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a bit too dark and there is too much clutter.</td>', 'To me, this is a bit too dark and there is too much clutter.', '2005-02-19 09:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181772, 147280, 24212, '<td valign="top">The central subject is not sharp enough, to my tired eyes at least.</td>', 'The central subject is not sharp enough, to my tired eyes at least.', '2005-02-19 09:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181774, 147505, 24212, '<td valign="top">The person crossing the bridge does not look sharp enough (motion blur?) to really serve as a point of focus IMO.</td>', 'The person crossing the bridge does not look sharp enough (motion blur?) to really serve as a point of focus IMO.', '2005-02-19 09:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181776, 146497, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and wonderful colours.</td>', 'Great lighting and wonderful colours.', '2005-02-19 09:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181779, 147197, 24212, '<td valign="top">A  very good night shot. It''s a pity that you can''t get rid of the reflections of the lights in a basic editing rules challenge.</td>', 'A  very good night shot. It''s a pity that you can''t get rid of the reflections of the lights in a basic editing rules challenge.', '2005-02-19 09:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181782, 147340, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this would look a little better with an extra touch of sharpening.</td>', 'I feel that this would look a little better with an extra touch of sharpening.', '2005-02-19 09:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181784, 147051, 24212, '<td valign="top">We''ve got a few railway bridges around here like that one. They all look a bit mundane. You''ve done a great job in picking an excellent angle to create an interesting picture.</td>', 'We''ve got a few railway bridges around here like that one. They all look a bit mundane. You''ve done a great job in picking an excellent angle to create an interesting picture.', '2005-02-19 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181785, 147251, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the buildings on the right are all a bit too dark.</td>', 'To me, the buildings on the right are all a bit too dark.', '2005-02-19 10:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181788, 145592, 25364, '<td valign="top">Very nice, soft picture</td>', 'Very nice, soft picture', '2005-02-19 10:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181789, 145783, 24212, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with a more interesting sky above.</td>', 'I would like to see this with a more interesting sky above.', '2005-02-19 10:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181794, 147292, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour, really redolent of balmy summer evening. I feel, however, that the chain link fence hurts the image a bit.</td>', 'Lovely colour, really redolent of balmy summer evening. I feel, however, that the chain link fence hurts the image a bit.', '2005-02-19 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181795, 146261, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good, clean black and white image.</td>', 'A good, clean black and white image.', '2005-02-19 10:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181796, 147328, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a big fan of low-key shots, but as I sit typing this, I find myself drawn into the image, looking for details. I quite like this.</td>', 'I''m not really a big fan of low-key shots, but as I sit typing this, I find myself drawn into the image, looking for details. I quite like this.', '2005-02-19 10:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181798, 146018, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make out what this is. The main subject is not sharp enough and the trees at the bottom are too intrusive.</td>', 'I can''t quite make out what this is. The main subject is not sharp enough and the trees at the bottom are too intrusive.', '2005-02-19 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181801, 147595, 24212, '<td valign="top">Love the sky. Great silhouette of the bridge and well done to get detail in the foreground, when it''s too easy with this kind of shot to leave it completely dark.</td>', 'Love the sky. Great silhouette of the bridge and well done to get detail in the foreground, when it''s too easy with this kind of shot to leave it completely dark.', '2005-02-19 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181802, 147621, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the dark object in the lower left corner intrudes a bit too much.</td>', 'I think that the dark object in the lower left corner intrudes a bit too much.', '2005-02-19 10:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181804, 146584, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Pity that the fourth swan had to creep into the background.</td>', 'Nice shot. Pity that the fourth swan had to creep into the background.', '2005-02-19 10:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181809, 145889, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can see that the inclusion of the raillings helps give a sense of scale, I feel that it might have been better to crop out the top one.</td>', 'I can see that the inclusion of the raillings helps give a sense of scale, I feel that it might have been better to crop out the top one.', '2005-02-19 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181811, 146526, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the bridge. I particularly like how one can see a hint of brightness in the sky on the lower left.</td>', 'Great texture in the bridge. I particularly like how one can see a hint of brightness in the sky on the lower left.', '2005-02-19 10:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181814, 147418, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, although I feel that the centre portion of the stones is a bit dark.</td>', 'Interesting image, although I feel that the centre portion of the stones is a bit dark.', '2005-02-19 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181815, 146258, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2005-02-19 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181816, 147373, 24212, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection with bridges.</td>', 'I don''t get the connection with bridges.', '2005-02-19 10:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181817, 147479, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look with the grass at the top cropped out?</td>', 'I wonder how this would look with the grass at the top cropped out?', '2005-02-19 10:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181818, 147514, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2005-02-19 10:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181819, 146231, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderful night shot. Great capture of the lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful night shot. Great capture of the lighting.', '2005-02-19 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181821, 145594, 24212, '<td valign="top">A bit too low-key for my tastes.</td>', 'A bit too low-key for my tastes.', '2005-02-19 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181823, 147461, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sky on the left looks overexposed. Something that detracts from the rest of the image.</td>', 'The sky on the left looks overexposed. Something that detracts from the rest of the image.', '2005-02-19 10:21:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1181829, 146807, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little flat and uninspiring here.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little flat and uninspiring here.', '2005-02-19 10:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181831, 146704, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great pattern created in this shot.</td>', 'Great pattern created in this shot.', '2005-02-19 10:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181833, 145383, 24212, '<td valign="top">None of this picture appears to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'None of this picture appears to be in sharp focus.', '2005-02-19 10:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181834, 147583, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp and colourful, only let down IMO by the flat sky.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp and colourful, only let down IMO by the flat sky.', '2005-02-19 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181835, 147518, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the buildings on either side to be a little distracting.</td>', 'I find the buildings on either side to be a little distracting.', '2005-02-19 10:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181836, 147277, 30457, '<td valign="top">Im confused. Interesting picture.</td>', 'Im confused. Interesting picture.', '2005-02-19 10:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181837, 147060, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very interesting black and white shot that perhaps needs just a touch of extra sharpening.</td>', 'A very interesting black and white shot that perhaps needs just a touch of extra sharpening.', '2005-02-19 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181838, 147299, 30457, '<td valign="top">A little too blown out on highlights for tastes but beauty is in the eye of the beholder.</td>', 'A little too blown out on highlights for tastes but beauty is in the eye of the beholder.', '2005-02-19 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181840, 147585, 30457, '<td valign="top">very mood setting. Nice composition and nice use of greyscale.</td>', 'very mood setting. Nice composition and nice use of greyscale.', '2005-02-19 10:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181841, 147577, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great textures captured in the sky, the structure and the reflection. I do, however, find the patch of sky in the lower left somewhat distracting. Have you tried cropping it away?</td>', 'Great textures captured in the sky, the structure and the reflection. I do, however, find the patch of sky in the lower left somewhat distracting. Have you tried cropping it away?', '2005-02-19 10:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181843, 147517, 30457, '<td valign="top">nice picture but increase the size just a tad so we all can pick up the details better.</td>', 'nice picture but increase the size just a tad so we all can pick up the details better.', '2005-02-19 10:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181844, 145318, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great morning lighting.</td>', 'Great morning lighting.', '2005-02-19 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181845, 147618, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the cards to be a little unsharp and I find it a touch distracting.</td>', 'I find the cards to be a little unsharp and I find it a touch distracting.', '2005-02-19 10:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181846, 147627, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely low-key shot.</td>', 'Lovely low-key shot.', '2005-02-19 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181848, 145798, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the silhouetting effect is spoiled by the buildings visible beneath the bridge.</td>', 'I feel that the silhouetting effect is spoiled by the buildings visible beneath the bridge.', '2005-02-19 10:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181849, 147305, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great pattern created here.</td>', 'Great pattern created here.', '2005-02-19 10:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181850, 147605, 24212, '<td valign="top">The whole appears to soft and I think that the lighting is too harsh.</td>', 'The whole appears to soft and I think that the lighting is too harsh.', '2005-02-19 10:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181851, 145672, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the way that the bridge stands out  from the rest of the frame (which is lovely by the way). The first 10 of this challenge, for me.</td>', 'I love the way that the bridge stands out  from the rest of the frame (which is lovely by the way). The first 10 of this challenge, for me.', '2005-02-19 10:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181855, 147540, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that cropping off the bottom of the picture mighr be worth trying. I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'I think that cropping off the bottom of the picture mighr be worth trying. I like it nonetheless.', '2005-02-19 10:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181860, 147293, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wow. Love the colours in the sky. The waves and the bank do not seem as sharp as the rest - I presume that this is due to the length of the exposure?</td>', 'Wow. Love the colours in the sky. The waves and the bank do not seem as sharp as the rest - I presume that this is due to the length of the exposure?', '2005-02-19 10:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181861, 147052, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely saturated colours and strong lines.</td>', 'Lovely saturated colours and strong lines.', '2005-02-19 10:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181862, 147402, 24212, '<td valign="top">Ideal lighting conditions. The bridge section really leaps out.</td>', 'Ideal lighting conditions. The bridge section really leaps out.', '2005-02-19 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
