(1182022, 147585, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. The water reflection is fantastic. The image needs a little rotating counter-clockwise, but otherwise, great.</td>', 'This is really nice. The water reflection is fantastic. The image needs a little rotating counter-clockwise, but otherwise, great.', '2005-02-19 12:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
