(1183391, 145921, 21466, '<td valign="top">I think I would have rated this one higher, if the focal point was put beyond the end of the deck. I think that would have pulled the focus of the bridge in just a hair to make it really neat.  Of course then I might be asking you what the sign said... :)</td>', 'I think I would have rated this one higher, if the focal point was put beyond the end of the deck. I think that would have pulled the focus of the bridge in just a hair to make it really neat.  Of course then I might be asking you what the sign said... :)', '2005-02-20 04:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
