(1183600, 146856, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I like the DOF, you have sharp elements very close to the camera and far away. The reddish tone is great, I think with this picture it works better than sepia. 10.</td>', 'Great composition. I like the DOF, you have sharp elements very close to the camera and far away. The reddish tone is great, I think with this picture it works better than sepia. 10.', '2005-02-20 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183601, 147454, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry. Too bad that the car doesn''t stick to it. Where you standing in the middle of the street? 7,</td>', 'I like the symmetry. Too bad that the car doesn''t stick to it. Where you standing in the middle of the street? 7,', '2005-02-20 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183605, 147302, 27845, '<td valign="top">I can''t recognize what this is, so I really can''t tell wether it fits the challenge or not. The image''s appeal is not so strong for me. 4.</td>', 'I can''t recognize what this is, so I really can''t tell wether it fits the challenge or not. The image''s appeal is not so strong for me. 4.', '2005-02-20 11:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183606, 147626, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge. The contrast is too harsh for me, though. 7.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge. The contrast is too harsh for me, though. 7.', '2005-02-20 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183630, 146430, 31859, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective. Also, adding the biker turns a good picture into a great picture, showing the viewer the scale.</td>', 'Excellent perspective. Also, adding the biker turns a good picture into a great picture, showing the viewer the scale.', '2005-02-20 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183637, 145672, 17033, '<td valign="top">Interesting version of this kind of photo....a shorter than normal exposure differentiates the vehicles from each other. The off-centre bridge is balanced nicely by the buildings on the right but the dark trees in the foreground are too much of a distraction from the spectacular lightshow. Still a great photo, however, and I''m sure you''ll get a deservedly high score.</td>', 'Interesting version of this kind of photo....a shorter than normal exposure differentiates the vehicles from each other. The off-centre bridge is balanced nicely by the buildings on the right but the dark trees in the foreground are too much of a distraction from the spectacular lightshow. Still a great photo, however, and I''m sure you''ll get a deservedly high score.', '2005-02-20 11:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183638, 147208, 17033, '<td valign="top">highly original...I''ll even excuse the pun. Wow. Well done. Really knocked me out of my bridge-induced stupor. Wow again.</td>', 'highly original...I''ll even excuse the pun. Wow. Well done. Really knocked me out of my bridge-induced stupor. Wow again.', '2005-02-20 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183640, 146258, 31865, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I would have cropped it to where the bridge is cut off evenly on either side.  Good photo though, and cool bridge.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I would have cropped it to where the bridge is cut off evenly on either side.  Good photo though, and cool bridge.', '2005-02-20 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183648, 147450, 31865, '<td valign="top">interesting hues.  I think I like it.</td>', 'interesting hues.  I think I like it.', '2005-02-20 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
