(1183728, 146921, 8860, '<td valign="top">High viewpoint takes some impact out of this shot. Lighting is a bit dull (midday?) so shooting ealrly or late would help add definition and mood.</td>', 'High viewpoint takes some impact out of this shot. Lighting is a bit dull (midday?) so shooting ealrly or late would help add definition and mood.', '2005-02-20 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
