(1183736, 146018, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shooting for brown? You may just snatch it with this specimen. It''s a masterful collection of DPC golden rules broken, disregarded and smashed to pieces - poor focus, noise, subject and composition - all quite dreadful. Good luck with yourr quest.<br/>:D</td>', 'Shooting for brown? You may just snatch it with this specimen. It''s a masterful collection of DPC golden rules broken, disregarded and smashed to pieces - poor focus, noise, subject and composition - all quite dreadful. Good luck with yourr quest.:D', '2005-02-20 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183737, 147567, 9111, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!! <br/></td>', 'gorgeous!! ', '2005-02-20 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183757, 147061, 23053, '<td valign="top">At first I had you rated at a four, but I think I was too hard...how about 6 instead?  I like the lines in this shot, and the harshness of the underexposed structure and the overexposed sky is growing on me - but that is also the main complaint I have.  I don''t know...very intriguing, to say the least.</td>', 'At first I had you rated at a four, but I think I was too hard...how about 6 instead?  I like the lines in this shot, and the harshness of the underexposed structure and the overexposed sky is growing on me - but that is also the main complaint I have.  I don''t know...very intriguing, to say the least.', '2005-02-20 13:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183762, 146018, 23053, '<td valign="top">I guess this is a bridge that is under repairs...I''m working on trying to figure this out.  As far as the image goes, I can''t say that I like it.  But who am I?  Anyway, if you could have oriented yourself to get a clearer shot of the bridge without the trees, or could have had a slightly different composition (not so centered and stagnant), I would have rated you higher.  The noise doesn''t bother me...I think noise is fine.</td>', 'I guess this is a bridge that is under repairs...I''m working on trying to figure this out.  As far as the image goes, I can''t say that I like it.  But who am I?  Anyway, if you could have oriented yourself to get a clearer shot of the bridge without the trees, or could have had a slightly different composition (not so centered and stagnant), I would have rated you higher.  The noise doesn''t bother me...I think noise is fine.', '2005-02-20 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183766, 146600, 23053, '<td valign="top">Thanks...I really enjoy shots like this where the horizon is purposefully not straight.  Sometimes, it''s a great way to fit a subject in that otherwise won''t fit.  I hope that you do well...I did my part and gave you a 8.</td>', 'Thanks...I really enjoy shots like this where the horizon is purposefully not straight.  Sometimes, it''s a great way to fit a subject in that otherwise won''t fit.  I hope that you do well...I did my part and gave you a 8.', '2005-02-20 13:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183769, 145790, 23053, '<td valign="top">Of the two shots from this exact vantage point, I have to say that I like yours better.  Great color and line.</td>', 'Of the two shots from this exact vantage point, I have to say that I like yours better.  Great color and line.', '2005-02-20 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183772, 146921, 23053, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say that I like the other shot taken at from the exact same vantage as your shot more.  Don''t worry, I stll gave you a seven, but I feel that the color and line of the other are stronger.  You two should meet, though.</td>', 'Sorry to say that I like the other shot taken at from the exact same vantage as your shot more.  Don''t worry, I stll gave you a seven, but I feel that the color and line of the other are stronger.  You two should meet, though.', '2005-02-20 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
