(1183797, 147548, 27845, '<td valign="top">I always thought those insects were much larger! Nice idea, someone else took a similar picture. I like the DOF. The composition is not that interesting. 7.</td>', 'I always thought those insects were much larger! Nice idea, someone else took a similar picture. I like the DOF. The composition is not that interesting. 7.', '2005-02-20 13:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
