(1183802, 146862, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting. This looks very cool and it is an interesting interpretation. The picture looks a little over-sharpened though. 8.</td>', 'Cool lighting. This looks very cool and it is an interesting interpretation. The picture looks a little over-sharpened though. 8.', '2005-02-20 13:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1183803, 147574, 27845, '<td valign="top">Why did you add that strange border to top and bottom? I find it very distracting. This bridge would have been an interesting subject to ''paint with light'' instead of using the flash. Also, a more symmetric approach would have added to the impact. 4.</td>', 'Why did you add that strange border to top and bottom? I find it very distracting. This bridge would have been an interesting subject to ''paint with light'' instead of using the flash. Also, a more symmetric approach would have added to the impact. 4.', '2005-02-20 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
