(1183809, 147627, 27845, '<td valign="top">There are many violins in this challenge. I guess that in English, some part of the instrument is called bridge? Nice picture, anyway. A bit too dark maybe. I like the DOF, it keeps my eye focused on the violin. 7.</td>', 'There are many violins in this challenge. I guess that in English, some part of the instrument is called bridge? Nice picture, anyway. A bit too dark maybe. I like the DOF, it keeps my eye focused on the violin. 7.', '2005-02-20 13:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
