(1184056, 145704, 27847, '<td valign="top">Would have been a great photo, but from just a little different angle. I find the reeds very distracting in this photo and maybe my eyes are playing tricks but the green color cast is not working for me. Too bad you weren''t a little hight to take this photo.</td>', 'Would have been a great photo, but from just a little different angle. I find the reeds very distracting in this photo and maybe my eyes are playing tricks but the green color cast is not working for me. Too bad you weren''t a little hight to take this photo.', '2005-02-20 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184058, 146591, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice old coverd bridge, not too many of them around now a days. I think though you have a bit too much of this river/stream in the shot I think I would have cropped a bit more. Good work either way.</td>', 'Nice old coverd bridge, not too many of them around now a days. I think though you have a bit too much of this river/stream in the shot I think I would have cropped a bit more. Good work either way.', '2005-02-20 16:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184063, 147479, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice tight crop on this photo it really works well here. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice tight crop on this photo it really works well here. Nice work.', '2005-02-20 16:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184064, 147602, 27847, '<td valign="top">Now, clone the person out and were in business. I find the person distract from this photo of the foot bridge. But still a nice photo overall.</td>', 'Now, clone the person out and were in business. I find the person distract from this photo of the foot bridge. But still a nice photo overall.', '2005-02-20 16:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184066, 146494, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very gorgeous photo with great sky that adds to the over all composition.</td>', 'Very gorgeous photo with great sky that adds to the over all composition.', '2005-02-20 16:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184069, 146600, 27847, '<td valign="top">For a photo that most have seen quite a few time, I really like the crop/rotation of the over all photo. Give that little extra to the over shot. Nice work.</td>', 'For a photo that most have seen quite a few time, I really like the crop/rotation of the over all photo. Give that little extra to the over shot. Nice work.', '2005-02-20 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184070, 145410, 27847, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m sure you have already gotten a million comments on this photo. So I''ll be quick... Wow ... very nicely done, what a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Well, I''m sure you have already gotten a million comments on this photo. So I''ll be quick... Wow ... very nicely done, what a beautiful photo.', '2005-02-20 16:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184071, 147516, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very nice vivid colors, which I was there now. Looks like I could enjoy it, nice work.</td>', 'Very nice vivid colors, which I was there now. Looks like I could enjoy it, nice work.', '2005-02-20 16:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184074, 147204, 33229, '<td valign="top">Gave it a good rating in spite of the caption. It would have stood on its own merits.</td>', 'Gave it a good rating in spite of the caption. It would have stood on its own merits.', '2005-02-20 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184077, 146485, 27847, '<td valign="top">Unexpected but very interesting concept on the bridges and I see it very clearly, I''m sure it''s not just in South Africa but is considered everywhere. Nice tight crop with effective depth of field, excellent work.</td>', 'Unexpected but very interesting concept on the bridges and I see it very clearly, I''m sure it''s not just in South Africa but is considered everywhere. Nice tight crop with effective depth of field, excellent work.', '2005-02-20 16:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184079, 146183, 27847, '<td valign="top">Excellent point of view on this photo. Love it.</td>', 'Excellent point of view on this photo. Love it.', '2005-02-20 16:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184081, 146417, 27847, '<td valign="top">Hey, what''s going on here? I don''t see the people running for their lives, ha ha, just kidding. Very nice night photo of this bridge, the fire almost distracts from the bridge but it certainly is interesting.</td>', 'Hey, what''s going on here? I don''t see the people running for their lives, ha ha, just kidding. Very nice night photo of this bridge, the fire almost distracts from the bridge but it certainly is interesting.', '2005-02-20 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184082, 147030, 27847, '<td valign="top">Wow, just gorgeous sky! The bridge, well that''s just very intesting concept for a foot bridge and very nicely lit in this photo. Great Job!</td>', 'Wow, just gorgeous sky! The bridge, well that''s just very intesting concept for a foot bridge and very nicely lit in this photo. Great Job!', '2005-02-20 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184084, 146251, 27847, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this photo is being marked down due to it''s size, very small and hard to see all the details. However, it''s a interesting perspective.</td>', 'I''m sure this photo is being marked down due to it''s size, very small and hard to see all the details. However, it''s a interesting perspective.', '2005-02-20 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184085, 146427, 27847, '<td valign="top">Must be a long bridge, because of the angle that was chosen for this photo. Great way of presenting this bridge, just love this angle/crop. Good work.</td>', 'Must be a long bridge, because of the angle that was chosen for this photo. Great way of presenting this bridge, just love this angle/crop. Good work.', '2005-02-20 16:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184086, 146708, 27847, '<td valign="top">This concept might have worked better if you had the full shot in it. The person I mean, I can mentally see the bridge but would have helped to have it visible to all. Good effort thou.</td>', 'This concept might have worked better if you had the full shot in it. The person I mean, I can mentally see the bridge but would have helped to have it visible to all. Good effort thou.', '2005-02-20 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184121, 146708, 17507, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this kind of shot, but I think that to make it really work it would have to be taken perpendicular to the length of your body and with a very clean background. The technical finesse required to pull off this shot is, unfortunately, lacking. (4)</td>', 'I thought about doing this kind of shot, but I think that to make it really work it would have to be taken perpendicular to the length of your body and with a very clean background. The technical finesse required to pull off this shot is, unfortunately, lacking. (4)', '2005-02-20 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184124, 146554, 17507, '<td valign="top">picture is nice, but title is awful.</td>', 'picture is nice, but title is awful.', '2005-02-20 17:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184125, 146600, 17507, '<td valign="top">odd angle is confusing. I can''t see the purpose of having such a tilted horizon.</td>', 'odd angle is confusing. I can''t see the purpose of having such a tilted horizon.', '2005-02-20 17:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184135, 146928, 33942, '<td valign="top">Bad lighting, doesn''t tell any story.</td>', 'Bad lighting, doesn''t tell any story.', '2005-02-20 17:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184153, 145410, 33942, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2005-02-20 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184156, 147320, 33942, '<td valign="top">Not a bad journalistic shot.</td>', 'Not a bad journalistic shot.', '2005-02-20 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184160, 147370, 33942, '<td valign="top">Not terrible, but not great.</td>', 'Not terrible, but not great.', '2005-02-20 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
