(1184356, 147402, 32434, '<td valign="top">I think that the bridge is a bit too hot, but I''m not sure if there really is any details to be seen on the bridge anyway.  I love how its set against the dark background and foreground as it makes the bridge really stand out. I do have to say though, I think my favorite part of the photo is the tiretracks leading  up to the bridge.  Good job!</td>', 'I think that the bridge is a bit too hot, but I''m not sure if there really is any details to be seen on the bridge anyway.  I love how its set against the dark background and foreground as it makes the bridge really stand out. I do have to say though, I think my favorite part of the photo is the tiretracks leading  up to the bridge.  Good job!', '2005-02-20 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
