(1185558, 146928, 28476, '<td valign="top">Needs a better picture of a father.<br/>I dont want him to be mine.<br/>May be it''s the lights in the picture???<br/> <br/>Update in 21.02.2005:<br/>In MY opinion, the picture needs better lighting to make the man look more appealing to the viewer, not just to the photographer.<br/>The shadow in the background does not look very good in to MY eye. Colors could be adjusted.<br/>The composition is very good.<br/>The picture has a lot of potential as it is and the idea is superb and very distinctive.<br/> <br/>There are a lot of very good pictures in this challenge. This could certainly have been one of them.</td>', 'Needs a better picture of a father.I dont want him to be mine.May be it''s the lights in the picture??? Update in 21.02.2005:In MY opinion, the picture needs better lighting to make the man look more appealing to the viewer, not just to the photographer.The shadow in the background does not look very good in to MY eye. Colors could be adjusted.The composition is very good.The picture has a lot of potential as it is and the idea is superb and very distinctive. There are a lot of very good pictures in this challenge. This could certainly have been one of them.', '2005-02-21 03:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
