(1186111, 147300, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could benefit from a little extra sharpening.</td>', 'I feel that this could benefit from a little extra sharpening.', '2005-02-21 11:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186113, 147618, 33736, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition - the picture, not the hand. This is the opinion of the world-class Bridge Dummy at OU.</td>', 'Terrific composition - the picture, not the hand. This is the opinion of the world-class Bridge Dummy at OU.', '2005-02-21 11:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186114, 146216, 33736, '<td valign="top">Very clever - makes one wonder what the arrow''s pointing to......  (At least, it''s horizontal, not downward)</td>', 'Very clever - makes one wonder what the arrow''s pointing to......  (At least, it''s horizontal, not downward)', '2005-02-21 11:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186115, 147030, 24212, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen a great viewpoint here. I think, however, that the people on the bridge spoil the effect somewhat. The balance of lighting between the artificial fittings on the bridge and the sky is superb.</td>', 'You''ve chosen a great viewpoint here. I think, however, that the people on the bridge spoil the effect somewhat. The balance of lighting between the artificial fittings on the bridge and the sky is superb.', '2005-02-21 11:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186116, 147626, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too obscure for me.</td>', 'Too obscure for me.', '2005-02-21 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186120, 147302, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wish I could work out what this is. A top-down view into a glass?</td>', 'I wish I could work out what this is. A top-down view into a glass?', '2005-02-21 11:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186122, 146195, 33736, '<td valign="top">I loved this picture as it unfolded, but as more water appeared in the view, it lost a little more impact.    If it had ended just above the ice patch to the far right, it would have remained as one of my favorites.</td>', 'I loved this picture as it unfolded, but as more water appeared in the view, it lost a little more impact.    If it had ended just above the ice patch to the far right, it would have remained as one of my favorites.', '2005-02-21 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186123, 146661, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely tranquil shot. I think that it would look even better with an additional dash of sharpening.</td>', 'Lovely tranquil shot. I think that it would look even better with an additional dash of sharpening.', '2005-02-21 11:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186124, 147633, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the electricity pole and the silos appearing above the train spoil the lines somewhat.</td>', 'I think that the electricity pole and the silos appearing above the train spoil the lines somewhat.', '2005-02-21 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186126, 147510, 33736, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there must be something wrong with this one, but it isn''t apparent to me.</td>', 'I''m sure there must be something wrong with this one, but it isn''t apparent to me.', '2005-02-21 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186127, 147042, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lower portion of the sky looks a little unreal, as if too much curves adjustment has been done.</td>', 'The lower portion of the sky looks a little unreal, as if too much curves adjustment has been done.', '2005-02-21 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186131, 147616, 24212, '<td valign="top">The deck of the bridge looks overexposed, which jars a bit. I think that this would look great without the building behind.</td>', 'The deck of the bridge looks overexposed, which jars a bit. I think that this would look great without the building behind.', '2005-02-21 11:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186135, 146537, 33736, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Crisp. Clean. Nice balance of neutrals and colors.</td>', 'Funny.  Crisp. Clean. Nice balance of neutrals and colors.', '2005-02-21 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186136, 147572, 24212, '<td valign="top">To my mind, the central portion of this picture is too dark.</td>', 'To my mind, the central portion of this picture is too dark.', '2005-02-21 11:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186137, 147544, 29148, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my taste.</td>', 'Too dark for my taste.', '2005-02-21 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186139, 146399, 33736, '<td valign="top">Dead-Bridge Walking?  Composition and detail - a little fuzzy.</td>', 'Dead-Bridge Walking?  Composition and detail - a little fuzzy.', '2005-02-21 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186142, 146538, 33736, '<td valign="top">Darn - don''t you wish humans would stop messing up perfect bridge pictures by putting buildings into the design.</td>', 'Darn - don''t you wish humans would stop messing up perfect bridge pictures by putting buildings into the design.', '2005-02-21 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186148, 147304, 33736, '<td valign="top">Lighting and focus are working again this one.</td>', 'Lighting and focus are working again this one.', '2005-02-21 11:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186157, 147429, 33736, '<td valign="top">Perhaps, a slightly different angle for this shot.  The colors and texture of the stones and toppings are lost when the eye is pulled into the water.  The whimsical view is the appearance of the frowning, witchy-looking creature which dominates the top 2/3s of the photo.</td>', 'Perhaps, a slightly different angle for this shot.  The colors and texture of the stones and toppings are lost when the eye is pulled into the water.  The whimsical view is the appearance of the frowning, witchy-looking creature which dominates the top 2/3s of the photo.', '2005-02-21 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186160, 146228, 24212, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that the snow and the house are a little overexposed. Personally, I feel that these areas are too bright in comparison to the rest of the image.</td>', 'It seems to me that the snow and the house are a little overexposed. Personally, I feel that these areas are too bright in comparison to the rest of the image.', '2005-02-21 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186161, 147527, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would look like without the cars.</td>', 'I wonder what this would look like without the cars.', '2005-02-21 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186163, 147466, 29148, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because you took the time to find a bit of the past, soon lost forever.</td>', 'I like this shot because you took the time to find a bit of the past, soon lost forever.', '2005-02-21 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1186165, 145409, 33736, '<td valign="top">Oh, my gosh - that rusty structure is a feast for the eyes. Just a couple area distract from it, though: opposite shore leaving pockets under the bridge arcs, &amp; the yellow triangle at upper right.</td>', 'Oh, my gosh - that rusty structure is a feast for the eyes. Just a couple area distract from it, though: opposite shore leaving pockets under the bridge arcs, & the yellow triangle at upper right.', '2005-02-21 11:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186166, 146986, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the sky is too bright and the mosque does not appear to be clear enough.</td>', 'To me, the sky is too bright and the mosque does not appear to be clear enough.', '2005-02-21 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186169, 147140, 29148, '<td valign="top">I can see that it must be a big bridge, but maybe more of the actual bridge would have made this a better shot.</td>', 'I can see that it must be a big bridge, but maybe more of the actual bridge would have made this a better shot.', '2005-02-21 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186171, 146296, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve managed to avoid overexposing the lights along the edge of the bridge.</td>', 'I like how you''ve managed to avoid overexposing the lights along the edge of the bridge.', '2005-02-21 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186172, 147030, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too well centered, and a bit of a tilt?  But, what a pattern!</td>', 'Too well centered, and a bit of a tilt?  But, what a pattern!', '2005-02-21 11:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186180, 145798, 33736, '<td valign="top">Cropping the bottom area out would have added more stark impact. Also, it would have presented a more dramatic angle.  As it stands, it lessens the conflict of Bridge against Sky.</td>', 'Cropping the bottom area out would have added more stark impact. Also, it would have presented a more dramatic angle.  As it stands, it lessens the conflict of Bridge against Sky.', '2005-02-21 11:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186182, 147559, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like the fish-eye effect. However, the right hand side looks a little dark. I guess that getting the exposure exactly right across the whole frame in such a wide-angle shot is difficult. Also, I wonder what this would look like without the person walking along the harbour wall.</td>', 'I quite like the fish-eye effect. However, the right hand side looks a little dark. I guess that getting the exposure exactly right across the whole frame in such a wide-angle shot is difficult. Also, I wonder what this would look like without the person walking along the harbour wall.', '2005-02-21 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186184, 146485, 33736, '<td valign="top">Again - Less is More.  I would have cropped out all of the gray matter from the bottom of picture (about 25%).</td>', 'Again - Less is More.  I would have cropped out all of the gray matter from the bottom of picture (about 25%).', '2005-02-21 11:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186185, 147304, 24212, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, full of atmosphere. I can almost feel the rain.</td>', 'A wonderful shot, full of atmosphere. I can almost feel the rain.', '2005-02-21 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186187, 146263, 33736, '<td valign="top">Stunning B&amp;W.</td>', 'Stunning B&W.', '2005-02-21 11:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186193, 146921, 24212, '<td valign="top">I would, if I may, suggest that this could do with a little sharpening and perhaps a little levels adjustment to really make it ''pop''.</td>', 'I would, if I may, suggest that this could do with a little sharpening and perhaps a little levels adjustment to really make it ''pop''.', '2005-02-21 11:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186195, 146708, 33736, '<td valign="top">One person or two.  From title - it is probably one, but composition doesn''t make it clear.</td>', 'One person or two.  From title - it is probably one, but composition doesn''t make it clear.', '2005-02-21 12:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186198, 146562, 33736, '<td valign="top">Amazing the things photographers get their loved ones to do!  Needs a little straightening, but really nice composition (no pockets of distracting spaces between any of the elements.)</td>', 'Amazing the things photographers get their loved ones to do!  Needs a little straightening, but really nice composition (no pockets of distracting spaces between any of the elements.)', '2005-02-21 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186200, 146410, 24212, '<td valign="top">I, for one, would love to see some more brightness in those rocks. This is a lovely picture.</td>', 'I, for one, would love to see some more brightness in those rocks. This is a lovely picture.', '2005-02-21 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186202, 146600, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that, given the angled composition, that the boat under the bridge looks a little out of place. Perhaps it could also be a fraction sharper.</td>', 'I think that, given the angled composition, that the boat under the bridge looks a little out of place. Perhaps it could also be a fraction sharper.', '2005-02-21 12:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186203, 145890, 33736, '<td valign="top">Angles, colors, lines, patterns, and shadows.  Nice, pleasant combination.</td>', 'Angles, colors, lines, patterns, and shadows.  Nice, pleasant combination.', '2005-02-21 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186205, 146538, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting here.</td>', 'I really like the lighting here.', '2005-02-21 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186207, 146958, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the subdued colours are great. A real dreamy feel.</td>', 'I think that the subdued colours are great. A real dreamy feel.', '2005-02-21 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186211, 147555, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the wire mesh on the left is a little intrusive. Perhaps it could have been cropped out.</td>', 'I think that the wire mesh on the left is a little intrusive. Perhaps it could have been cropped out.', '2005-02-21 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186212, 146185, 33736, '<td valign="top">Underside is too dark against the neutrals of the cement upward.</td>', 'Underside is too dark against the neutrals of the cement upward.', '2005-02-21 12:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186213, 147628, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great colours and a wonderful look to the surface of the water.</td>', 'Great colours and a wonderful look to the surface of the water.', '2005-02-21 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186215, 145592, 24212, '<td valign="top">Simple and atmospheric. I particularly like the way that the uprights are lit.</td>', 'Simple and atmospheric. I particularly like the way that the uprights are lit.', '2005-02-21 12:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186216, 146593, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too much foreground, and off-plumb.</td>', 'Too much foreground, and off-plumb.', '2005-02-21 12:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186219, 146496, 33736, '<td valign="top">Icicles are interesting, large blur areas are not.</td>', 'Icicles are interesting, large blur areas are not.', '2005-02-21 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186220, 145687, 24212, '<td valign="top">The grey cable on the bottom right rather dominates and draws attention away from the rest of the scene.  Perhaps cropping away about a fifth of the frame from the right would change the emphasis.</td>', 'The grey cable on the bottom right rather dominates and draws attention away from the rest of the scene.  Perhaps cropping away about a fifth of the frame from the right would change the emphasis.', '2005-02-21 12:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186221, 145890, 24212, '<td valign="top">A superbly bright image, only lacking, I feel, in a little sharpness.</td>', 'A superbly bright image, only lacking, I feel, in a little sharpness.', '2005-02-21 12:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186227, 147541, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way that the sky changes from light to dark across the frame. When I look at this, I first see the bright portion of sky, then follow the bridge to the dark portion with the brightly-lit tower.</td>', 'I really like the way that the sky changes from light to dark across the frame. When I look at this, I first see the bright portion of sky, then follow the bridge to the dark portion with the brightly-lit tower.', '2005-02-21 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186233, 146574, 24212, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the soft focus is intentional, but I''d like to see a little sharpening applied. I quite like the composition.</td>', 'I don''t know if the soft focus is intentional, but I''d like to see a little sharpening applied. I quite like the composition.', '2005-02-21 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186234, 147217, 24212, '<td valign="top">This all seems a bit dark and the bridge looks a little lost to me.</td>', 'This all seems a bit dark and the bridge looks a little lost to me.', '2005-02-21 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186240, 147582, 24212, '<td valign="top">Has this been oversharpened? There appear to be haloes around the pedestrian and the concrete on the right. The lines in the bridge seem to be a bit jaggy as well.</td>', 'Has this been oversharpened? There appear to be haloes around the pedestrian and the concrete on the right. The lines in the bridge seem to be a bit jaggy as well.', '2005-02-21 12:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186243, 147158, 24212, '<td valign="top">Bleak picture. The sepia effect really works well.</td>', 'Bleak picture. The sepia effect really works well.', '2005-02-21 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186258, 146929, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find it a bit of a pity that there appears to be another set of power lines behind the ones strung from this tower. It makes the lines against the sky a little more ''fussy''  and less simple and clean than they could have been.</td>', 'I find it a bit of a pity that there appears to be another set of power lines behind the ones strung from this tower. It makes the lines against the sky a little more ''fussy''  and less simple and clean than they could have been.', '2005-02-21 12:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186270, 145651, 24212, '<td valign="top">I know the cable on the left is intended to draw the eye in, but seeing it so out of focus at the first instance lessens the attraction for me, so I don''t seem to follow it into the frame as I feel I ought.</td>', 'I know the cable on the left is intended to draw the eye in, but seeing it so out of focus at the first instance lessens the attraction for me, so I don''t seem to follow it into the frame as I feel I ought.', '2005-02-21 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186273, 147630, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the sky really adds to the impact here.</td>', 'I think that the sky really adds to the impact here.', '2005-02-21 12:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186278, 147223, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice, bright shot and a good composition, but I feel that it could do with an extra touch of sharpening.</td>', 'A nice, bright shot and a good composition, but I feel that it could do with an extra touch of sharpening.', '2005-02-21 12:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186283, 146226, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, with a real ''bridge'' structure. There is, however, a small light patch in the top left corner that draws my attention away from the rest. I guess that this could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, with a real ''bridge'' structure. There is, however, a small light patch in the top left corner that draws my attention away from the rest. I guess that this could have been cropped out.', '2005-02-21 12:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186285, 147163, 24212, '<td valign="top">I always like a bright blue sky. I like the detail in the tower as well.</td>', 'I always like a bright blue sky. I like the detail in the tower as well.', '2005-02-21 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186292, 147562, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that perhaps there''s just a little too much of the dark area beneath the bridge. I feel that the composition has been left a bit ''top heavy''. I think that the colours and textures are spot-on.</td>', 'I think that perhaps there''s just a little too much of the dark area beneath the bridge. I feel that the composition has been left a bit ''top heavy''. I think that the colours and textures are spot-on.', '2005-02-21 12:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186293, 147466, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice ''new-and-old'' juxtaposition, with the sense of rustiness well captured in the old steelwork.</td>', 'A nice ''new-and-old'' juxtaposition, with the sense of rustiness well captured in the old steelwork.', '2005-02-21 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186296, 147208, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the moody, grainy look, but there is a line coming in from the left that seems to upset the simplicity of the shot.</td>', 'I like the moody, grainy look, but there is a line coming in from the left that seems to upset the simplicity of the shot.', '2005-02-21 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186298, 146216, 24212, '<td valign="top">Maybe this would be a little bit better with the sign nearer the right of the frame, pointing into it?</td>', 'Maybe this would be a little bit better with the sign nearer the right of the frame, pointing into it?', '2005-02-21 12:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186300, 147533, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great atmosphere, I love the way the visible portion of the floor inside the bridge fades into blackness.</td>', 'Great atmosphere, I love the way the visible portion of the floor inside the bridge fades into blackness.', '2005-02-21 12:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186301, 145654, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice, sharp, colourful shot, but I find the trees on the left to be a little intrusive.</td>', 'A nice, sharp, colourful shot, but I find the trees on the left to be a little intrusive.', '2005-02-21 12:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186303, 145374, 24212, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the lighting really well. I wonder what this would look like without the bush on the bottom left?</td>', 'You''ve captured the lighting really well. I wonder what this would look like without the bush on the bottom left?', '2005-02-21 12:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186307, 147544, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, this picture is much too dark.</td>', 'To me, this picture is much too dark.', '2005-02-21 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186310, 146572, 24212, '<td valign="top">Rather dramatic. Great sky. I''d like to see this with just a hint of extra sharpening.</td>', 'Rather dramatic. Great sky. I''d like to see this with just a hint of extra sharpening.', '2005-02-21 12:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186313, 145887, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette. I would like to see the sky a shade brighter, though.</td>', 'Great silhouette. I would like to see the sky a shade brighter, though.', '2005-02-21 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186324, 146591, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the colours look a little flat - the bridge does not really seem to stand out. Perhaps a little more saturation in the reds?</td>', 'To me, the colours look a little flat - the bridge does not really seem to stand out. Perhaps a little more saturation in the reds?', '2005-02-21 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186329, 147564, 24212, '<td valign="top">It seems as though the snow has been overexposed, so that all detail has been lost. I think that a touch of addition al sharpening would help a little as well.</td>', 'It seems as though the snow has been overexposed, so that all detail has been lost. I think that a touch of addition al sharpening would help a little as well.', '2005-02-21 13:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186332, 145740, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting is a bit too harsh, especially in the centre. Good idea, though.</td>', 'I think that the lighting is a bit too harsh, especially in the centre. Good idea, though.', '2005-02-21 13:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186340, 147435, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I feel that the streetlamp spoils the effect somewhat.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I feel that the streetlamp spoils the effect somewhat.', '2005-02-21 13:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186344, 147456, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the texture here and wonder what it would look like with a tighter crop from the bottom.</td>', 'I like the texture here and wonder what it would look like with a tighter crop from the bottom.', '2005-02-21 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186349, 146541, 24212, '<td valign="top">A wonderful black and white image. I can''t wait for the end of the challenge to see how you got the lighting so good. Did you use a polariser?</td>', 'A wonderful black and white image. I can''t wait for the end of the challenge to see how you got the lighting so good. Did you use a polariser?', '2005-02-21 13:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186353, 147343, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the flare from the lights really sets this night shot off.</td>', 'I think that the flare from the lights really sets this night shot off.', '2005-02-21 13:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186355, 146923, 24212, '<td valign="top">Stunningly detailed shot.</td>', 'Stunningly detailed shot.', '2005-02-21 13:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186357, 146607, 24212, '<td valign="top">There are plenty of these bridges in this challenge. I think that this is the most colourful.</td>', 'There are plenty of these bridges in this challenge. I think that this is the most colourful.', '2005-02-21 13:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186360, 147448, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bad viewpoint or subject but the image lacks clarity and it does look like it''s been sharpened to compensate for missing definition. It''s a shame because this does look like a lovely scene and you''ve composed it well. <br/> <br/>If I were you I''d use a tripod, try to get closer to the water (without dying trying). Then focus on the lightest part of the scene and expose for around 8-15 secs. Ideally use a Neutral Density filter which will even out tones somewhat and reduce ''hot spots'' fropm lights. This will also give you some super smooth water effects as the long exposure records all the movement as one.</td>', 'Not a bad viewpoint or subject but the image lacks clarity and it does look like it''s been sharpened to compensate for missing definition. It''s a shame because this does look like a lovely scene and you''ve composed it well.  If I were you I''d use a tripod, try to get closer to the water (without dying trying). Then focus on the lightest part of the scene and expose for around 8-15 secs. Ideally use a Neutral Density filter which will even out tones somewhat and reduce ''hot spots'' fropm lights. This will also give you some super smooth water effects as the long exposure records all the movement as one.', '2005-02-21 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186370, 146259, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bad structure but your composition is too tight and you''re not leading people into the shot, but rather out of it. Looks like it was snowing too, but some people might think it was a dirty lens! Perhaps shooting really close to the girders would give a sense of strength and add some detail and dimension to the composition.</td>', 'Not a bad structure but your composition is too tight and you''re not leading people into the shot, but rather out of it. Looks like it was snowing too, but some people might think it was a dirty lens! Perhaps shooting really close to the girders would give a sense of strength and add some detail and dimension to the composition.', '2005-02-21 13:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186371, 146218, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colour of the sea and the landscape around the bridge, but I think that the grass in the foreground is oversaturated in comparison and spoils the overall effect. Also, the person (?) in red is too bright IMO.</td>', 'I like the colour of the sea and the landscape around the bridge, but I think that the grass in the foreground is oversaturated in comparison and spoils the overall effect. Also, the person (?) in red is too bright IMO.', '2005-02-21 13:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186374, 145815, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that a little more sharpening will really bring this out.</td>', 'I feel that a little more sharpening will really bring this out.', '2005-02-21 13:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186375, 147536, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely still scene. Your exposure should have metered on the brightest parts though as you have quite distracting hotspots. Well composed and the feature of raised bridge helps a lot.</td>', 'Lovely still scene. Your exposure should have metered on the brightest parts though as you have quite distracting hotspots. Well composed and the feature of raised bridge helps a lot.', '2005-02-21 13:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186379, 147567, 8860, '<td valign="top">I hate to be one of many here - but why didn''t you straighten this??! It''ll really lose you points unfortunately, because this is a good photo otherwise. Nice colour and a good time of day - sky is pretty too.</td>', 'I hate to be one of many here - but why didn''t you straighten this??! It''ll really lose you points unfortunately, because this is a good photo otherwise. Nice colour and a good time of day - sky is pretty too.', '2005-02-21 13:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
