(1186687, 145787, 33736, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely, serene picture - and a perfect example of how function can mess up form.  The agent, who attached that pipe without disguising it naturally, ought to be shot (with the resulting photo being published locally under the title, "Stupidity Rules!"</td>', 'Such a lovely, serene picture - and a perfect example of how function can mess up form.  The agent, who attached that pipe without disguising it naturally, ought to be shot (with the resulting photo being published locally under the title, "Stupidity Rules!"', '2005-02-21 15:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
