(1186695, 146600, 33736, '<td valign="top">Maybe the historic inhabitants felt like this most days, but it didn''t work for me in this case.  Doing "Different" just to be different doesn''t always work.</td>', 'Maybe the historic inhabitants felt like this most days, but it didn''t work for me in this case.  Doing "Different" just to be different doesn''t always work.', '2005-02-21 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
