(1186859, 147030, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, lighting and sky.  Nuff said.</td>', 'I like the composition, lighting and sky.  Nuff said.', '2005-02-21 17:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186860, 147318, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, sky colour complements bridge very well.</td>', 'Great shot, sky colour complements bridge very well.', '2005-02-21 17:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186862, 146449, 33515, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen a complete person (kid)</td>', 'I would have liked to seen a complete person (kid)', '2005-02-21 17:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186872, 147541, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good clean, smooth photo.8</td>', 'Good clean, smooth photo.8', '2005-02-21 17:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186879, 146497, 4517, '<td valign="top">This old bridge needs fixing. Would look good in b/w or sepia. Swans a nice touch even if one has no head.</td>', 'This old bridge needs fixing. Would look good in b/w or sepia. Swans a nice touch even if one has no head.', '2005-02-21 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186881, 146937, 25218, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the "words in a book" approach to challenges, because I usually do not find it visually interesting , but the blue words are a nice touch and an extra point for using an english-french dictionary. Pas mal</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the "words in a book" approach to challenges, because I usually do not find it visually interesting , but the blue words are a nice touch and an extra point for using an english-french dictionary. Pas mal', '2005-02-21 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186884, 146758, 25218, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful winter scene.  the tracks in the foreground are a nice echo of the girders of the bridge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful winter scene.  the tracks in the foreground are a nice echo of the girders of the bridge.', '2005-02-21 17:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186887, 145672, 4517, '<td valign="top">My favorite.10</td>', 'My favorite.10', '2005-02-21 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186889, 146542, 25218, '<td valign="top">too warm for my taste, but it''s a nice angle &amp; capturing the moon with it is awesome!</td>', 'too warm for my taste, but it''s a nice angle & capturing the moon with it is awesome!', '2005-02-21 17:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186898, 147472, 25218, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Makes me feel squeezed to the edge - claustrophobia &amp; acrophobia all at once! Good tones in the blk/wht, too.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Makes me feel squeezed to the edge - claustrophobia & acrophobia all at once! Good tones in the blk/wht, too.', '2005-02-21 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186906, 147461, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow. I was absorbed in this, focusing on how well you composed the X of the main support and mainly appreciating it as an abstract, and then had the additional pleasure of realizing how far the structure soared above it.</td>', 'Wow. I was absorbed in this, focusing on how well you composed the X of the main support and mainly appreciating it as an abstract, and then had the additional pleasure of realizing how far the structure soared above it.', '2005-02-21 17:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186910, 147543, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the curving sweep of the tracks. If it were a litlte less overexposed and in b/w, I think it would be excellent. Good job!</td>', 'I like the composition with the curving sweep of the tracks. If it were a litlte less overexposed and in b/w, I think it would be excellent. Good job!', '2005-02-21 17:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186918, 146913, 25218, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the rich, deep color of the body, and the focus is so sharp you can see the ridges of the strings - this is a very tactile photo; it seems like I could grasp the instrument if I just reach out. Overall, it doesn''t wow me - - I can''t put my finger on it, exactly, but I get the feeling that I would really, REALLY like this if something were different - probably the crop or angle or something. (sorry)</td>', 'Excellent capture of the rich, deep color of the body, and the focus is so sharp you can see the ridges of the strings - this is a very tactile photo; it seems like I could grasp the instrument if I just reach out. Overall, it doesn''t wow me - - I can''t put my finger on it, exactly, but I get the feeling that I would really, REALLY like this if something were different - probably the crop or angle or something. (sorry)', '2005-02-21 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186926, 146216, 25218, '<td valign="top">Visually, beyond the joke, it''s a little flat. A lot of the background seems like the same shade of gray, probably due to the lighting/time of day? Great observation, though - it made me chuckle - and extra points for not being a "structural" bridge (which is more than I can say for my shot ....).</td>', 'Visually, beyond the joke, it''s a little flat. A lot of the background seems like the same shade of gray, probably due to the lighting/time of day? Great observation, though - it made me chuckle - and extra points for not being a "structural" bridge (which is more than I can say for my shot ....).', '2005-02-21 17:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186930, 147217, 34056, '<td valign="top">Love the Look would be a pt higher for me without the rail shadow on the bridge.</td>', 'Love the Look would be a pt higher for me without the rail shadow on the bridge.', '2005-02-21 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186931, 147427, 34056, '<td valign="top">Love the Contrast of Colors.</td>', 'Love the Contrast of Colors.', '2005-02-21 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186932, 147290, 34056, '<td valign="top">Magazine Look!</td>', 'Magazine Look!', '2005-02-21 17:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186933, 147380, 10124, '<td valign="top">i like the color tone. looks like there''s some sun flare.</td>', 'i like the color tone. looks like there''s some sun flare.', '2005-02-21 18:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186935, 147534, 34056, '<td valign="top">Can you say Horror Move!</td>', 'Can you say Horror Move!', '2005-02-21 18:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186936, 147507, 34056, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2005-02-21 18:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186938, 147391, 25218, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the exposure is wonderful, and the colors are serenely gorgeous. Two complaints: the bridge gets a little lost in the shadow; and the mountain in the background is a little hazy. Otherwise this is perfect. 9</td>', 'Beautiful - the exposure is wonderful, and the colors are serenely gorgeous. Two complaints: the bridge gets a little lost in the shadow; and the mountain in the background is a little hazy. Otherwise this is perfect. 9', '2005-02-21 18:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186942, 147477, 34056, '<td valign="top">Think Would have been Cooler without Sign!</td>', 'Think Would have been Cooler without Sign!', '2005-02-21 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186944, 146958, 34056, '<td valign="top">Awsome Photo</td>', 'Awsome Photo', '2005-02-21 18:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186945, 147309, 34056, '<td valign="top">Very Cool</td>', 'Very Cool', '2005-02-21 18:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186946, 146167, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like the line that the curve of the bridge makes. It''s very graceful. Blue might be a bit oversaturated, it stands out well, yes, but the road''s taken on a bluish tint too.</td>', 'I really like the line that the curve of the bridge makes. It''s very graceful. Blue might be a bit oversaturated, it stands out well, yes, but the road''s taken on a bluish tint too.', '2005-02-21 18:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186952, 147514, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subdued feel, this is a pleasing photo to look at. I agree the border is a needed finishing touch, but the white somehow seems a little harsh.  Some other color....maybe the silver from the strings? And presonally I''d prefer it a little narrower. Overall, very nice job though.</td>', 'Nice composition and subdued feel, this is a pleasing photo to look at. I agree the border is a needed finishing touch, but the white somehow seems a little harsh.  Some other color....maybe the silver from the strings? And presonally I''d prefer it a little narrower. Overall, very nice job though.', '2005-02-21 18:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186960, 146222, 33736, '<td valign="top">Editing a little strong?  This doesn''t quite feel real.</td>', 'Editing a little strong?  This doesn''t quite feel real.', '2005-02-21 18:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186962, 147001, 24970, '<td valign="top">NIce idea. Unfortunate that the focus is on the fingerboard instead of the bridge. You might try cropping everything above where the violin stops, it doesn''t really add anything to the picture. It''s a cool texture, but not really what we want to focus on.</td>', 'NIce idea. Unfortunate that the focus is on the fingerboard instead of the bridge. You might try cropping everything above where the violin stops, it doesn''t really add anything to the picture. It''s a cool texture, but not really what we want to focus on.', '2005-02-21 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186963, 147429, 34056, '<td valign="top">Awsome PHoto But..</td>', 'Awsome PHoto But..', '2005-02-21 18:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186967, 146396, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and color, and good angle on the bridge - gives it a 3D feel.</td>', 'Nice lighting and color, and good angle on the bridge - gives it a 3D feel.', '2005-02-21 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186971, 146950, 24970, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little oversaturated, but a gorgeous picture anyway.</td>', 'Maybe a little oversaturated, but a gorgeous picture anyway.', '2005-02-21 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186984, 147001, 33736, '<td valign="top">uneven lighting - lost that look of richness when the left only shows light reflected. Also, the blurred tailpiece prevents the eye from smoothly crossing the bridge back toward the lush darkness of the fabric.</td>', 'uneven lighting - lost that look of richness when the left only shows light reflected. Also, the blurred tailpiece prevents the eye from smoothly crossing the bridge back toward the lush darkness of the fabric.', '2005-02-21 18:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186987, 147380, 25111, '<td valign="top">Nice color and technique, border is a little big for me.<br/> <br/>Ísland rokkar!</td>', 'Nice color and technique, border is a little big for me. Ísland rokkar!', '2005-02-21 18:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186988, 146937, 34056, '<td valign="top">If bridge was the most in foucus word this would gain points!!!</td>', 'If bridge was the most in foucus word this would gain points!!!', '2005-02-21 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186989, 146919, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yuk. Cool.  But not really a bridge - just a delightful touch.</td>', 'Yuk. Cool.  But not really a bridge - just a delightful touch.', '2005-02-21 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186993, 145787, 34056, '<td valign="top">pipe loses points sorry- but awsome photo</td>', 'pipe loses points sorry- but awsome photo', '2005-02-21 18:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1186994, 145731, 25111, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image, but sorry, I can''t see the bridge...</td>', 'This is a stunning image, but sorry, I can''t see the bridge...', '2005-02-21 18:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187001, 147601, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this but think it would look better if you used curves to bring out more detail in the dark areas</td>', 'I like this but think it would look better if you used curves to bring out more detail in the dark areas', '2005-02-21 18:43:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1187018, 145316, 33736, '<td valign="top">Creativity falling off the Topic.  Sorry, this one is just too big a stretch.  The focal point isn''t catching.</td>', 'Creativity falling off the Topic.  Sorry, this one is just too big a stretch.  The focal point isn''t catching.', '2005-02-21 18:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187025, 147451, 33736, '<td valign="top">More off the bottom and more up toward the arch in the foreground?  Nevertheless, lovely colors and lights.</td>', 'More off the bottom and more up toward the arch in the foreground?  Nevertheless, lovely colors and lights.', '2005-02-21 18:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187028, 145783, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice find - Great colors!</td>', 'Nice find - Great colors!', '2005-02-21 19:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187033, 147550, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too little of the structure? - there''s nothing in the colors or patterns to grab and hold my interest.</td>', 'Too little of the structure? - there''s nothing in the colors or patterns to grab and hold my interest.', '2005-02-21 19:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187037, 146423, 33736, '<td valign="top">You needed to stand back to capture all of the small sign on top.</td>', 'You needed to stand back to capture all of the small sign on top.', '2005-02-21 19:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187042, 147576, 33736, '<td valign="top">This needed straightening and cropping at the left (the whole support piece), but you truly captured the sense of "curve"</td>', 'This needed straightening and cropping at the left (the whole support piece), but you truly captured the sense of "curve"', '2005-02-21 19:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187050, 147548, 33736, '<td valign="top">I have seen some great bug pix in this challenge - and even when stretching the definition, they could all meet the criteria.  But, Gosh, what a waste of perfect photographs that could have been entered under a more appropriate category.</td>', 'I have seen some great bug pix in this challenge - and even when stretching the definition, they could all meet the criteria.  But, Gosh, what a waste of perfect photographs that could have been entered under a more appropriate category.', '2005-02-21 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187054, 146583, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too "inside."  - the connection to Bridges apparent only to those who use these Thig-a-ma-jiggies?</td>', 'Too "inside."  - the connection to Bridges apparent only to those who use these Thig-a-ma-jiggies?', '2005-02-21 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187064, 145308, 33736, '<td valign="top">This is muddy, and unclear as to what the subject is.</td>', 'This is muddy, and unclear as to what the subject is.', '2005-02-21 19:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187066, 147338, 33736, '<td valign="top">On topic, but barely.</td>', 'On topic, but barely.', '2005-02-21 19:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187071, 147490, 33736, '<td valign="top">Unworldly and beautiful - very imaginative.</td>', 'Unworldly and beautiful - very imaginative.', '2005-02-21 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187082, 147507, 33736, '<td valign="top">The foreground is great.  The background is too muddy and monochromatic.  Unfortunately, the strength of the bridge and land demands that there be something to the back distance for balance.  The two areas here conflict.</td>', 'The foreground is great.  The background is too muddy and monochromatic.  Unfortunately, the strength of the bridge and land demands that there be something to the back distance for balance.  The two areas here conflict.', '2005-02-21 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187085, 147452, 33736, '<td valign="top">Straight up is too static - It needs angle to create space that draws attention.</td>', 'Straight up is too static - It needs angle to create space that draws attention.', '2005-02-21 19:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187089, 147585, 33736, '<td valign="top">Needs straightening, but terrific design on reflection.</td>', 'Needs straightening, but terrific design on reflection.', '2005-02-21 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187111, 147633, 33736, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t make your title an interesting comment.</td>', 'This picture doesn''t make your title an interesting comment.', '2005-02-21 19:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187137, 146834, 33736, '<td valign="top">Darn - the red sign shouldn''t be there, at least not in its present state.</td>', 'Darn - the red sign shouldn''t be there, at least not in its present state.', '2005-02-21 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187147, 146928, 33736, '<td valign="top">I would say "binds" rather that "bridges".   A progression, a passage, a uniting - but not a transition from one dimension to another.</td>', 'I would say "binds" rather that "bridges".   A progression, a passage, a uniting - but not a transition from one dimension to another.', '2005-02-21 19:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187149, 147174, 30861, '<td valign="top">That the nantucket lightship? Whoever you are, if you''re around here let''s get together sometime... I really appreciate the nautical bridge take, and I scored this a 7 for lateral thinking. It''s a nice, tight image, although I might have cropped out the piling on the left, or included more of it in the shot. I''m a little bugged by the magenta shift showing up in the sky and on the highlights on the bridge. Gave it a 7.</td>', 'That the nantucket lightship? Whoever you are, if you''re around here let''s get together sometime... I really appreciate the nautical bridge take, and I scored this a 7 for lateral thinking. It''s a nice, tight image, although I might have cropped out the piling on the left, or included more of it in the shot. I''m a little bugged by the magenta shift showing up in the sky and on the highlights on the bridge. Gave it a 7.', '2005-02-21 19:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187152, 145323, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is really eerie &amp; strange. I gave it an 8. The colors are a little muddy and the sharpness is a little soft for the subject, or I''d have it at 9. Strong entry.</td>', 'This is really eerie & strange. I gave it an 8. The colors are a little muddy and the sharpness is a little soft for the subject, or I''d have it at 9. Strong entry.', '2005-02-21 19:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187155, 147631, 30861, '<td valign="top">JeJeJe.. I have shot that same damned angle with that same damned tree. I didn''t use my Sagamores on this challenge though. Nice shot, great water. Pity it isn''t crisper or I''d have it at 9 instead of 8.</td>', 'JeJeJe.. I have shot that same damned angle with that same damned tree. I didn''t use my Sagamores on this challenge though. Nice shot, great water. Pity it isn''t crisper or I''d have it at 9 instead of 8.', '2005-02-21 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187158, 146430, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely compsoed shot. it seems a little flat and unsaturated, though. The cyclist is perfect.</td>', 'This is a very nicely compsoed shot. it seems a little flat and unsaturated, though. The cyclist is perfect.', '2005-02-21 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187161, 146989, 30861, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this photo was 7. I felt it was a little washed out. I love the pedestrian, the cyclist, the driver of the boat, and the triangle they describe. Viewing it a second time, I believe the tonalityu is intentional and effective. The image has grown on me. I am bumping it to 9 and putting it in my favorites. I hope it does well.</td>', 'My first reaction to this photo was 7. I felt it was a little washed out. I love the pedestrian, the cyclist, the driver of the boat, and the triangle they describe. Viewing it a second time, I believe the tonalityu is intentional and effective. The image has grown on me. I am bumping it to 9 and putting it in my favorites. I hope it does well.', '2005-02-21 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187177, 147052, 33736, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  all the patterns.  and the lights that looks like bells.</td>', 'I love this picture.  all the patterns.  and the lights that looks like bells.', '2005-02-21 20:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187205, 147309, 33008, '<td valign="top">Nice! The title really says it all! I love the distinct illumunation of each light pole.</td>', 'Nice! The title really says it all! I love the distinct illumunation of each light pole.', '2005-02-21 20:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187215, 147208, 17081, '<td valign="top">I like the different take - and the grain doesn''t bother me so much, but I do wish it weren''t cropped off as it is.</td>', 'I like the different take - and the grain doesn''t bother me so much, but I do wish it weren''t cropped off as it is.', '2005-02-21 20:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187216, 146494, 17081, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice, and the bridge is somewhat interesting; but the composition doesn''t do much for me here.</td>', 'The sky is nice, and the bridge is somewhat interesting; but the composition doesn''t do much for me here.', '2005-02-21 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187217, 147456, 17081, '<td valign="top">blown out highlights</td>', 'blown out highlights', '2005-02-21 20:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187218, 147567, 17081, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but the siloutted reflection is a treat.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but the siloutted reflection is a treat.', '2005-02-21 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187220, 147052, 17081, '<td valign="top">interesting lines</td>', 'interesting lines', '2005-02-21 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187226, 145336, 17081, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit askewed, and the focus seems off.</td>', 'Seems a bit askewed, and the focus seems off.', '2005-02-21 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187228, 147370, 17081, '<td valign="top">line work is interesting - nice composition</td>', 'line work is interesting - nice composition', '2005-02-21 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187231, 147609, 17081, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the tones (though wish those lights to the right weren''t quite so bright)</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the tones (though wish those lights to the right weren''t quite so bright)', '2005-02-21 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187232, 147023, 17081, '<td valign="top">out of focus and centered crop doesn''t help</td>', 'out of focus and centered crop doesn''t help', '2005-02-21 20:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187233, 147565, 17081, '<td valign="top">nice crisp image - love the effect of the lights - so glad there isn''t any parts of a car in the image - much more interesting that way.</td>', 'nice crisp image - love the effect of the lights - so glad there isn''t any parts of a car in the image - much more interesting that way.', '2005-02-21 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187234, 147634, 17081, '<td valign="top">overprocessed?</td>', 'overprocessed?', '2005-02-21 20:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187237, 145696, 17081, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones - just don''t care much for the composition</td>', 'beautiful tones - just don''t care much for the composition', '2005-02-21 20:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187243, 146308, 17081, '<td valign="top">like the color of the bridge, and the sunlight on the pillars (whatever they are called) and the reflection - only think there may be too much sky.</td>', 'like the color of the bridge, and the sunlight on the pillars (whatever they are called) and the reflection - only think there may be too much sky.', '2005-02-21 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187244, 146009, 17081, '<td valign="top">Cute couple but the bridge theme is really stretched here. <br/>I could see engagement being a bridge from the single life to marriage - but what does marriage bridge us to?</td>', 'Cute couple but the bridge theme is really stretched here. I could see engagement being a bridge from the single life to marriage - but what does marriage bridge us to?', '2005-02-21 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187245, 147553, 17081, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - love the tones, the depth - very nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful - love the tones, the depth - very nice work.', '2005-02-21 20:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187247, 146906, 17081, '<td valign="top">Perhaps would be better without the cars in the road - and straight on.</td>', 'Perhaps would be better without the cars in the road - and straight on.', '2005-02-21 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187248, 147142, 17081, '<td valign="top">nice tones/textures</td>', 'nice tones/textures', '2005-02-21 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187252, 147295, 34062, '<td valign="top">Berry kewl picture wouldn''t mind meeting the photographer!</td>', 'Berry kewl picture wouldn''t mind meeting the photographer!', '2005-02-21 20:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187253, 145308, 17081, '<td valign="top">lost me with the title - out of focus  - though I kinda like the coloring.</td>', 'lost me with the title - out of focus  - though I kinda like the coloring.', '2005-02-21 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
