(1187527, 147290, 13305, '<td valign="top">Very Zen.  Your composition is nearly as good as the garden setting.  Looks really peaceful. Good saturation, tone and focus too.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very Zen.  Your composition is nearly as good as the garden setting.  Looks really peaceful. Good saturation, tone and focus too.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-02-21 23:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
