(1187531, 146928, 13305, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I don''t think I''d understand this picture.  Photographically good, although I believe I would have cropped in closer in to eliminate most of the open space on the left.</td>', 'Without the title, I don''t think I''d understand this picture.  Photographically good, although I believe I would have cropped in closer in to eliminate most of the open space on the left.', '2005-02-21 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
