(1187551, 146958, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  The fog is alsmost perfect, without obscuring the trees in the distance, and with almost no effect at all in the lower part of the picture. Nice seasonal color in the part that has color too.</td>', 'I like this picture.  The fog is alsmost perfect, without obscuring the trees in the distance, and with almost no effect at all in the lower part of the picture. Nice seasonal color in the part that has color too.', '2005-02-21 23:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
