(1187575, 147335, 33736, '<td valign="top">You didn''t lose any of the design detail, or the art of this engineering marvel.  The 2nd arch appears at the the far end.</td>', 'You didn''t lose any of the design detail, or the art of this engineering marvel.  The 2nd arch appears at the the far end.', '2005-02-21 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187579, 146283, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wow, you found a wonderful level of murkiness in this scene - it invites the viewer to search for an escapee amidst the shadows.</td>', 'Wow, you found a wonderful level of murkiness in this scene - it invites the viewer to search for an escapee amidst the shadows.', '2005-02-21 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187583, 146258, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2005-02-21 23:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187616, 146569, 19831, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. A nice pleasant composition with a rustic feel. It is composed well, even with the waterfall (a nice secondary subject) and foreground, trees and sky and such, the bridge still is made a very strong focal point. I find my eye wandering along the texture and lines of the bridge, and then travels back along the waterfall again in a pleasing loop. I don''t think the sepia ''tone'' takes anything away, but I am wondering if perhaps all the texture in the shot would be even stronger in straight b/w? Anyways, a very nice shot IMO.</td>', 'I really like this shot. A nice pleasant composition with a rustic feel. It is composed well, even with the waterfall (a nice secondary subject) and foreground, trees and sky and such, the bridge still is made a very strong focal point. I find my eye wandering along the texture and lines of the bridge, and then travels back along the waterfall again in a pleasing loop. I don''t think the sepia ''tone'' takes anything away, but I am wondering if perhaps all the texture in the shot would be even stronger in straight b/w? Anyways, a very nice shot IMO.', '2005-02-22 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187620, 147454, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, composed nicely. I really like how you''ve framed the tower with the lions. Works really well. Technically looks very good also. A little nitpicky, but wondering if it might be a tad bit stronger shot if you could of caught it with no cars on the bridge? Nice job.</td>', 'Very interesting subject, composed nicely. I really like how you''ve framed the tower with the lions. Works really well. Technically looks very good also. A little nitpicky, but wondering if it might be a tad bit stronger shot if you could of caught it with no cars on the bridge? Nice job.', '2005-02-22 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187621, 147553, 20679, '<td valign="top">Exquisite</td>', 'Exquisite', '2005-02-22 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187633, 147626, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative intrepretation of the challenge. I like it. Your border works in this case, but in a way it almost seems to make the shot a little subdued, wondering if maybe it would be even bolder without a border? Nice job.</td>', 'Very creative intrepretation of the challenge. I like it. Your border works in this case, but in a way it almost seems to make the shot a little subdued, wondering if maybe it would be even bolder without a border? Nice job.', '2005-02-22 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187638, 146217, 19831, '<td valign="top">The bridge looks like it has a nice curve to it. This might be a much stronger shot, especially considering the challenge, to show more of it and less scenery.</td>', 'The bridge looks like it has a nice curve to it. This might be a much stronger shot, especially considering the challenge, to show more of it and less scenery.', '2005-02-22 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187644, 145704, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject and a nice perspective. I don''t think the green tone helps the shot though.</td>', 'An interesting subject and a nice perspective. I don''t think the green tone helps the shot though.', '2005-02-22 00:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187646, 147553, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Nice traditional perspective. Good tone. I think your border works well in this case, gives it a nice ''poster'' feel. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Nice traditional perspective. Good tone. I think your border works well in this case, gives it a nice ''poster'' feel. Good job.', '2005-02-22 00:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187650, 146251, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Nice composition. Might do better if it were larger to show more detail.</td>', 'Great perspective. Nice composition. Might do better if it were larger to show more detail.', '2005-02-22 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187653, 146258, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Interesting perspective. I like the shot. Good job.</td>', 'Very creative. Interesting perspective. I like the shot. Good job.', '2005-02-22 00:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187655, 147536, 19831, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Love the reflections. Great timing, catching the bridge up and the water so still. Nice, nice job.</td>', 'Awesome shot. Love the reflections. Great timing, catching the bridge up and the water so still. Nice, nice job.', '2005-02-22 00:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187659, 147535, 31213, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus!</td>', 'A bit out of focus!', '2005-02-22 00:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187662, 146899, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Also its very crisp.  Nice to look at.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Also its very crisp.  Nice to look at.', '2005-02-22 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187729, 147442, 16046, '<td valign="top">fine, fine job, awesome contrast, 10</td>', 'fine, fine job, awesome contrast, 10', '2005-02-22 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187730, 147444, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very cool, nice fog and color</td>', 'Very cool, nice fog and color', '2005-02-22 01:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187732, 147178, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent fog shot, should place high</td>', 'Excellent fog shot, should place high', '2005-02-22 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187734, 147604, 16046, '<td valign="top">awesome, great fog</td>', 'awesome, great fog', '2005-02-22 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187740, 147208, 20679, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2005-02-22 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187742, 147567, 34069, '<td valign="top">Ah, the most  photographed bridge in town.  I''ve seen (and taken) a lot of photos of this  one but hadn''t thought of this angle before.  It feels like it''s leaning to the right a bit, but I like the deep blue sky against the gold reflection on the water.  The one bright spot in the trees is distracting.  Bridges tend to lead to a horizontal orientation, but the vertical orientation with lots of sky works well here.</td>', 'Ah, the most  photographed bridge in town.  I''ve seen (and taken) a lot of photos of this  one but hadn''t thought of this angle before.  It feels like it''s leaning to the right a bit, but I like the deep blue sky against the gold reflection on the water.  The one bright spot in the trees is distracting.  Bridges tend to lead to a horizontal orientation, but the vertical orientation with lots of sky works well here.', '2005-02-22 01:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187779, 147569, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette and colors in the sky. I think this works also if you crop it so the bottom of the bridge is the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette and colors in the sky. I think this works also if you crop it so the bottom of the bridge is the bottom of the picture.', '2005-02-22 02:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187783, 147631, 24970, '<td valign="top">This, for some odd reason, looks like toys to me, though I know it''s not. It''s very interesting.  And nice composition. I would probably have cropped a sliver off the left side to get rid of that glaring light.</td>', 'This, for some odd reason, looks like toys to me, though I know it''s not. It''s very interesting.  And nice composition. I would probably have cropped a sliver off the left side to get rid of that glaring light.', '2005-02-22 02:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187785, 147159, 30713, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2005-02-22 02:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187791, 147051, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is divided up into three general sections (bush, bridge, background). Though it''s a really busy shot, that gives it some sense of foundation.</td>', 'I like the way this is divided up into three general sections (bush, bridge, background). Though it''s a really busy shot, that gives it some sense of foundation.', '2005-02-22 02:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187794, 146907, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love that you included the support in the upper right, it adds a lot to the depth of the shot.</td>', 'I love that you included the support in the upper right, it adds a lot to the depth of the shot.', '2005-02-22 02:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187796, 146317, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is kinda cool. Did you try cropping it so the dark support in the foreground forms a natural frame? (So a little off the right and about a quarter from the top).</td>', 'This is kinda cool. Did you try cropping it so the dark support in the foreground forms a natural frame? (So a little off the right and about a quarter from the top).', '2005-02-22 03:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187801, 147380, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot, the light has almost a metallic quality. Maybe a slightly thinner border, with more of the blue tones of the shot? (Oh man, border police. I''m sorry. There''s far too many opinions on those). More on the picture....good composition and clarity. A couple of spots from the light that would love to be cloned out with non-basic editing rules. Though they''re not really that noticeable or distracting. Overall, I like this.</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot, the light has almost a metallic quality. Maybe a slightly thinner border, with more of the blue tones of the shot? (Oh man, border police. I''m sorry. There''s far too many opinions on those). More on the picture....good composition and clarity. A couple of spots from the light that would love to be cloned out with non-basic editing rules. Though they''re not really that noticeable or distracting. Overall, I like this.', '2005-02-22 03:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187804, 147208, 24970, '<td valign="top">Ya know, the grain kinda works for me here. It''s a very unique mood. With that, though, I''m not sure the crisp white border fits in. Would love to have this shot shifted down and to the right a little bit.</td>', 'Ya know, the grain kinda works for me here. It''s a very unique mood. With that, though, I''m not sure the crisp white border fits in. Would love to have this shot shifted down and to the right a little bit.', '2005-02-22 03:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187806, 147529, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice job of letting the picture tell a story. And I like the flowing curve of the river, it makes for a photo that''s easy on the eyes.</td>', 'Nice job of letting the picture tell a story. And I like the flowing curve of the river, it makes for a photo that''s easy on the eyes.', '2005-02-22 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187808, 146171, 24970, '<td valign="top">Oh! This really makes me want to peek around the corner a little so I can see more of the bridge. I like the colors in this shot.</td>', 'Oh! This really makes me want to peek around the corner a little so I can see more of the bridge. I like the colors in this shot.', '2005-02-22 03:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187814, 147598, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice simple, clean lines. I like this. Especially the cool feel of the trees behind the mist.</td>', 'Nice simple, clean lines. I like this. Especially the cool feel of the trees behind the mist.', '2005-02-22 03:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187815, 145409, 24970, '<td valign="top">I know this is a bridge challenge, but I think this would also be cool with the bridge thing out of focus and the waves in. For its purposes, though, this works well. It''s a unique shot. Would maybe have cropped out that sliver of support on the left, or included more of it.</td>', 'I know this is a bridge challenge, but I think this would also be cool with the bridge thing out of focus and the waves in. For its purposes, though, this works well. It''s a unique shot. Would maybe have cropped out that sliver of support on the left, or included more of it.', '2005-02-22 03:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187817, 147125, 24970, '<td valign="top">I hope people don''t vote this down for not being all crisply in focus. Personally, I like the mood that this creates. It''s mystical. Would love to see it in color too.</td>', 'I hope people don''t vote this down for not being all crisply in focus. Personally, I like the mood that this creates. It''s mystical. Would love to see it in color too.', '2005-02-22 03:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187820, 147510, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and color tones. This is also a cool picture if I crop it so the bottom is where the fence comes in.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and color tones. This is also a cool picture if I crop it so the bottom is where the fence comes in.', '2005-02-22 03:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187839, 147620, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot. Nice Black and White but seems to be a bit dark but that could add to the mood. Overall good picture and find. 6</td>', 'Very emotive shot. Nice Black and White but seems to be a bit dark but that could add to the mood. Overall good picture and find. 6', '2005-02-22 04:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187840, 146233, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and mood. I like the way you toned down the background to isolate the boy on the bridge. A good example of keeping the background from being distracting. Good job 7</td>', 'Very nice capture and mood. I like the way you toned down the background to isolate the boy on the bridge. A good example of keeping the background from being distracting. Good job 7', '2005-02-22 04:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187841, 147502, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good picture of a bridge but the contrast seems to be off. No real detail areas as the image seems flat. Nice color and the lighting is good. I just can''t put my finger on why the image seems flat..... has me baffled. Good effort 6</td>', 'Good picture of a bridge but the contrast seems to be off. No real detail areas as the image seems flat. Nice color and the lighting is good. I just can''t put my finger on why the image seems flat..... has me baffled. Good effort 6', '2005-02-22 04:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187842, 147006, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your picture is way to small for so much information. Way to busy. Next time try using the full 640 x size so you will have a large picture to display your information. With that said from what I can see on a small picture your lighting is good at the bottom but too dark at the top. I think the composition could of been better and may taken at a different time of day to eliminate unwanted shadows. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Your picture is way to small for so much information. Way to busy. Next time try using the full 640 x size so you will have a large picture to display your information. With that said from what I can see on a small picture your lighting is good at the bottom but too dark at the top. I think the composition could of been better and may taken at a different time of day to eliminate unwanted shadows. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-02-22 04:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187843, 147443, 22970, '<td valign="top">I know we all here a lot about the rule of thirds which is where you main truss is placed in the picture. But in this case I believe your photograph could of broken the rule of thirds and benefited. I would of liked to see the main truss in the middle give symmetry. Nice lighting, color, and tone. Focus and dof is spot on. 7</td>', 'I know we all here a lot about the rule of thirds which is where you main truss is placed in the picture. But in this case I believe your photograph could of broken the rule of thirds and benefited. I would of liked to see the main truss in the middle give symmetry. Nice lighting, color, and tone. Focus and dof is spot on. 7', '2005-02-22 04:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187846, 147617, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and dof. Focus good and I like the way your photograph is broken up in thirds, Sky/bridge and distances/ foreground and all have a different feel. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice colors and dof. Focus good and I like the way your photograph is broken up in thirds, Sky/bridge and distances/ foreground and all have a different feel. Good job.', '2005-02-22 05:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187847, 147598, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice compozition though too big contrast and wished for more sharpness.</td>', 'Nice compozition though too big contrast and wished for more sharpness.', '2005-02-22 05:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187850, 147536, 27524, '<td valign="top">The sharpness is amazing... very good detailed capture.</td>', 'The sharpness is amazing... very good detailed capture.', '2005-02-22 05:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187852, 147250, 27524, '<td valign="top">The object of picture isnt very interesting but way of capture is very creative.</td>', 'The object of picture isnt very interesting but way of capture is very creative.', '2005-02-22 05:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187853, 146929, 28476, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see any bridge in this one...<br/>But it''s just such a good picture, that i had to give it 8.<br/></td>', 'I just don''t see any bridge in this one...But it''s just such a good picture, that i had to give it 8.', '2005-02-22 05:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187855, 147607, 33736, '<td valign="top">Simple.  and Effective, with excellent lighting.</td>', 'Simple.  and Effective, with excellent lighting.', '2005-02-22 05:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187858, 145410, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice effects on the street lights!  and I will wonder about that "window" in the water for a long time.</td>', 'Nice effects on the street lights!  and I will wonder about that "window" in the water for a long time.', '2005-02-22 05:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187861, 147248, 33736, '<td valign="top">Candle on the Water - what a beautiful image!</td>', 'Candle on the Water - what a beautiful image!', '2005-02-22 05:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187863, 147569, 33736, '<td valign="top">Pretty silhouette - without losing details of bridge and trees.</td>', 'Pretty silhouette - without losing details of bridge and trees.', '2005-02-22 05:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187865, 146226, 33736, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how this was done!</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how this was done!', '2005-02-22 05:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187866, 145594, 33736, '<td valign="top">I''m low-scoring this, not for the obscurity, but for the composition and lighting.</td>', 'I''m low-scoring this, not for the obscurity, but for the composition and lighting.', '2005-02-22 05:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187867, 146449, 15575, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a different camera angle would work better here, so that you can see the child''s face?</td>', 'Perhaps a different camera angle would work better here, so that you can see the child''s face?', '2005-02-22 05:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187868, 147232, 33736, '<td valign="top">This is a bit busy (given area, can''t be helped.)  My problem with it is - that in the middle of all the chaos, nothing is singled out to study or admire.</td>', 'This is a bit busy (given area, can''t be helped.)  My problem with it is - that in the middle of all the chaos, nothing is singled out to study or admire.', '2005-02-22 05:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187870, 146487, 15575, '<td valign="top">IMO the photo would work better without the border</td>', 'IMO the photo would work better without the border', '2005-02-22 05:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187872, 147303, 33736, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a more angled view would have nutured a greater interest in a very unusual design.</td>', 'Perhaps a more angled view would have nutured a greater interest in a very unusual design.', '2005-02-22 05:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187873, 145259, 33736, '<td valign="top">The internal externalized?</td>', 'The internal externalized?', '2005-02-22 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
