(1187917, 147250, 33736, '<td valign="top">Angled for angled sake doesn''t work.  But, yours creates a true design - and it almost works.  Something in the coloring dissipated the drama, however.</td>', 'Angled for angled sake doesn''t work.  But, yours creates a true design - and it almost works.  Something in the coloring dissipated the drama, however.', '2005-02-22 06:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
