(1188344, 147587, 6667, '<td valign="top">This isn''t funny (or cute)!!!  Our Black Lab did something like this. . . she got to our daughter''s birthday cake before we could celebrate the day!.  Nicely done.  BOL<br/> <br/>P.S. Comment about being "funny" was made tongue in cheek.</td>', 'This isn''t funny (or cute)!!!  Our Black Lab did something like this. . . she got to our daughter''s birthday cake before we could celebrate the day!.  Nicely done.  BOL P.S. Comment about being "funny" was made tongue in cheek.', '2005-02-22 11:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188347, 145318, 6667, '<td valign="top">Hi fellow Clevelander.  Great shot and reflection.  Unique view of the swing bridge not normally taken. BOL</td>', 'Hi fellow Clevelander.  Great shot and reflection.  Unique view of the swing bridge not normally taken. BOL', '2005-02-22 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188350, 147566, 14448, '<td valign="top">Creative concept, strong graphic image, well composed.  For me, the black border distracts more than it enhances.  Overall well done.</td>', 'Creative concept, strong graphic image, well composed.  For me, the black border distracts more than it enhances.  Overall well done.', '2005-02-22 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188358, 147628, 6150, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the colors.  Best I''ve seen so far. It''s a 10 from me.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the colors.  Best I''ve seen so far. It''s a 10 from me.', '2005-02-22 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188362, 147536, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is so cool! Really sharp and neat, well exposed (only two towers in the back are blown out). Great colour spectrum. Awesome. 10.</td>', 'Wow! This is so cool! Really sharp and neat, well exposed (only two towers in the back are blown out). Great colour spectrum. Awesome. 10.', '2005-02-22 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188366, 147461, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool lines. If the sky was pure blue they would come out even better. 7.</td>', 'Cool lines. If the sky was pure blue they would come out even better. 7.', '2005-02-22 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188367, 147451, 6150, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Good luck.', '2005-02-22 11:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188369, 147631, 6150, '<td valign="top">Great Shot.  Good Luck</td>', 'Great Shot.  Good Luck', '2005-02-22 11:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188370, 147633, 27845, '<td valign="top">No, I didn''t know that. I guess you meet the challenge, but you should put more emphasis on thr ''bridge'' you''re referring to. Can it even be seen at this angle? I mean, I don''t know what part of the train <i>is</i> the bridge. 4.</td>', 'No, I didn''t know that. I guess you meet the challenge, but you should put more emphasis on thr ''bridge'' you''re referring to. Can it even be seen at this angle? I mean, I don''t know what part of the train is the bridge. 4.', '2005-02-22 11:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188374, 147276, 27845, '<td valign="top">lol. 6.</td>', 'lol. 6.', '2005-02-22 11:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188379, 147215, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice candid. I like the tilt. Great details in here. I enjoy looking at all the different faces and the emotions. 10.</td>', 'Nice candid. I like the tilt. Great details in here. I enjoy looking at all the different faces and the emotions. 10.', '2005-02-22 11:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188380, 147329, 14448, '<td valign="top">Creatively strong -- those tracks make all the difference.  Fine composition.  Great exposure and focus.  Link to the bridge theme takes some staring to see and accept, but okay, I''m with you.  Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Creatively strong -- those tracks make all the difference.  Fine composition.  Great exposure and focus.  Link to the bridge theme takes some staring to see and accept, but okay, I''m with you.  Bumping to 8.', '2005-02-22 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188382, 147607, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the execution is not so good. The picture looks too flat, there are no outstanding elements. The harsh light emphasizes this impression. Your crop is good though. 4.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the execution is not so good. The picture looks too flat, there are no outstanding elements. The harsh light emphasizes this impression. Your crop is good though. 4.', '2005-02-22 12:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188385, 146258, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Good use of lines. 7.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Good use of lines. 7.', '2005-02-22 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188389, 146518, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''m surprised the image in the kaleidoscope remains sharp. Interesting crop. 7.</td>', 'Interesting. I''m surprised the image in the kaleidoscope remains sharp. Interesting crop. 7.', '2005-02-22 12:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188391, 147178, 27845, '<td valign="top">Really moody andf mystic. I like the guiding lines and how the bridge disappears in the mist. 10.</td>', 'Really moody andf mystic. I like the guiding lines and how the bridge disappears in the mist. 10.', '2005-02-22 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188393, 147553, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks great. The colours are gorgeous. The composition is well done, I like the fact that there''s a major element in the foreground and the cityscape in the background. How did you achieve that orange glow? 10.</td>', 'Looks great. The colours are gorgeous. The composition is well done, I like the fact that there''s a major element in the foreground and the cityscape in the background. How did you achieve that orange glow? 10.', '2005-02-22 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188396, 147197, 27845, '<td valign="top">There seem to be some famous bridges in this challenge. I''ve only just seen this bridge in another picture. I don''t like this one as much though. The colours are nice, but I don''t see how the tilt would add to this image, and the tree is rather distracting. 6.</td>', 'There seem to be some famous bridges in this challenge. I''ve only just seen this bridge in another picture. I don''t like this one as much though. The colours are nice, but I don''t see how the tilt would add to this image, and the tree is rather distracting. 6.', '2005-02-22 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188397, 147452, 27845, '<td valign="top">Slightly crooked, but well done. Something different from the other shots. You get an extra mark for creativity. 7.</td>', 'Slightly crooked, but well done. Something different from the other shots. You get an extra mark for creativity. 7.', '2005-02-22 12:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188402, 145731, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but why didn''t you comlete your title? Did you want to leave the choice to the spectator? Well, I guess there are many interpretations: Heaven, God, Light, the sky, Freedom. It meets the challenge, even though it doesn''t have anything to to with a bridge at first sight. 8.</td>', 'Nice picture, but why didn''t you comlete your title? Did you want to leave the choice to the spectator? Well, I guess there are many interpretations: Heaven, God, Light, the sky, Freedom. It meets the challenge, even though it doesn''t have anything to to with a bridge at first sight. 8.', '2005-02-22 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188404, 146590, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool textures, I like the rust. The strong lines add a lot to the image. 8.</td>', 'Cool textures, I like the rust. The strong lines add a lot to the image. 8.', '2005-02-22 12:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188414, 147140, 29739, '<td valign="top">It seems a little blurred, the building on the background is focused but I''d like to see the hole bridge also focused. Those lights on the bridge don''t help, maybe at another hour you have better lights, not so hard. I''d like to see another perspective of the bridge, cause the way this is done my sight goes to the building, I''d rather see the bridge itself. A new angle to see it though : ) Keep on it.</td>', 'It seems a little blurred, the building on the background is focused but I''d like to see the hole bridge also focused. Those lights on the bridge don''t help, maybe at another hour you have better lights, not so hard. I''d like to see another perspective of the bridge, cause the way this is done my sight goes to the building, I''d rather see the bridge itself. A new angle to see it though : ) Keep on it.', '2005-02-22 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188443, 147402, 30214, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...javascript: do_vote(6)<br/> 6</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...javascript: do_vote(6) 6', '2005-02-22 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188445, 147305, 25024, '<td valign="top">What beautiful graphic quality this has, a superb job</td>', 'What beautiful graphic quality this has, a superb job', '2005-02-22 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188448, 146045, 25024, '<td valign="top">There is an ephemeral quality to this - well done</td>', 'There is an ephemeral quality to this - well done', '2005-02-22 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188454, 147311, 25024, '<td valign="top">You''ve no control over the weather but a touch more mist would have made a lovely image even better - well done.</td>', 'You''ve no control over the weather but a touch more mist would have made a lovely image even better - well done.', '2005-02-22 12:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188456, 145823, 29148, '<td valign="top">Nice old-time effect. Very serene.</td>', 'Nice old-time effect. Very serene.', '2005-02-22 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188457, 147568, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and nice interpretation of the theme - deserves to do well</td>', 'Lovely lighting and nice interpretation of the theme - deserves to do well', '2005-02-22 12:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188458, 147507, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped representation of the theme - not too much bridge!</td>', 'Nicely cropped representation of the theme - not too much bridge!', '2005-02-22 12:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188461, 146524, 32513, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit washed out, I''d try using a faster shutter speed to keep the center tree from burning up.</td>', 'This seems a bit washed out, I''d try using a faster shutter speed to keep the center tree from burning up.', '2005-02-22 12:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188465, 147559, 25024, '<td valign="top">lovely use of an amazing lens- perhaps a little too closely cropped at the top?</td>', 'lovely use of an amazing lens- perhaps a little too closely cropped at the top?', '2005-02-22 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188466, 147618, 29148, '<td valign="top">Make a strong opening bid. I like your idea but wish you had added a little something else to make a stronger picture.</td>', 'Make a strong opening bid. I like your idea but wish you had added a little something else to make a stronger picture.', '2005-02-22 12:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188469, 147577, 25024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful graphic qualities here - it keeps you looking and looking again - well done</td>', 'Beautiful graphic qualities here - it keeps you looking and looking again - well done', '2005-02-22 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188470, 146430, 29148, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple. Good job.</td>', 'Clean and simple. Good job.', '2005-02-22 12:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188472, 145605, 29148, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2005-02-22 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188474, 146834, 29148, '<td valign="top">I like your perspecitive on this excellent architecture. I can''t decide if the stop sign detracts or not.</td>', 'I like your perspecitive on this excellent architecture. I can''t decide if the stop sign detracts or not.', '2005-02-22 12:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188478, 147178, 25024, '<td valign="top">I love this sort of shot - it works well, but not sure the tree adds anything but thats out of your control - well done</td>', 'I love this sort of shot - it works well, but not sure the tree adds anything but thats out of your control - well done', '2005-02-22 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188479, 147403, 33736, '<td valign="top">What a playscape this would make!  Engineering at its most artful best - loved it.</td>', 'What a playscape this would make!  Engineering at its most artful best - loved it.', '2005-02-22 12:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188481, 145592, 25024, '<td valign="top">love the atmospheric feel of this and the lighting</td>', 'love the atmospheric feel of this and the lighting', '2005-02-22 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188486, 147340, 25024, '<td valign="top">picture postcard job this - well done</td>', 'picture postcard job this - well done', '2005-02-22 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188487, 147606, 33736, '<td valign="top">Crossing is infinite - just loved this imagery.</td>', 'Crossing is infinite - just loved this imagery.', '2005-02-22 12:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188490, 146541, 29148, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of b&amp;w. The contrast is good.</td>', 'Excellent choice of b&w. The contrast is good.', '2005-02-22 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188491, 146231, 33736, '<td valign="top">Angels'' Harps? We all reach - Some make it.</td>', 'Angels'' Harps? We all reach - Some make it.', '2005-02-22 13:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188494, 147515, 25024, '<td valign="top">including the road on the right adds a lot to the image - well done</td>', 'including the road on the right adds a lot to the image - well done', '2005-02-22 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188498, 146485, 32111, '<td valign="top">To be honest, this isn''t a great shot in my opinion. This is for a few reasons: fussy background, slightly soft, strange lighting and major cliche. Of course, the last point is a matter of taste, but still doesn''t do it for me I''m afraid. Sorry!</td>', 'To be honest, this isn''t a great shot in my opinion. This is for a few reasons: fussy background, slightly soft, strange lighting and major cliche. Of course, the last point is a matter of taste, but still doesn''t do it for me I''m afraid. Sorry!', '2005-02-22 13:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188499, 147444, 32111, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot - wish I was there!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot - wish I was there!', '2005-02-22 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188504, 147567, 25024, '<td valign="top">nicely composition and capture</td>', 'nicely composition and capture', '2005-02-22 13:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188505, 147311, 32111, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Not totally sure about the border though.</td>', 'Great shot. Not totally sure about the border though.', '2005-02-22 13:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188513, 147395, 32111, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to take a photo of this before - tricky finding a spot where there isn''t a horrific chunk of concrete in the background!</td>', 'I''ve tried to take a photo of this before - tricky finding a spot where there isn''t a horrific chunk of concrete in the background!', '2005-02-22 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188532, 145807, 32513, '<td valign="top">This picture frame leads more towards the ship and not the bridge.</td>', 'This picture frame leads more towards the ship and not the bridge.', '2005-02-22 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188536, 146222, 15575, '<td valign="top">Wow nice view point...actually quite scary to look at if you''re afraid of heights lol</td>', 'Wow nice view point...actually quite scary to look at if you''re afraid of heights lol', '2005-02-22 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188542, 147158, 14448, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, wonderful contrasts and tones, good composition.</td>', 'Creative idea, wonderful contrasts and tones, good composition.', '2005-02-22 13:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188544, 147606, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The colors and reflection are excellent, but you need to lighten up on the dark areas.  Tweak your levels to show a bit more detail.</td>', 'Good concept. The colors and reflection are excellent, but you need to lighten up on the dark areas.  Tweak your levels to show a bit more detail.', '2005-02-22 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188548, 147587, 14448, '<td valign="top">Really funny, creative concept, and fine capture of the dog''s expression!  Recomposing could take this image from good to great, i.e., eliminate all the elements that don''t contribute to the story (the box on the floor, the wall hanging, light fixture, doorway), and make the Steak box more prominent in the frame so we can read it.  A mixed result this time, but keep at it!</td>', 'Really funny, creative concept, and fine capture of the dog''s expression!  Recomposing could take this image from good to great, i.e., eliminate all the elements that don''t contribute to the story (the box on the floor, the wall hanging, light fixture, doorway), and make the Steak box more prominent in the frame so we can read it.  A mixed result this time, but keep at it!', '2005-02-22 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188550, 147299, 33942, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, I haven''t been a photographer for very long, maybe this one is above me, but I don''t think that this is a very good photo. No good darks and no good lights. It looks like it''s been overexposed, then darkened.</td>', 'I don''t know, I haven''t been a photographer for very long, maybe this one is above me, but I don''t think that this is a very good photo. No good darks and no good lights. It looks like it''s been overexposed, then darkened.', '2005-02-22 13:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188554, 146941, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good idea. A more effective composition would be to crop in close on the couple.  That would emphasize their relationship much better.</td>', 'Good idea. A more effective composition would be to crop in close on the couple.  That would emphasize their relationship much better.', '2005-02-22 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188565, 147632, 30208, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow.  Makes it hard to see the detail of the bridge.</td>', 'Too much shadow.  Makes it hard to see the detail of the bridge.', '2005-02-22 13:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188567, 145605, 30208, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Lines (grid) also helps the view.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Lines (grid) also helps the view.', '2005-02-22 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188573, 146258, 15575, '<td valign="top">I like it, maybe if there were more footprints there would be even more interest in the photo? (i.e. go back at a busier time of day?)</td>', 'I like it, maybe if there were more footprints there would be even more interest in the photo? (i.e. go back at a busier time of day?)', '2005-02-22 13:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188577, 147299, 30208, '<td valign="top">Looks too washed out.</td>', 'Looks too washed out.', '2005-02-22 14:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188578, 146607, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm wood tones in this shot, evoking the old time world when things were built of wood, from the forest surrounding them.  I love the stone pillars.  Much better than my covered bridge entry in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful warm wood tones in this shot, evoking the old time world when things were built of wood, from the forest surrounding them.  I love the stone pillars.  Much better than my covered bridge entry in this challenge.', '2005-02-22 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188592, 146045, 29799, '<td valign="top">I have seen many pictures where the sky is that color. How did you get it to be that color? Did you use a filter?</td>', 'I have seen many pictures where the sky is that color. How did you get it to be that color? Did you use a filter?', '2005-02-22 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188611, 146208, 34019, '<td valign="top">Way too washed out.</td>', 'Way too washed out.', '2005-02-22 14:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188612, 146018, 34019, '<td valign="top">The digital noise is killing this</td>', 'The digital noise is killing this', '2005-02-22 14:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188615, 146593, 34019, '<td valign="top">Needs some major color correction</td>', 'Needs some major color correction', '2005-02-22 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188617, 147555, 34019, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and too much digital noise</td>', 'Out of focus and too much digital noise', '2005-02-22 14:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188641, 147424, 24970, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the railing in the foreground. Otherwise, this is a decent shot.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the railing in the foreground. Otherwise, this is a decent shot.', '2005-02-22 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188645, 146216, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an ironic sign to put in a cemetary. I think I''d like it better if it was not directly centered. Otherwise, nice job.</td>', 'Wow. What an ironic sign to put in a cemetary. I think I''d like it better if it was not directly centered. Otherwise, nice job.', '2005-02-22 15:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188646, 147436, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely set up picture, it has a good feel to it - especially the curve of the bride. Something about it looks really artificial though. The colors, maybe? Or amount of sharpening? I''m not really sure.</td>', 'This is a nicely set up picture, it has a good feel to it - especially the curve of the bride. Something about it looks really artificial though. The colors, maybe? Or amount of sharpening? I''m not really sure.', '2005-02-22 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188648, 147402, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I love the colors it creates.</td>', 'Great lighting, I love the colors it creates.', '2005-02-22 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188650, 147286, 25742, '<td valign="top">not many are going to get this bridge. Good luck</td>', 'not many are going to get this bridge. Good luck', '2005-02-22 15:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188660, 146634, 34019, '<td valign="top">nothing is in foucs, plus it needs color correction</td>', 'nothing is in foucs, plus it needs color correction', '2005-02-22 15:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188661, 146950, 34019, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2005-02-22 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188662, 147465, 34019, '<td valign="top">Nice perceptive.  Any way you could get another shoot on another support without the tree.  the piece would be much stronger without them.</td>', 'Nice perceptive.  Any way you could get another shoot on another support without the tree.  the piece would be much stronger without them.', '2005-02-22 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188665, 147158, 34019, '<td valign="top">Nice piece</td>', 'Nice piece', '2005-02-22 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188666, 147370, 34019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color work.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful color work.  Nice composition.', '2005-02-22 15:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1188669, 146958, 24970, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a little weird in this, but somehow I like it. Almost a painted feel.</td>', 'The colors seem a little weird in this, but somehow I like it. Almost a painted feel.', '2005-02-22 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
