(1188848, 145740, 24970, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, I give you credit for that. The image is pretty flat though, there''s not really anything that draws me in and makes me want to keep looking. Try experimenting with different lighting - the direct flash is pretty harsh and uneven - as well as angles to give it some depth.</td>', 'Unique idea, I give you credit for that. The image is pretty flat though, there''s not really anything that draws me in and makes me want to keep looking. Try experimenting with different lighting - the direct flash is pretty harsh and uneven - as well as angles to give it some depth.', '2005-02-22 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
