(1189354, 146758, 33736, '<td valign="top">The design of the bridge, the design of the trees - both quiet and strong, with the sky and waters giving support to both - wonderful picture. Thank you.</td>', 'The design of the bridge, the design of the trees - both quiet and strong, with the sky and waters giving support to both - wonderful picture. Thank you.', '2005-02-22 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189365, 147264, 33736, '<td valign="top">Catching the light exactly as you did (notice how it nearly mirrors the line of trees outside the bridge) made this a particularly lovely picture.  Even its slightly off-plumb state works in this instance.</td>', 'Catching the light exactly as you did (notice how it nearly mirrors the line of trees outside the bridge) made this a particularly lovely picture.  Even its slightly off-plumb state works in this instance.', '2005-02-22 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189384, 147619, 33736, '<td valign="top">Darn - my original comments were lost.  This picture is a set of individual areas that blend together wonderfully.  Not one line or shape or angle matches any other - yet together, they form a perfecly designed whole.  This should be a tutorial in design elements and composition.  It''s not spectacular - just spectacularly composed.</td>', 'Darn - my original comments were lost.  This picture is a set of individual areas that blend together wonderfully.  Not one line or shape or angle matches any other - yet together, they form a perfecly designed whole.  This should be a tutorial in design elements and composition.  It''s not spectacular - just spectacularly composed.', '2005-02-22 22:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189396, 147295, 33736, '<td valign="top">The curve of this design is terrific, but I particularly admired how you managed to mirrow the curve and color of the Opera House too.  The buildings and lighting elsewhere are busy and bright, but the two \"stars\" stand out on their own.</td>', 'The curve of this design is terrific, but I particularly admired how you managed to mirrow the curve and color of the Opera House too.  The buildings and lighting elsewhere are busy and bright, but the two \"stars\" stand out on their own.', '2005-02-22 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189403, 146740, 33736, '<td valign="top">This picture is among the most beautifully captured lighting in the the challenge - You have taught us that "Less is More" in a most effective way.</td>', 'This picture is among the most beautifully captured lighting in the the challenge - You have taught us that "Less is More" in a most effective way.', '2005-02-22 22:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189413, 146640, 33736, '<td valign="top">The engineer captured the beauty of the sail, and you captured the beauty of the engineer''s design.  Wonderful.</td>', 'The engineer captured the beauty of the sail, and you captured the beauty of the engineer''s design.  Wonderful.', '2005-02-22 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
