(1189478, 147502, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think the composition of this shot would be much stronger if you had taken it from the railing, rather than from behind it.  In addition, the focus is a bit soft (from the dim light, I''d imagine).  It would probably have served you well to use a tripod, if you didn''t, or to try a quicker shutter speed to give you a sharper shot.</td>', 'I think the composition of this shot would be much stronger if you had taken it from the railing, rather than from behind it.  In addition, the focus is a bit soft (from the dim light, I''d imagine).  It would probably have served you well to use a tripod, if you didn''t, or to try a quicker shutter speed to give you a sharper shot.', '2005-02-22 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
