(1190085, 147553, 23458, '<td valign="top">10 ones is indeed bizarre - this is a fantastic shot...I wonder whether some of the trolls got through the cracks. I''m curious though -must have been a bright night to get a shot this light out of an eight second exposure at midnight ? And I can''t figure out what that golden area is to one side of the bridge - I know it''s not the sunbecause a) the shot was taken at midnight and b) there are lights on the bridge?! Edit - I also know becaue I read one of your comments down below :). Whatever it is, it''s gorgeous and really adds to this shot. <br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-23 04:57:17.</i></td>', '10 ones is indeed bizarre - this is a fantastic shot...I wonder whether some of the trolls got through the cracks. I''m curious though -must have been a bright night to get a shot this light out of an eight second exposure at midnight ? And I can''t figure out what that golden area is to one side of the bridge - I know it''s not the sunbecause a) the shot was taken at midnight and b) there are lights on the bridge?! Edit - I also know becaue I read one of your comments down below :). Whatever it is, it''s gorgeous and really adds to this shot.  Congrats!', '2005-02-23 04:55:12.000000', '2005-02-23 04:57:17.000000', 0),
(1190088, 147604, 31637, '<td valign="top">It looks as if fog is what the people love!!  it was so so close. I think this was definatly one of the better shots and you were so close to a ribbon! Hey 4th place is incredible. You beat 414 photographers all over the world.. conrats</td>', 'It looks as if fog is what the people love!!  it was so so close. I think this was definatly one of the better shots and you were so close to a ribbon! Hey 4th place is incredible. You beat 414 photographers all over the world.. conrats', '2005-02-23 04:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
