(1190106, 147343, 24744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by drz01:</b></div><hr/><i> Great reflections! Is this a car or train bridge? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is the Forth Rail Bridge viewed from the north side of the Forth - it''s just to the north of Edinburgh.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i> Returning for comment. This photo looks ver neet. The exposure is good. I did notice one small flaw in the upper left hand and bottom right hand corner. It appears you rotated this.  You could of tried smudging them out </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yikes!  I totally failed to notice this on my monitor at home, it''s only looking at it on another computer that i spotted it at all.  That was careless of me :(<br/> <br/>Cheers for all the great comments folks - very much appreciated :)</td>', 'Originally posted by drz01: Great reflections! Is this a car or train bridge?  This is the Forth Rail Bridge viewed from the north side of the Forth - it''s just to the north of Edinburgh. Originally posted by RulerZigzag: Returning for comment. This photo looks ver neet. The exposure is good. I did notice one small flaw in the upper left hand and bottom right hand corner. It appears you rotated this.  You could of tried smudging them out  Yikes!  I totally failed to notice this on my monitor at home, it''s only looking at it on another computer that i spotted it at all.  That was careless of me :( Cheers for all the great comments folks - very much appreciated :)', '2005-02-23 05:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1190114, 146164, 26513, '<td valign="top">This is a great result for me! Thanks a lot for the comments.  Yeah i realised the policemen stood out a lot, but it was because of the labour conference week, security was very high and they were all over the place.  So i couldnt have taken the picture without them in it! thanks!</td>', 'This is a great result for me! Thanks a lot for the comments.  Yeah i realised the policemen stood out a lot, but it was because of the labour conference week, security was very high and they were all over the place.  So i couldnt have taken the picture without them in it! thanks!', '2005-02-23 05:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
