(1190135, 146217, 12571, '<td valign="top">I guess I got distracted by all the other things I liked at this location. I thought the bridge itself was structurally boring but I probably should have just let it speak for itself. We drove down to this bridge a few times during the week and this was the only day when we had some sun, unfortunately it blew the sky right out... Onwards to the next challenge.</td>', 'I guess I got distracted by all the other things I liked at this location. I thought the bridge itself was structurally boring but I probably should have just let it speak for itself. We drove down to this bridge a few times during the week and this was the only day when we had some sun, unfortunately it blew the sky right out... Onwards to the next challenge.', '2005-02-23 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
