(1191979, 145993, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Very unique in this challenge.  My problem is with the composition.  "I" would have placed the bridge,chord symbol in the lower left in order to show more of the musical notation(notes on the staff above and following the symbol.)  I think the main reason you didn''t place higher is because it''s not a regular bridge. Don''t get discouraged.  Everyone on the site will agree that your own satisfaction with the photo is more improtant than anything anyone else can say.</td>', 'Nice pic.  Very unique in this challenge.  My problem is with the composition.  "I" would have placed the bridge,chord symbol in the lower left in order to show more of the musical notation(notes on the staff above and following the symbol.)  I think the main reason you didn''t place higher is because it''s not a regular bridge. Don''t get discouraged.  Everyone on the site will agree that your own satisfaction with the photo is more improtant than anything anyone else can say.', '2005-02-23 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
