(1192404, 146460, 31319, '<td valign="top">Well, this challenge was a real eye-opener for me, and Ive been humbled by the experience.  <br/> <br/>I chose to approach this challenge from a metaphorical perspective and failed badly.  Ive come to understand, now, that this site approaches assignments quite literally.  Whether I package future challenges into that mindset remains to be seen. <br/> <br/>To boot, my submission was poor technically and compositionally; in my eagerness to participate in the challenge, I just didnt want to admit that.<br/> <br/>Despite the abysmally low rating this submission earned, I still emerged from this competition as a winner because of the lessons learned.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all who commented.<br/></td>', 'Well, this challenge was a real eye-opener for me, and Ive been humbled by the experience.   I chose to approach this challenge from a metaphorical perspective and failed badly.  Ive come to understand, now, that this site approaches assignments quite literally.  Whether I package future challenges into that mindset remains to be seen.  To boot, my submission was poor technically and compositionally; in my eagerness to participate in the challenge, I just didnt want to admit that. Despite the abysmally low rating this submission earned, I still emerged from this competition as a winner because of the lessons learned. Thanks to all who commented.', '2005-02-24 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
