(1192567, 147435, 31946, '<td valign="top">I made a few mistakes during editing... first of all I tried to get rid of some aliasing effects by blurring the image a little before scaling it down.  In retrospect I can tell that it made it seem more out of focus than it really is.  And the photo really is tilted.  Not sure why I didn''t notice these things earlier, but oh well, live and learn. :)</td>', 'I made a few mistakes during editing... first of all I tried to get rid of some aliasing effects by blurring the image a little before scaling it down.  In retrospect I can tell that it made it seem more out of focus than it really is.  And the photo really is tilted.  Not sure why I didn''t notice these things earlier, but oh well, live and learn. :)', '2005-02-24 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
