(1193337, 145889, 32997, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you saw/visioned here, but I am really drawn to the contained danger in this picture. I put my hand up to see if blocking the top rail out would help, and I can only say NO. The rocks almost have eyes, the water is mysterious, and the bars give the picture a context. Dramatic, and very appealing.</td>', 'I don''t know what you saw/visioned here, but I am really drawn to the contained danger in this picture. I put my hand up to see if blocking the top rail out would help, and I can only say NO. The rocks almost have eyes, the water is mysterious, and the bars give the picture a context. Dramatic, and very appealing.', '2005-02-24 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
