(1193776, 147503, 9581, '<td valign="top">LOL Now this is funny! I am talking about what you have there for the details.. :) I believe too there are enough guitar lovers here or musicians that would know what you were talking about. Hopefully the 11 that gave you 1''s will learn something they must not have known what a bridge was on  a guitar. I thought about doing a guitar too, but instead I entered my sons picture of a train. This one though is by far the nicest even if I had a done a guitar I couldnt get it to look like this .. I say that because I dont think I have ever seen a pattern design on a guitar like that nor do I have one :)  This is really nice too you did a good job. I also think its in good focus and the colors or stripes make it almost blend in the middle. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-25 03:11:59.</i></td>', 'LOL Now this is funny! I am talking about what you have there for the details.. :) I believe too there are enough guitar lovers here or musicians that would know what you were talking about. Hopefully the 11 that gave you 1''s will learn something they must not have known what a bridge was on  a guitar. I thought about doing a guitar too, but instead I entered my sons picture of a train. This one though is by far the nicest even if I had a done a guitar I couldnt get it to look like this .. I say that because I dont think I have ever seen a pattern design on a guitar like that nor do I have one :)  This is really nice too you did a good job. I also think its in good focus and the colors or stripes make it almost blend in the middle. ', '2005-02-25 03:09:29.000000', '2005-02-25 03:11:59.000000', 0),
