(1193794, 145886, 9581, '<td valign="top">Maybe if there was more focus going in the DOF here it would of scored better. This is a great view and the macro looks good with details in the focus area. Sometimes sharpen will make it not look in focus or it if you sharpen too much and you are playing with the pixels it takes it out of focus. Just my opinion so dont take me too seroius I  really like this its unique in its own way:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-25 03:22:52.</i></td>', 'Maybe if there was more focus going in the DOF here it would of scored better. This is a great view and the macro looks good with details in the focus area. Sometimes sharpen will make it not look in focus or it if you sharpen too much and you are playing with the pixels it takes it out of focus. Just my opinion so dont take me too seroius I  really like this its unique in its own way:)', '2005-02-25 03:22:00.000000', '2005-02-25 03:22:52.000000', 0),
