(1199579, 147551, 33732, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by antimethod:</b></div><hr/><i> really cool shot... the color and the structure emerging from a tangle is delicious. if only it were an advanced challenge to handle the top right corner. if you had cropped it a bit on the top for this challenge, however, i bet you could have pulled off a few more points. first impression is great though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My first time for this.  The tree limb in the corner is distracting.</td>', 'Originally posted by antimethod: really cool shot... the color and the structure emerging from a tangle is delicious. if only it were an advanced challenge to handle the top right corner. if you had cropped it a bit on the top for this challenge, however, i bet you could have pulled off a few more points. first impression is great though.   My first time for this.  The tree limb in the corner is distracting.', '2005-02-28 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
