(1210355, 147402, 30861, '<td valign="top">I just ran across this one, gave it an 8 in the challenge, just now realized it was yours. Really nice, moody shot you made here. Very good work.</td>', 'I just ran across this one, gave it an 8 in the challenge, just now realized it was yours. Really nice, moody shot you made here. Very good work.', '2005-03-06 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
