(1213499, 146923, 31637, '<td valign="top">this composition is phenomenal. I loved this photo, gave it an 8 originally....keep up the good work!</td>', 'this composition is phenomenal. I loved this photo, gave it an 8 originally....keep up the good work!', '2005-03-07 19:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1214475, 147527, 33654, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love that bridge! I was born and raised in Columbus and have ALWAYS loved the architecture there. This is a great pic of the new bridge. Great job!</td>', 'I absolutely love that bridge! I was born and raised in Columbus and have ALWAYS loved the architecture there. This is a great pic of the new bridge. Great job!', '2005-03-08 08:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1215985, 147541, 33362, '<td valign="top">ahh.. yes. This is how I get to beach on Fire Island. <br/>Very nice shot.</td>', 'ahh.. yes. This is how I get to beach on Fire Island. Very nice shot.', '2005-03-08 22:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1219086, 147329, 34598, '<td valign="top">great job dude. Almost feel as if i was there with ya!</td>', 'great job dude. Almost feel as if i was there with ya!', '2005-03-10 01:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1220843, 147553, 34604, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Your a great photographer!</td>', 'I love this shot. Your a great photographer!', '2005-03-10 20:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1221480, 147553, 32285, '<td valign="top">This is a WONDERFUL shot!  I can see why it got a ribbon. The lighting and the composition are outstanding!</td>', 'This is a WONDERFUL shot!  I can see why it got a ribbon. The lighting and the composition are outstanding!', '2005-03-11 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1223954, 147553, 29079, '<td valign="top">Amazing how you captured the lights and colours, well deserved ribbon</td>', 'Amazing how you captured the lights and colours, well deserved ribbon', '2005-03-13 04:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225921, 147509, 2798, '<td valign="top">Actually I would have liked the title "two bridges" - it''s a clever play on the challenge title and it describes the image.<br/> <br/>This is an excellently chosen scene. Well framed at the top and with good, interesting subjects for the eye to land on. I find my eye going back and forth between the two bridges.<br/> <br/>There is a colour problem with this image, There''s a clear red/brown cast to all the midtones and it''s just visible in some of the sky highlights. And again there''s a grainy lack of detail that I''m starting to suspect is down to your camera.</td>', 'Actually I would have liked the title "two bridges" - it''s a clever play on the challenge title and it describes the image. This is an excellently chosen scene. Well framed at the top and with good, interesting subjects for the eye to land on. I find my eye going back and forth between the two bridges. There is a colour problem with this image, There''s a clear red/brown cast to all the midtones and it''s just visible in some of the sky highlights. And again there''s a grainy lack of detail that I''m starting to suspect is down to your camera.', '2005-03-14 04:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1226714, 145410, 13381, '<td valign="top">Gordon,<br/> <br/>Your Austin bridge shots are always technically superb.  I find myself trying to emulate them quite a lot, but never to quite the same effect.</td>', 'Gordon, Your Austin bridge shots are always technically superb.  I find myself trying to emulate them quite a lot, but never to quite the same effect.', '2005-03-14 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1228597, 147197, 34036, '<td valign="top">i like this shot its great color</td>', 'i like this shot its great color', '2005-03-15 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1233897, 147015, 30760, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely stunning and beautiful. Seriously, it almost made me shed a tear. Stunning. I''d buy the print, but everyone would just ask if it was my photo and I''d get embarrassed. :)</td>', 'This is absolutely stunning and beautiful. Seriously, it almost made me shed a tear. Stunning. I''d buy the print, but everyone would just ask if it was my photo and I''d get embarrassed. :)', '2005-03-17 04:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1235440, 146308, 35122, '<td valign="top">hey Rex...love this pic....the bridge is awesome as is the lighting...very nice!!!</td>', 'hey Rex...love this pic....the bridge is awesome as is the lighting...very nice!!!', '2005-03-17 22:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1253832, 146308, 29797, '<td valign="top">I like the way you chose to go on the darker side of the bridge, it gives good contrast to the light on the pillars. Try a little unsharp mask (or equivalent in another program) and it will really pop.</td>', 'I like the way you chose to go on the darker side of the bridge, it gives good contrast to the light on the pillars. Try a little unsharp mask (or equivalent in another program) and it will really pop.', '2005-03-28 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1266204, 147281, 31451, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Is it just me but this reminds me of the classic James Dean photo (Broadway in the snow). Very nice!</td>', 'Great shot. Is it just me but this reminds me of the classic James Dean photo (Broadway in the snow). Very nice!', '2005-04-02 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1285373, 146954, 30018, '<td valign="top">This image is perfect in B&amp;W.  The stains on the side of the bridge make me think of all the blood spilled in this battle.  Congrats on a Great capture.</td>', 'This image is perfect in B&W.  The stains on the side of the bridge make me think of all the blood spilled in this battle.  Congrats on a Great capture.', '2005-04-12 07:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1287838, 146233, 23478, '<td valign="top">Easily on of my favorite photos to shot in a long time.  It was a fun take on the challenge, since I do not have any interesting bridges within a couple thousand miles.  So, I was being creative and thinking outside the box.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.  I shot this in extremely low light and had to lighten it on the post processing that made it hard to avoid artifacting.</td>', 'Easily on of my favorite photos to shot in a long time.  It was a fun take on the challenge, since I do not have any interesting bridges within a couple thousand miles.  So, I was being creative and thinking outside the box.   Thanks for all the comments.  I shot this in extremely low light and had to lighten it on the post processing that made it hard to avoid artifacting.', '2005-04-13 07:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1291495, 147515, 31955, '<td valign="top">This looks like a my local road bridge. Very spooky. This is the highest voted picture for your camera. Nice one.</td>', 'This looks like a my local road bridge. Very spooky. This is the highest voted picture for your camera. Nice one.', '2005-04-14 11:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1291702, 147515, 31738, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by justinbrook:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks like a my local road bridge. Very spooky. This is the highest voted picture for your camera. Nice one. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments Justin. =)</td>', 'Originally posted by justinbrook: This looks like a my local road bridge. Very spooky. This is the highest voted picture for your camera. Nice one.   Thanks for your comments Justin. =)', '2005-04-14 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1296666, 147553, 31955, '<td valign="top">Wow man look at all the comments. This is damn good. Fast becoming one of my fav bridges.</td>', 'Wow man look at all the comments. This is damn good. Fast becoming one of my fav bridges.', '2005-04-16 17:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1306317, 147553, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is perfect timing for this shot.   The atmospheric conditions and the lighting work perfectly together and your composition is also very nice.  I know it''s probably naturally that way, but I might be tempted to rotate just a bit counter clockwise to even up that shoreline/horizon area - but that''s nitpicking.</td>', 'This is perfect timing for this shot.   The atmospheric conditions and the lighting work perfectly together and your composition is also very nice.  I know it''s probably naturally that way, but I might be tempted to rotate just a bit counter clockwise to even up that shoreline/horizon area - but that''s nitpicking.', '2005-04-19 23:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1316909, 147015, 6943, '<td valign="top">This is great photo, deserving of its ribbon. I love the composition and the colors in this.</td>', 'This is great photo, deserving of its ribbon. I love the composition and the colors in this.', '2005-04-24 03:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1319017, 147442, 6943, '<td valign="top">--DOUBLE POST...SORRY--<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-24 14:07:36.</i></td>', '--DOUBLE POST...SORRY--', '2005-04-24 15:07:06.000000', '2005-04-24 15:07:36.000000', 0),
(1319018, 147442, 6943, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, guess it pays to wait for just the right moment</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, guess it pays to wait for just the right moment', '2005-04-24 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1325240, 145945, 31738, '<td valign="top">Great night shot.</td>', 'Great night shot.', '2005-04-25 18:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1342715, 146308, 24789, '<td valign="top">Greetings,<br/>   I have to agree with telehubbie, I think some USM especially on those front left rocks would help greatly, other than that, and perhaps the use of a polarizer to make the sky "pop" a bit more this is a great image.<br/> <br/>mike<br/><a href="//www.mikefairbanks.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.mikefairbanks.com</a> <br/></td>', 'Greetings,   I have to agree with telehubbie, I think some USM especially on those front left rocks would help greatly, other than that, and perhaps the use of a polarizer to make the sky "pop" a bit more this is a great image. mike//www.mikefairbanks.com ', '2005-04-29 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1381467, 147442, 25347, '<td valign="top">woah, look out.  barring this one, 50 comments and 5 favorites.  Quite the trend.</td>', 'woah, look out.  barring this one, 50 comments and 5 favorites.  Quite the trend.', '2005-05-12 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1389808, 146308, 37005, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for shots that aren''t overdone in Photoshop.  I enjoy the reflection in the water as well as the light graduation from the pillars (from dark to light).  If you were to decide to Photoshop this baby I think the sky could use more saturation.  Other than that I think this shot is fine...the lighting couldn''t have been any better for you.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for shots that aren''t overdone in Photoshop.  I enjoy the reflection in the water as well as the light graduation from the pillars (from dark to light).  If you were to decide to Photoshop this baby I think the sky could use more saturation.  Other than that I think this shot is fine...the lighting couldn''t have been any better for you.', '2005-05-16 19:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1398377, 147015, 37005, '<td valign="top">Easily one of my favorite shots.  Beautious!</td>', 'Easily one of my favorite shots.  Beautious!', '2005-05-19 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1398472, 147568, 37961, '<td valign="top">Some seriously good photos here. I love your combination of subjects and light. Fabulous!<br/> <br/>Bridging the Gap is one of my favorites.</td>', 'Some seriously good photos here. I love your combination of subjects and light. Fabulous! Bridging the Gap is one of my favorites.', '2005-05-19 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1426253, 147533, 32721, '<td valign="top">hi just saw your picture,very cool. i''ve had my fujifine pix s5000<br/>for over a year, and have just started to really play with it. my question is - i''m having trouble getting the stutter speed that you achieved i can only get 1/200 - 1/160. do you have any ideas?<br/> <br/>Andy</td>', 'hi just saw your picture,very cool. i''ve had my fujifine pix s5000for over a year, and have just started to really play with it. my question is - i''m having trouble getting the stutter speed that you achieved i can only get 1/200 - 1/160. do you have any ideas? Andy', '2005-06-01 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1467907, 147490, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Nicely composed with delicious colors and super lighting.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Nicely composed with delicious colors and super lighting.', '2005-06-20 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1472043, 147259, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot.  Great angle.  Nice lighting and color.</td>', 'This is a superb shot.  Great angle.  Nice lighting and color.', '2005-06-21 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1479501, 147585, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. The overall composition is quite nice. I like the contrast and the reflection. What did it look like in color?</td>', 'This is lovely. The overall composition is quite nice. I like the contrast and the reflection. What did it look like in color?', '2005-06-23 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 0),
