(1500442, 145605, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love shots with angles like this...very inspiring and unique. :)</td>', 'I love shots with angles like this...very inspiring and unique. :)', '2005-07-02 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1501428, 147503, 2553, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL SHOT!  True, better focus on the bridge would have made this a standout, but what can you do?  Great interpretation and execution of concept, the composition is great.<br/> <br/>Linda</td>', 'VERY COOL SHOT!  True, better focus on the bridge would have made this a standout, but what can you do?  Great interpretation and execution of concept, the composition is great. Linda', '2005-07-03 09:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1557762, 147444, 22734, '<td valign="top">Got to place this image in my fav. Looking at it again it stirs pleasant feelings because it has the quality of a surreal study.</td>', 'Got to place this image in my fav. Looking at it again it stirs pleasant feelings because it has the quality of a surreal study.', '2005-07-23 20:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1557827, 147444, 20462, '<td valign="top">i am adding to favs as well, for it reminds me of a place I think we would all like to be at one time or another.</td>', 'i am adding to favs as well, for it reminds me of a place I think we would all like to be at one time or another.', '2005-07-23 20:55:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1558719, 147533, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. I just stumbled across it.  The single figure''s silhouette at the end of the bridge opening is terrific. The filter you used is just the right one to evoke the nostalgic mood.  Great title too.</td>', 'This is wonderful. I just stumbled across it.  The single figure''s silhouette at the end of the bridge opening is terrific. The filter you used is just the right one to evoke the nostalgic mood.  Great title too.', '2005-07-24 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1558720, 147429, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  So rich, yet realistic and not overdone.  I like the perspective of this shot very much.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  So rich, yet realistic and not overdone.  I like the perspective of this shot very much.', '2005-07-24 12:46:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1574212, 145790, 27164, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of leading lines to add interest.  Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Wonderful use of leading lines to add interest.  Beautiful photo.', '2005-07-30 13:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1586209, 147259, 25355, '<td valign="top">Missed this one in voting, but that''s a bridge I know well. However, in my lifetime, I''d say I crossed King''s Ave Bridge a lot more often. Nice shot of it.</td>', 'Missed this one in voting, but that''s a bridge I know well. However, in my lifetime, I''d say I crossed King''s Ave Bridge a lot more often. Nice shot of it.', '2005-08-04 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1589120, 147604, 13749, '<td valign="top">I agree - you got robbed! I like this much more than any of the ribboners, for sure.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I agree - you got robbed! I like this much more than any of the ribboners, for sure.  Beautiful.', '2005-08-05 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1591116, 147015, 37234, '<td valign="top">I just discovered this shot, today. What a great one. It''s hard to believe I make this drive nearly every day and have never seen it from this angle. I''m going to have to make a pit-stop at the golf course.</td>', 'I just discovered this shot, today. What a great one. It''s hard to believe I make this drive nearly every day and have never seen it from this angle. I''m going to have to make a pit-stop at the golf course.', '2005-08-06 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1650936, 146457, 38267, '<td valign="top">Looks like you really captured the mood of the weather with this picture.  I''m surprised you also didn''t do better with this entry.  Almost 70 votes under 5, when you should have gotten at least 7''s or higher.  People tend to vote higher on the bright and flashy pictures here, so maybe people didn''t like the color and mood, but I think they are both really cool.</td>', 'Looks like you really captured the mood of the weather with this picture.  I''m surprised you also didn''t do better with this entry.  Almost 70 votes under 5, when you should have gotten at least 7''s or higher.  People tend to vote higher on the bright and flashy pictures here, so maybe people didn''t like the color and mood, but I think they are both really cool.', '2005-08-28 00:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1705584, 146661, 15574, '<td valign="top">Great colors, there is blue everywhere! Looks like you also found the right time of day to bring out the right colors.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-13 22:09:26.</i></td>', 'Great colors, there is blue everywhere! Looks like you also found the right time of day to bring out the right colors.', '2005-09-13 23:08:00.000000', '2005-09-13 23:09:26.000000', 0),
(1730588, 147015, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m going to try to replicate this shot tomorrow morning (9/23/05)!  don''t know which challenge i''ll try to shoe-horn it into, though ;-)<br/> <br/>is there anywhere else around here to take pictures?</td>', 'i''m going to try to replicate this shot tomorrow morning (9/23/05)!  don''t know which challenge i''ll try to shoe-horn it into, though ;-) is there anywhere else around here to take pictures?', '2005-09-22 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1736716, 147302, 44854, '<td valign="top">It is funny how often the bridges we build turn into historical sites to be admired, while the pictures we paint just become an asset to be auctioned.</td>', 'It is funny how often the bridges we build turn into historical sites to be admired, while the pictures we paint just become an asset to be auctioned.', '2005-09-25 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1736887, 147015, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i>is there anywhere else around here to take pictures? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yeah - go about 10 miles due West of that bridge. LOL (you can swim right?)<br/>Tomorrow will be a blast at the Wild Animal Park though.</td>', 'Originally posted by skiprow:is there anywhere else around here to take pictures?  Yeah - go about 10 miles due West of that bridge. LOL (you can swim right?)Tomorrow will be a blast at the Wild Animal Park though.', '2005-09-25 05:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747495, 146862, 39243, '<td valign="top">doing some research for the "your corner of the world II" and if I had been a member at the time would have given you an 8! great shot.</td>', 'doing some research for the "your corner of the world II" and if I had been a member at the time would have given you an 8! great shot.', '2005-09-29 03:30:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1883028, 146758, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks so much like Winter in the North.  I like it.</td>', 'Wow, this looks so much like Winter in the North.  I like it.', '2005-11-19 15:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023917, 147015, 7969, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, comp really leads you into the pic</td>', 'very nice shot, comp really leads you into the pic', '2006-01-10 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030146, 147604, 40718, '<td valign="top">So I''ve only been in this area for 6 months now, but I had gone over this bridge going out to that crazy pumpkin patch in the fall.  It immediately caught my eye.  Coming from Pittsburgh, I thought I had left most "cool" bridges behind.  I''m gonna have to go shoot this.  You have a great capture here.  I love the gradient fog.</td>', 'So I''ve only been in this area for 6 months now, but I had gone over this bridge going out to that crazy pumpkin patch in the fall.  It immediately caught my eye.  Coming from Pittsburgh, I thought I had left most "cool" bridges behind.  I''m gonna have to go shoot this.  You have a great capture here.  I love the gradient fog.', '2006-01-12 13:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2144733, 145790, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Congrats on your 6th place</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Congrats on your 6th place', '2006-02-12 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2262025, 147015, 23394, '<td valign="top">still one of the best shots on the site.  so glad this one will remain.</td>', 'still one of the best shots on the site.  so glad this one will remain.', '2006-03-27 01:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271683, 145790, 55480, '<td valign="top">I honetstly cannot believe that this image did not win the blue. I just saw the results of the competition and I think this was the winner by far. Beautiful.</td>', 'I honetstly cannot believe that this image did not win the blue. I just saw the results of the competition and I think this was the winner by far. Beautiful.', '2006-03-29 21:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2459680, 146954, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines in this shot and I think it works very well in B/W.  I probably would have bumped up the contrast a bit and done some dodging/burning (if it were advanced editing) - but then again I tend to overdo both of those things!  LOL  Great capture.</td>', 'Great leading lines in this shot and I think it works very well in B/W.  I probably would have bumped up the contrast a bit and done some dodging/burning (if it were advanced editing) - but then again I tend to overdo both of those things!  LOL  Great capture.', '2006-05-26 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2479275, 147178, 59961, '<td valign="top">awesome atmospheric, foreboding, I aint crossing that!!</td>', 'awesome atmospheric, foreboding, I aint crossing that!!', '2006-06-02 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2522039, 147223, 14414, '<td valign="top">Love the blue of the star and sky against the almost B&amp;W of the bridge</td>', 'Love the blue of the star and sky against the almost B&W of the bridge', '2006-06-16 07:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2548637, 147311, 29748, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.', '2006-06-24 12:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
